msgid ""
"Do not read any configuration files.  This can only be used as the first "
"option given on the command-line."
msgstr ""
"Läs inga konfigurationsfiler. Detta kan bara användas som första alternativ "
"på kommandoraden."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1353 ../scripts/chdist.pl:62 ../scripts/salsa.pl:60
msgid "COMMANDS"
msgstr "KOMMANDON"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1355
msgid ""
"For full details about the commands, see the BTS documentation.  "
"L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/server-control>"
msgstr ""
"Fullständig information om kommandona finns i BTS-dokumentationen. "
"L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/server-control>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1360
msgid ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [I<bug_number> | I<package> | I<maintainer> | B<:> ] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [I<bug_number> | I<package> | I<maintainer> | B<:> ] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1362
msgid ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [I<bug number> | I<package> | I<maintainer> | B<:> ] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [I<bug number> | I<package> | I<maintainer> | B<:> ] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1364
msgid ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [B<src:>I<package> | B<from:>I<submitter>] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [B<src:>I<package> | B<from:>I<submitter>] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1366
msgid ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [B<src:>I<package> | B<from:>I<submitter>] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [B<src:>I<package> | B<from:>I<submitter>] "
"[I<opt>B<=>I<val> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1368
msgid ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> ] [I<opt>B<=>I<val> "
"...]"
msgstr ""
"B<bugs> [I<options>] [B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> ] [I<opt>B<=>I<val> "
"...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1370
msgid ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> ] [I<opt>B<=>I<val> "
"...]"
msgstr ""
"B<show> [I<options>] [B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> ] [I<opt>B<=>I<val> "
"...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1372
msgid "B<bugs> [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | B<RC>]"
msgstr "B<bugs> [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | B<RC>]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1374
msgid "B<show> [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | B<RC>]"
msgstr "B<show> [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | B<RC>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1376
msgid ""
"Display selected bugs in a web browser (default or B<--web>) or in a mail "
"reader when B<--mbox> is given."
msgstr ""
"Visa valda felrapporter i en webbläsare (standard eller B<--web>) eller i en"
" e-postläsare när B<--mbox> anges."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1379
msgid ""
"Options that may be specified after the B<bugs> sub-command in addition to "
"or instead of options at the start of the command-line are: "
"B<-o>/B<--offline>/B<--online>, B<-m>/B<--mbox>, B<--mailreader> and "
"B<-->[B<no->]B<cache>.  These are described earlier in this manpage.  If "
"either the B<-o> or B<--offline> option is used, or there is already an up-"
"to-date copy in the local cache, the cached version will be used."
msgstr ""
"Alternativ som kan anges efter underkommandot B<bugs>, utöver eller i "
"stället för alternativ i början av kommandoraden, är "
"B<-o>/B<--offline>/B<--online>, B<-m>/B<--mbox>, B<--mailreader> och "
"B<-->[B<no->]B<cache>. De beskrivs tidigare i denna manualsida. Om antingen "
"B<-o> eller B<--offline> används, eller om en uppdaterad kopia redan finns i"
" den lokala cachen, används den cachelagrade versionen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1386
msgid ""
"When using B<--mbox> reading more than one bug report's mails at once using "
"the argument syntax described below is possible."
msgstr ""
"När B<--mbox> används går det att läsa e-post för fler än en felrapport åt "
"gången med argumentsyntaxen som beskrivs nedan."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1389
msgid "The meanings of the possible arguments are as follows:"
msgstr "Betydelsen av de möjliga argumenten är följande:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1393
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(inget)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1395
msgid ""
"If nothing is specified, B<bts bugs> will display your bugs, assuming that "
"either B<DEBEMAIL> or B<EMAIL> (examined in that order) is set to the "
"appropriate email address."
msgstr ""
"Om inget anges visar B<bts bugs> dina felrapporter, förutsatt att antingen "
"B<DEBEMAIL> eller B<EMAIL> (i den ordningen) är satt till korrekt "
"e-postadress."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1399
msgid "I<bug_number>"
msgstr "I<bug_number>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1401
msgid "Display bug number I<bug_number>."
msgstr "Visa felnummer I<bug_number>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1403
msgid "I<package>"
msgstr "I<package>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1405
msgid "Display the bugs for the package I<package>."
msgstr "Visa felrapporter för paketet I<package>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1407
msgid "B<src:>I<package>"
msgstr "B<src:>I<package>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1409
msgid "Display the bugs for the source package I<package>."
msgstr "Visa felrapporter för källpaketet I<package>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1411
msgid "I<maintainer>"
msgstr "I<maintainer>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1413
msgid "Display the bugs for the maintainer email address I<maintainer>."
msgstr "Visa felrapporter för underhållarens e-postadress I<maintainer>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1415
msgid "B<from:>I<submitter>"
msgstr "B<from:>I<submitter>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1417
msgid "Display the bugs for the submitter email address I<submitter>."
msgstr "Visa felrapporter för insändarens e-postadress I<submitter>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1419
msgid "B<tag:>I<tag>"
msgstr "B<tag:>I<tag>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1421
msgid "Display the bugs which are tagged with I<tag>."
msgstr "Visa felrapporter som är taggade med I<tag>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1423
msgid "B<usertag:>I<tag>"
msgstr "B<usertag:>I<tag>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1425
msgid ""
"Display the bugs which are tagged with usertag I<tag>.  See the BTS "
"documentation for more information on usertags.  This will require the use "
"of a B<users=>I<email> option."
msgstr ""
"Visa felrapporter som är taggade med användartaggen I<tag>. Se BTS-"
"dokumentationen för mer information om användartaggar. Detta kräver "
"alternativet B<users=>I<email>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1429
msgid "B<:>"
msgstr "B<:>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1431
msgid ""
"Details of the bug tracking system itself, along with a bug-request page "
"with more options than this script, can be found on "
"https://bugs.debian.org/.  This page itself will be opened if the command "
"'bts bugs :' is used."
msgstr ""
"Information om själva felspårningssystemet och en felrapportsida med fler "
"alternativ än detta skript finns på https://bugs.debian.org/. Den sidan "
"öppnas om kommandot 'bts bugs :' används."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1436
msgid "B<release-critical>, B<RC>"
msgstr "B<release-critical>, B<RC>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1438
msgid ""
"Display the front page of the release-critical pages on the BTS.  This is a "
"synonym for https://bugs.debian.org/release-critical/index.html.  It is also"
" possible to say release-critical/debian/main.html and the like.  RC is a "
"synonym for release-critical/other/all.html."
msgstr ""
"Visa startsidan för BTS:s releasekritiska sidor. Detta är en synonym för "
"https://bugs.debian.org/release-critical/index.html.  Det går även att ange "
"release-critical/debian/main.html och liknande.  RC är en synonym för "
"release-critical/other/all.html."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1445
msgid ""
"After the argument specifying what to display, you can optionally specify "
"options to use to format the page or change what it displayed.  These are "
"passed to the BTS in the URL downloaded. For example, pass dist=stable to "
"see bugs affecting the stable version of a package, version=1.0 to see bugs "
"affecting that version of a package, or reverse=yes to display newest "
"messages first in a bug log."
msgstr ""
"Efter argumentet som anger vad som ska visas kan du valfritt ange alternativ"
" för att formatera sidan eller ändra vad den visar. De skickas till BTS i "
"den hämtade URL:en. Använd till exempel dist=stable för att se felrapporter "
"som påverkar den stabila versionen av ett paket, version=1.0 för att se "
"felrapporter som påverkar den versionen av ett paket eller reverse=yes för "
"att visa de senaste meddelandena först i en felrapportslogg."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1452
msgid ""
"If caching has been enabled (that is, B<--no-cache> has not been used, and "
"B<BTS_CACHE> has not been set to B<no>), then any page requested by B<bts "
"show> will automatically be cached, and be available offline thereafter.  "
"Pages which are automatically cached in this way will be deleted on "
"subsequent \"B<bts show>|B<bugs>|B<cache>\" invocations if they have not "
"been accessed in 30 days.  Warning: on a filesystem mounted with the "
"\"noatime\" option, running \"B<bts show>|B<bugs>\" does not update the "
"cache files' access times; a cached bug will then be subject to auto-"
"cleaning 30 days after its initial download, even if it has been accessed in"
" the meantime."
msgstr ""
"Om cachelagring har aktiverats (det vill säga att B<--no-cache> inte har "
"använts och B<BTS_CACHE> inte satts till B<no>) cachelagras alla sidor som "
"begärs av B<bts show> automatiskt och blir sedan tillgängliga offline. Sidor"
" som cachelagras automatiskt på detta sätt tas bort vid senare anrop av "
"\"B<bts show>|B<bugs>|B<cache>\" om de inte använts på 30 dagar. Varning: på"
" ett filsystem monterat med alternativet \"noatime\" uppdateras inte "
"cachefilernas åtkomsttider när \"B<bts show>|B<bugs>\" körs. En cachelagrad "
"felrapport rensas då automatiskt 30 dagar efter första hämtningen, även om "
"den använts under tiden."

#. type: =for
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1463
msgid "comment =head2 Execution of Subsequent Commands"
msgstr "comment =head2 Execution of Subsequent Commands"

#. type: =for
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1465
msgid ""
"comment TODO: https://salsa.debian.org/debian/sensible-"
"utils/-/merge_requests/14"
msgstr ""
"comment TODO: https://salsa.debian.org/debian/sensible-"
"utils/-/merge_requests/14"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1467
msgid ""
"Other B<bts> commands following on the command-line will be executed after "
"sensible-browser has quit. With most post modern graphical browsers "
"(firefox, chromium) will exit immediately, but when using a terminal browser"
" B<bts> wait for you to quit it before continuing command execution."
msgstr ""
"Efterföljande B<bts>-kommandon på kommandoraden körs efter att sensible-"
"browser har avslutats. De flesta moderna grafiska webbläsare (firefox, "
"chromium) avslutas omedelbart, men när en terminalwebbläsare används väntar "
"B<bts> tills du avslutar den innan kommandoexekveringen fortsätter."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1472
msgid ""
"The desired browser can be specified and configured by setting the "
"B<BROWSER> environment variable. See L<sensible-browser(1)>."
msgstr ""
"Den önskade webbläsaren kan anges och konfigureras genom att ställa in "
"miljövariabeln B<BROWSER>. Se L<sensible-browser(1)>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1475
msgid ""
"The value of B<BROWSER> may consist of a colon-separated series of browser "
"command parts. These should be tried in order until one succeeds. Each "
"command part may optionally contain the string B<%s>; if it does, the URL to"
" be viewed is substituted there. If a command part does not contain B<%s>, "
"the browser is to be launched as if the URL had been supplied as its first "
"argument. The string B<%%> must be substituted as a single %."
msgstr ""
"Värdet för B<BROWSER> kan bestå av en kolonseparerad serie kommandodelar för"
" webbläsare. De ska prövas i ordning tills ett lyckas. Varje kommandodel kan"
" valfritt innehålla strängen B<%s>; om den gör det ersätts den med URL:en "
"som ska visas. Om en kommandodel inte innehåller B<%s> startas webbläsaren "
"som om URL:en hade angetts som första argument. Strängen B<%%> måste "
"ersättas med ett enda %."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1483
msgid ""
"Rationale: We need to be able to specify multiple browser commands so "
"programs obeying this convention can do the right thing in either X or "
"console environments, trying X first. Specifying multiple commands may also "
"be useful for people who share files like F<.profile> across multiple "
"systems. We need B<%s> because some popular browsers have remote-invocation "
"syntax that requires it. Unless B<%%> reduces to %, it won't be possible to "
"have a literal B<%s> in the string."
msgstr ""
"Motivering: Vi behöver kunna ange flera webbläsarkommandon så att program "
"som följer denna konvention kan göra rätt i både X- och konsolmiljöer genom "
"att först försöka med X. Flera kommandon kan också vara användbara för "
"personer som delar filer som F<.profile> mellan flera system. Vi behöver "
"B<%s> eftersom vissa populära webbläsare har syntax för fjärranrop som "
"kräver det. Om B<%%> inte reduceras till % går det inte att ha ett "
"bokstavligt B<%s> i strängen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1556
msgid "B<select> [I<key>B<:>I<value> ...]"
msgstr "B<select> [I<key>B<:>I<value> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1558
msgid ""
"Uses the SOAP interface to output a list of bugs which match the given "
"selection requirements."
msgstr ""
"Använder SOAP-gränssnittet för att skriva ut en lista över felrapporter som "
"uppfyller de angivna urvalskraven."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1561
msgid "The following keys are allowed, and may be given multiple times."
msgstr "Följande nycklar är tillåtna och kan anges flera gånger."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1565 ../scripts/bts.pl:3082
#: ../scripts/who-permits-upload.pl:92
msgid "B<package>"
msgstr "B<package>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1567 ../scripts/bts.pl:3084
msgid "Binary package name."
msgstr "Binärt paketnamn."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1569 ../scripts/bts.pl:3086
msgid "B<source>"
msgstr "B<source>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1571 ../scripts/bts.pl:3088
msgid "Source package name."
msgstr "Källpaketnamn."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1573
msgid "B<maintainer>"
msgstr "B<maintainer>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1575
msgid "E-mail address of the maintainer."
msgstr "Underhållarens e-postadress."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1577 ../scripts/bts.pl:3066
msgid "B<submitter>"
msgstr "B<submitter>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1579 ../scripts/bts.pl:3068
msgid "E-mail address of the submitter."
msgstr "Insändarens e-postadress."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1581 ../scripts/bts.pl:3094
msgid "B<severity>"
msgstr "B<severity>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1583 ../scripts/bts.pl:3096
msgid "Bug severity."
msgstr "Felrapportens allvarlighetsgrad."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1585
msgid "B<status>"
msgstr "B<status>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1587
msgid ""
"Completion status of the bug.  One of B<open>, B<done>, or B<forwarded>."
msgstr ""
"Felrapportens avslutningsstatus.  En av B<open>, B<done> eller B<forwarded>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1589 ../scripts/bts.pl:3090
msgid "B<tag>"
msgstr "B<tag>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1591
msgid ""
"Tags applied to the bug. If B<users> is specified, may include usertags in "
"addition to the standard tags."
msgstr ""
"Taggar som har tillämpats på felrapporten. Om B<users> anges kan "
"användartaggar inkluderas utöver standardtaggarna."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1594 ../scripts/bts.pl:3098
msgid "B<owner>"
msgstr "B<owner>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1596 ../scripts/bts.pl:3100
msgid "Bug's owner."
msgstr "Felrapportens ägare."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1598
msgid "B<correspondent>"
msgstr "B<correspondent>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1600
msgid "Address of someone who sent mail to the log."
msgstr "Adressen till någon som har skickat e-post till loggen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1602 ../scripts/bts.pl:3102
msgid "B<affects>"
msgstr "B<affects>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1604
msgid "Bugs which affect this package."
msgstr "Felrapporter som påverkar detta paket."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1606
msgid "B<bugs>"
msgstr "B<bugs>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1608
msgid "List of bugs to search within."
msgstr "Lista över felrapporter att söka i."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1610
msgid "B<users>"
msgstr "B<users>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1612
msgid "Users to use when looking up usertags."
msgstr "Användare som ska användas vid uppslagning av användartaggar."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1614 ../scripts/bts.pl:3106
msgid "B<archive>"
msgstr "B<archive>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1616 ../scripts/bts.pl:3108
msgid ""
"Whether to search archived bugs or normal bugs; defaults to B<0> (i.e. only "
"search normal bugs). As a special case, if archive is B<both>, both archived"
" and unarchived bugs are returned."
msgstr ""
"Om arkiverade eller vanliga felrapporter ska sökas; standard är B<0> (det "
"vill säga endast vanliga felrapporter söks). Som specialfall returneras både"
" arkiverade och oarkiverade felrapporter om archive är B<both>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1622
msgid ""
"For example, to select the set of bugs submitted by "
"jrandomdeveloper@example.com and tagged B<wontfix>, one would use"
msgstr ""
"För att till exempel välja uppsättningen felrapporter som skickats av "
"jrandomdeveloper@example.com och taggats B<wontfix> används"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1625
msgid "bts select submitter:jrandomdeveloper@example.com tag:wontfix"
msgstr "bts select submitter:jrandomdeveloper@example.com tag:wontfix"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1627 ../scripts/bts.pl:3120
msgid ""
"If a key is used multiple times then the set of bugs selected includes those"
" matching any of the supplied values; for example"
msgstr ""
"Om en nyckel används flera gånger omfattar den valda uppsättningen "
"felrapporter som matchar något av angivna värden; till exempel"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1630
msgid "bts select package:foo severity:wishlist severity:minor"
msgstr "bts select package:foo severity:wishlist severity:minor"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1632
msgid ""
"returns all bugs of package foo with either wishlist or minor severity."
msgstr ""
"returnerar alla felrapporter för paketet foo med antingen "
"allvarlighetsgraden wishlist eller minor."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1645
msgid ""
"B<status> [I<bug> | B<file:>I<file> | B<fields:>I<field>[B<,>I<field> ...] |"
" B<verbose>] ..."
msgstr ""
"B<status> [I<bug> | B<file:>I<file> | B<fields:>I<field>[B<,>I<field> ...] |"
" B<verbose>] ..."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1647
msgid ""
"Uses the SOAP interface to output status information for the given bugs (or "
"as read from the listed files -- use B<-> to indicate STDIN)."
msgstr ""
"Använder SOAP-gränssnittet för att skriva ut statusinformation för angivna "
"felrapporter (eller sådan som lästs från de angivna filerna – använd B<-> "
"för att ange STDIN)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1650
msgid "By default, all populated fields for a bug are displayed."
msgstr "Som standard visas alla ifyllda fält för en felrapport."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1652
msgid "If B<verbose> is given, empty fields will also be displayed."
msgstr "Om B<verbose> anges visas även tomma fält."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1654
msgid ""
"If B<fields> is given, only those fields will be displayed.  No validity "
"checking is performed on any specified fields."
msgstr ""
"Om B<fields> anges visas endast dessa fält.  Ingen giltighetskontroll utförs"
" på några angivna fält."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1889
msgid "B<reply> [I<bug> | I<bug-number>B<#>I<message-no> | B<->]"
msgstr "B<reply> [I<bug> | I<bug-number>B<#>I<message-no> | B<->]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1891
msgid "Compose a reply to a bug BTS including bug changes."
msgstr "Skriv ett svar på en felrapport i BTS och ta med felrapportändringar."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1893
msgid ""
"A draft is prepared, quoting I<message-no> or the latest non-automated "
"message taken from either 1) the I<bug-number>'s online MBOX message archive"
" or 2) the MBOX or single raw email message written to standard input "
"(B<->)."
msgstr ""
"Ett utkast förbereds som citerar I<message-no> eller det senaste icke-"
"automatiserade meddelandet från antingen 1) I<bug-number>:s MBOX-arkiv "
"online eller 2) MBOX-format eller ett enskilt rått e-postmeddelande som "
"skrivits till standardinmatningen (B<->)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1898
msgid ""
"All other bug change commands given are included in the mail as pseudoheader"
" lines -- mostly 'B<Control:>' but more idiomatic headers B<bts> knows about"
" may be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Alla andra kommandon för felrapportändringar inkluderas i e-postmeddelandet "
"som pseudohuvudrader – oftast B<Control:>, men mer idiomatiska rubriker som "
"B<bts> känner till kan användas i stället."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:1902
msgid ""
"A B<reply> command reading from STDIN is executed implicitly before other "
"commands when B<bts> is invoked from a supported MUA (see B<--mutt>). The "
"implicit command is cancelled when an explicit B<reply>, B<context>, "
"B<show>|B<bugs> or B<status> command is present."
msgstr ""
"Ett B<reply>-kommando som läser från STDIN körs underförstått före andra "
"kommandon när B<bts> anropas från en MUA som stöds (se B<--mutt>). Det "
"underförstådda kommandot avbryts när ett uttryckligt B<reply>-, B<context>-,"
" B<show>|B<bugs>- eller B<status>-kommando finns."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2046
msgid "B<context>"
msgstr "B<context>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2048
msgid "Read email or MBOX from stdin to establish implicit bug context."
msgstr ""
"Läs e-post eller MBOX från standardinmatningen för att fastställa en "
"underförstådd felrapportskontext."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2050
msgid ""
"Similar to B<reply> but for sending plain control@ messages without "
"including a written rationale."
msgstr ""
"Liknar B<reply>, men används för att skicka vanliga control@-meddelanden "
"utan skriftlig motivering."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2075
msgid "B<clone> [I<bug>] [B<to>] I<new_ID> [I<new_ID> ...]"
msgstr "B<clone> [I<bug>] [B<to>] I<new_ID> [I<new_ID> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2077
msgid "The B<clone> command duplicates a I<bug> report."
msgstr "Kommandot B<clone> klonar en I<bug>-rapport."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2079
msgid ""
"It is useful in the case where a single report actually indicates that "
"multiple distinct bugs have occurred. \"New IDs\" are negative numbers, "
"separated by spaces, which may be used in subsequent control commands to "
"refer to the newly duplicated bugs.  A new report is generated for each new "
"ID."
msgstr ""
"Detta är användbart när en rapport i själva verket visar att flera olika "
"felrapporter har uppstått. \"Nya ID:n\" är negativa tal, avgränsade med "
"mellanslag, som kan användas i senare kontrollkommandon för att hänvisa till"
" de nyklonade felrapporterna. En ny rapport skapas för varje nytt ID."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2101
msgid "B<done> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<version>]"
msgstr "B<done> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<version>]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2103
msgid "B<close> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<version>]"
msgstr "B<close> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<version>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2105
msgid "Indicate no further action is expected on I<bug>."
msgstr "Ange att ingen ytterligare åtgärd förväntas för I<bug>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2107
msgid ""
"Changes I<bug>'s completion state to \"done\", closing it for now. "
"Optionally add a version tracking record that it was B<fixed> in I<version>."
msgstr ""
"Ändrar avslutningsstatusen för I<bug> till \"done\" och stänger den tills "
"vidare. Lägg valfritt till en versionsspårningspost om att den rättats i "
"I<version>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2110
msgid ""
"The BTS will record who completed a I<bug>. You can see this in the bug "
"status 'done' field:"
msgstr ""
"BTS registrerar vem som avslutade en I<bug>. Du kan se detta i felrapportens"
" 'done'-fält:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2113
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    $ bts status 123456 fields:done\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"    $ bts status 123456 fields:done\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2115
msgid ""
"The B<done> command always asks you to compose a mail interactively. Please "
"document why the bug is being closed in your message."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot B<done> ber dig alltid att formulera ett e-postmeddelande "
"interaktivt. Dokumentera varför felrapporten stängs i meddelandet."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2118
msgid ""
"While you should specify which I<version> of the package fixed the bug if "
"possible you can also do this later with the B<fixed> command."
msgstr ""
"Även om du om möjligt bör ange i vilken I<version> av paketet felrapporten "
"rättades kan du göra detta senare med kommandot B<fixed>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2121
msgid ""
"Bugs which remain closed for about a month without email activity are "
"archived (made read-only). Use B<unarchive> to undo this."
msgstr ""
"Felrapporter som förblir stängda i ungefär en månad utan e-postaktivitet "
"arkiveras (görs skrivskyddade). Använd B<unarchive> för att ångra detta."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2124
msgid ""
"Closed, but non-archived bugs can be reopened with the B<found> command."
msgstr ""
"Stängda men oarkiverade felrapporter kan öppnas igen med kommandot B<found>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2196
msgid "B<reopen> [I<bug>] [I<submitter>]"
msgstr "B<reopen> [I<bug>] [I<submitter>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2198
msgid ""
"(Deprecated) Record that a I<bug> previously marked B<done> should be acted "
"upon again by the maintainer. Optionally change I<submitter> -- unclear why "
"you'd want to do this here."
msgstr ""
"(Föråldrad) Registrera att en I<bug> som tidigare har markerats B<done> bör "
"hanteras igen av underhållaren. Ändra valfritt I<submitter> – det är oklart "
"varför detta skulle göras här."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2202
msgid ""
"Clears all B<fixed> version tracking records only if I<bug> is currently "
"closed -- not very predictable behaviour and it is somewhat rude."
msgstr ""
"Rensar alla B<fixed>-versionsspårningsposter endast om I<bug> för närvarande"
" är stängd – beteendet är inte särskilt förutsägbart och något ohövligt."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2205
msgid ""
"Instead prefer the more predictable B<found> command (without arguments) if "
"you really want to do this, but also consider the more respectful approach "
"documented there."
msgstr ""
"Använd i stället det mer förutsägbara kommandot B<found> (utan argument) om "
"du verkligen vill göra detta, men överväg också det mer respektfulla "
"tillvägagångssättet som dokumenteras där."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2228
msgid "B<archive> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<archive> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2230
msgid ""
"Archive a I<bug> that has previously been archived but is currently not.  "
"The I<bug> must fulfill all of the requirements for archiving with the "
"exception of those that are time-based."
msgstr ""
"Arkivera en I<bug> som tidigare har arkiverats men som för närvarande inte "
"är det.  I<bug> måste uppfylla alla krav för arkivering utom de "
"tidsbaserade."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2242
msgid "B<unarchive> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<unarchive> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2244
msgid "Unarchive a I<bug> that is currently archived."
msgstr "Avarkivera en I<bug> som för närvarande är arkiverad."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2264
msgid "B<retitle> [I<bug>] I<title>"
msgstr "B<retitle> [I<bug>] I<title>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2266
msgid "Change the I<title> of the I<bug>."
msgstr "Ändra I<title> för I<bug>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2294
msgid "B<summary> [I<bug>] [I<messagenum>]"
msgstr "B<summary> [I<bug>] [I<messagenum>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2296
msgid ""
"Select a message number that should be used as the summary of a I<bug>."
msgstr ""
"Välj ett meddelandenummer som ska användas som sammanfattning av en I<bug>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2299
msgid "If no message number is given, the summary is cleared."
msgstr "Om inget meddelandenummer anges rensas sammanfattningen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2315
msgid "B<submitter> [I<bug> ...] I<submitter-email>"
msgstr "B<submitter> [I<bug> ...] I<submitter-email>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2317
msgid ""
"Change the submitter mail address of a I<bug> or a number of bugs, with B<!>"
" meaning the BTS should use the mail address of the change request e-mail "
"message."
msgstr ""
"Ändra insändarens e-postadress för en I<bug> eller flera felrapporter; B<!> "
"innebär att BTS ska använda e-postadressen i e-postmeddelandet med "
"ändringsbegäran."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2338
msgid ""
"B<assign> [I<bug> ...] [B<to>] I<package>[B<,>I<package> ...] [I<version>]"
msgstr ""
"B<assign> [I<bug> ...] [B<to>] I<package>[B<,>I<package> ...] [I<version>]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2340
msgid ""
"B<reassign> [I<bug> ...] [B<to>] I<package>[B<,>I<package> ...] [I<version>]"
msgstr ""
"B<reassign> [I<bug> ...] [B<to>] I<package>[B<,>I<package> ...] [I<version>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2342
msgid ""
"Change the assigned I<package> set for all I<bug>s given. This indicates all"
" the specified bugs are presumed to need fixing in one of these packages."
msgstr ""
"Ändra den uppsättning I<package> som har tilldelats alla angivna I<bug>. "
"Detta anger att alla angivna felrapporter antas behöva rättas i något av "
"dessa paket."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2346
msgid ""
"Clears all existing version tracking records (B<found> and B<fixed>) for "
"each I<bug>. If the optional I<version> is given a 'found' record for the "
"new packages is added. If the affected version is is not yet known use the "
"B<found> command once an analysis is available."
msgstr ""
"Rensar alla befintliga versionsspårningsposter (B<found> och B<fixed>) för "
"varje I<bug>. Om det valfria I<version> anges läggs en 'found'-post till för"
" de nya paketen. Om den berörda versionen ännu inte är känd, använd "
"kommandot B<found> när en analys finns tillgänglig."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2351
msgid ""
"If other packages are merely receiving unactionable reports use the "
"B<affects> command to make the I<bug> show up in their bug listings."
msgstr ""
"Om andra paket bara tar emot rapporter som inte kan åtgärdas, använd "
"kommandot B<affects> för att visa I<bug> i deras felrapportlistor."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2354
msgid ""
"If the bug is likeley to need individual fixes across several packages you "
"should instead B<clone> the bug and B<reassign> the clone to the other "
"package(s). For example:"
msgstr ""
"Om felrapporten sannolikt kräver individuella rättningar i flera paket bör "
"du i stället B<clone> felrapporten och B<reassign> klonen till övriga paket."
" Till exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2358
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" $ bts clone 69042 to -1 , assign -1 to other-package\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" $ bts clone 69042 to -1 , assign -1 to other-package\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2360
msgid ""
"The command adds the maintainers of the new package to CC if B<--mutt> or "
"B<--force-interactive> are active."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot lägger till underhållarna för det nya paketet i CC om B<--mutt> "
"eller B<--force-interactive> är aktiva."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2445
msgid "B<found> [I<bug>] [in] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"
msgstr "B<found> [I<bug>] [in] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2447
msgid ""
"Add a version tracking record to indicate I<bug> was found to be present in "
"the given I<version> of the binary package to which I<bug> is currently "
"assigned or I<source-package> if given."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till en versionsspårningspost som anger att I<bug> har påträffats i den"
" angivna I<version> av det binära paket som I<bug> för närvarande är "
"tilldelad, eller I<source-package> om det anges."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2451
msgid ""
"This implicitly changes I<bug>'s completion state to not B<done> indicating "
"it should be acted upon by the maintainer unless I<version> is less than the"
" current highest fixed version on record, see:"
msgstr ""
"Detta ändrar underförstått avslutningsstatusen för I<bug> till något annat "
"än B<done>, vilket anger att underhållaren ska hantera den, såvida inte "
"I<version> är lägre än den högsta registrerade fixed-versionen, se:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2455
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    $ bts status 123456 fields:fixed_versions\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"    $ bts status 123456 fields:fixed_versions\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2457
msgid "B<found> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<found> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2459
msgid ""
"(Expert) Clear all B<fixed> version tracking records in I<bug> and change "
"it's completion state to indicate that it is not B<done> and should be acted"
" upon my the maintainer -- this is somewhat rude so you better be sure."
msgstr ""
"(Expert) Rensa alla B<fixed>-versionsspårningsposter i I<bug> och ändra "
"avslutningsstatusen så att den anger att felrapporten inte är B<done> och "
"bör hanteras av underhållaren – detta är något ohövligt, så förvissa dig om "
"att det är rätt."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2464
msgid ""
"To be respectful consider using the B<reply> command and appeal to the "
"maintainer for why they should still act on the bug. You can simultaniously "
"use additional B<found> commands to record which I<version>s you can "
"demonstrate to be affected in the BTS."
msgstr ""
"För att vara respektfull bör du överväga att använda kommandot B<reply> och "
"vädja till underhållaren om varför felrapporten fortfarande bör hanteras. Du"
" kan samtidigt använda ytterligare B<found>-kommandon för att registrera "
"vilka I<version> du kan visa påverkas i BTS."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2490
msgid "B<notfound> [I<bug>] [B<in>] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"
msgstr "B<notfound> [I<bug>] [B<in>] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2492
msgid ""
"Remove a mistaken record that I<bug> is present in the given I<version> of "
"the binary package to which it is currently assigned or I<source-package> if"
" given."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort en felaktig post om att I<bug> finns i den angivna I<version> av det"
" binära paket som den för närvarande är tilldelad, eller I<source-package> "
"om det anges."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2496
msgid ""
"Do not use this if changes were actively made in Debian to address I<bug>. "
"Use B<done> or B<fixed> instead as appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Använd inte detta om ändringar aktivt gjordes i Debian för att hantera "
"I<bug>. Använd i stället B<done> eller B<fixed>, beroende på vad som är "
"lämpligt."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2499
msgid ""
"Version tracking records for a bug are cleared entirely by the B<reassign> "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Versionsspårningsposter för en felrapport raderas helt med kommandot "
"B<reassign>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2514
msgid ""
"B<fixed> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"
msgstr ""
"B<fixed> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<source-package>B</>]I<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2516
msgid ""
"Add a version tracking record to indicate a closed I<bug> was also fixed in "
"I<version> of the binary package I<bug> is currently assigned to or "
"I<source-package> if given."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till en versionsspårningspost som anger att en stängd I<bug> också "
"rättades i I<version> av det binära paket som I<bug> för närvarande är "
"tilldelad, eller I<source-package> om det anges."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2520
msgid ""
"This does not affect I<bug>'s completion state. Use the B<done> command to "
"indicate no further action is expected on a bug instead."
msgstr ""
"Detta påverkar inte avslutningsstatusen för I<bug>. Använd i stället "
"kommandot B<done> för att ange att ingen ytterligare åtgärd förväntas för en"
" felrapport."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2551
msgid ""
"B<notfixed> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<source-"
"package>B</>]I<version>"
msgstr ""
"B<notfixed> [I<bug>] [B<in>|B<by>|B<since>] [I<source-"
"package>B</>]I<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2553
msgid ""
"Remove an erroniosly added version tracking record for I<bug> being fixed in"
" the given I<version> of the binary package to which it currently assigned "
"or I<source-package> if given."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort en felaktigt tillagd versionsspårningspost om att I<bug> rättades i "
"den angivna I<version> av det binära paket som den för närvarande är "
"tilldelad, eller I<source-package> om det anges."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2557
msgid ""
"This does not affect I<bug>'s completion state. Use the B<found> command to "
"reopen a bug that was erroniously marked B<done> and B<fixed> in I<version>."
msgstr ""
"Detta påverkar inte avslutningsstatusen för I<bug>. Använd kommandot "
"B<found> för att återöppna en felrapport som felaktigt har markerats som "
"B<done> och B<fixed> i I<version>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2561
msgid ""
"If the bug is not assigned to the correct package use the B<reassign> "
"command instead which also removes all version tracking records."
msgstr ""
"Om felrapporten inte är tilldelad rätt paket, använd i stället kommandot "
"B<reassign>, som också tar bort alla versionsspårningsposter."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2564
msgid ""
"Note: B<notfixed> is equivalent to the sequence of commands \"B<found> "
"I<bug> I<version>\", \"B<notfound> I<bug> I<version>\"."
msgstr ""
"Obs: B<notfixed> motsvarar kommandosekvensen \"B<found> I<bug> I<version>\","
" \"B<notfound> I<bug> I<version>\"."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2592
msgid "B<block> [I<bug>] [B<by>|B<with>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> ...]"
msgstr "B<block> [I<bug>] [B<by>|B<with>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2594
msgid ""
"B<blocked> [I<bug>] [B<by>|B<with>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<blocked> [I<bug>] [B<by>|B<with>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2596
msgid ""
"Record that a I<bug> is blocked from being fixed by a set of other blocker-"
"bugs."
msgstr ""
"Registrera att en I<bug> förhindras att rättas av en uppsättning andra "
"blockerande felrapporter."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2610
msgid ""
"B<unblock> [I<bug>] [B<from>|B<with>|B<by>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> "
"...]"
msgstr ""
"B<unblock> [I<bug>] [B<from>|B<with>|B<by>] I<blocker-bug> [I<blocker-bug> "
"...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2612
msgid ""
"Remove records that I<bug> is blocked from being fixed by each of the "
"blocker bugs."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort poster om att I<bug> blockeras från att rättas av var och en av de "
"blockerande felrapporterna."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2625
msgid "B<merge> [I<bug>] [B<with>] I<bug> [I<bug> ...]"
msgstr "B<merge> [I<bug>] [B<with>] I<bug> [I<bug> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2627
msgid "Merge a set of bugs together."
msgstr "Slå samman en uppsättning felrapporter."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2642
msgid "B<forcemerge> [I<bug>] [B<with>] I<bug> [I<bug> ...]"
msgstr "B<forcemerge> [I<bug>] [B<with>] I<bug> [I<bug> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2644
msgid ""
"Forcibly merge a set of bugs together. The first I<bug> listed is the master"
" bug, and its settings (those which must be equal in a normal B<merge>) are "
"assigned to the bugs listed next."
msgstr ""
"Slå med tvång samman en uppsättning felrapporter. Den första I<bug> som "
"anges är huvudfelrapporten och dess inställningar (som måste vara lika vid "
"en normal B<merge>) tilldelas de felrapporter som anges därefter."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2659
msgid "B<unmerge> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<unmerge> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2661
msgid "Unmerge a I<bug>."
msgstr "Ångra sammanslagningen av en I<bug>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2671
msgid "B<tag> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<tag> [I<tag> ...]"
msgstr "B<tag> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<tag> [I<tag> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2673
msgid "B<tags> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<tag> [I<tag> ...]"
msgstr "B<tags> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<tag> [I<tag> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2675
msgid ""
"Add or remove a I<tag>s on a I<bug>. The tag must be from the predefined "
"list of valid tags below or abbreviated to a unique substring of one."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till eller ta bort en eller flera I<tag>-taggar på en I<bug>. Taggen "
"måste komma från den fördefinierade listan över giltiga taggar nedan eller "
"förkortas till en unik delsträng av en sådan."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2680
msgid "Abbreviations"
msgstr "Förkortningar"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2682
msgid ""
"Using B<fixed> will set the tag B<fixed>, not B<fixed-upstream>. However "
"B<fix> would not be acceptable."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder B<fixed> kommer taggen B<fixed> att ställas in, inte B<fixed-"
"upstream>. B<fix> skulle däremot inte accepteras."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2685
msgid "Multiple tags"
msgstr "Flera taggar"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2687
msgid ""
"Operating on several tags in one command is possible. The B<+> or B<-> "
"operators define whether subsequent tags are added or removed."
msgstr ""
"Flera taggar kan hanteras i ett kommando. Operatorerna B<+> eller B<-> anger"
" om efterföljande taggar läggs till eller tas bort."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2690
msgid "Adding and removing"
msgstr "Lägga till och ta bort"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2692
msgid ""
"The B<tag> command defaults to adding tags (B<+>) while the B<tags> command "
"will currently complain if none of B<+>/B<->/B<=> are specified. In a future"
" release (Forky+1) the 'tags' default operation will change to overriding "
"the tags set (B<=>)."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot B<tag> lägger som standard till taggar (B<+>), medan kommandot "
"B<tags> för närvarande ger ett felmeddelande om inget av B<+>/B<->/B<=> "
"anges. I en framtida version (Forky+1) ändras standardåtgärden för 'tags' "
"till att ersätta den angivna tagguppsättningen (B<=>)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2697
msgid ""
"At least one tag must be specified, unless the B<=> flag is used. The "
"command below will remove all tags from the specified I<bug>."
msgstr ""
"Minst en tagg måste anges, såvida inte flaggan B<=> används. Kommandot nedan"
" tar bort alla taggar från den angivna I<bug>."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2700
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" $ bts tags <bug> =\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" $ bts tags <bug> =\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2702
msgid "CCs"
msgstr "CC-kopior"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2704
msgid ""
"Adding or removing the B<security> tag will add \"team@security.debian.org\""
" to the CC list of the control email."
msgstr ""
"När B<security>-taggen läggs till eller tas bort läggs "
"\"team@security.debian.org\" till i CC-listan för kontrollmeddelandet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2707
msgid "Avaliable tags"
msgstr "Tillgängliga taggar"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2709
msgid ""
"The list of valid tags and their significance is available at "
"L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/Developer#tags>. The current valid tags are:"
msgstr ""
"Listan över giltiga taggar och deras betydelse finns på "
"L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/Developer#tags>. De aktuella giltiga taggarna "
"är:"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2713
msgid ""
"patch, wontfix, moreinfo, unreproducible, fixed, help, security, upstream, "
"pending, d-i, confirmed, ipv6, lfs, fixed-upstream, l10n, newcomer, a11y, "
"ftbfs"
msgstr ""
"patch, wontfix, moreinfo, unreproducible, fixed, help, security, upstream, "
"pending, d-i, confirmed, ipv6, lfs, fixed-upstream, l10n, newcomer, a11y, "
"ftbfs"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2717
msgid ""
"There is also a tag for each release of Debian since \"potato\". Note that "
"this list may be out of date, see the website for the most up to date "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Det finns också en tagg för varje Debian-utgåva sedan \"potato\". Observera "
"att listan kan vara inaktuell; se webbplatsen för den mest aktuella källan."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2721
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Exempel"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2723
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" # Add moreinfo tag\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 moreinfo\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +moreinfo\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 + moreinfo\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" # Lägg till moreinfo-taggen\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 moreinfo\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +moreinfo\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 + moreinfo\n"
"\n"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2728
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" # Add fixed, remove wontfix and unreproducible tags\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +fixed -wontfix -unreproducible\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +fixed -wontfix  unreproducible\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" # Lägg till fixed och ta bort taggarna wontfix och unreproducible\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +fixed -wontfix -unreproducible\n"
" $ bts tag 123456 +fixed -wontfix  unreproducible\n"
"\n"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2732
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" # Clear tag list\n"
" $ bts tags 123456 =\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" # Rensa tagglistan\n"
" $ bts tags 123456 =\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2809
msgid "B<affects> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<package> [I<package> ...]"
msgstr "B<affects> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] I<package> [I<package> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2811
msgid ""
"Record that a I<bug> affects a I<package> other than the bug's assigned "
"package."
msgstr ""
"Registrera att I<bug> påverkar ett annat I<package> än det paket som "
"felrapporten har tilldelats."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2814
msgid ""
"The given I<bug> will be listed in the affected I<package>'s bug list.  This"
" should generally be used where the I<bug> is severe enough to cause "
"multiple reports from users to be assigned to the wrong package.  At least "
"one I<package> must be specified, unless the B<=> flag is used. The command"
msgstr ""
"Den angivna I<bug> listas i felrapportlistan för det berörda I<package>.  "
"Detta bör normalt användas när I<bug> är så allvarlig att flera rapporter "
"från användare annars tilldelas fel paket.  Minst ett I<package> måste "
"anges, såvida inte flaggan B<=> används. Kommandot"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2819
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" $ bts affects <bug> =\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
" $ bts affects <bug> =\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2821
msgid "will remove all indications that I<bug> affects other packages."
msgstr "tar bort alla uppgifter om att I<bug> påverkar andra paket."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2856
msgid "B<user> I<email>"
msgstr "B<user> I<email>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2858
msgid "Specify a user I<email> address before using the B<usertags> command."
msgstr ""
"Ange en användares I<email>-adress innan kommandot B<usertags> används."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2875
msgid "B<usertag> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] [I<freeform-tag> ...]"
msgstr "B<usertag> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] [I<freeform-tag> ...]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2877
msgid "B<usertags> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] [I<freeform-tag> ...]"
msgstr "B<usertags> [I<bug>] [B<+>|B<->|B<=>] [I<freeform-tag> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2879
msgid ""
"Mirrors B<tags> command, but with freeform tags namespaced by preceding "
"B<user> command or $EMAIL/$DEBEMAIL (in that order) from the environment."
msgstr ""
"Speglar kommandot B<tags>, men med fria taggar vars namnrymd bestäms av "
"föregående B<user>-kommando eller $EMAIL/$DEBEMAIL (i den ordningen) från "
"miljön."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2882
msgid ""
"Add or remove freeform \"usertags\" on a I<bug>. The name of I<freeform-"
"tag>s must be exact, there is no pre-defined list of valid tag names unlike "
"with the B<tags> command."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till eller ta bort fria \"usertags\" på en I<bug>. Namnet på "
"I<freeform-tag> måste vara exakt; till skillnad från kommandot B<tags> finns"
" ingen fördefinierad lista med giltiga taggnamn."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2886
msgid ""
"See B<tags> command for detailed usage. TODO: check usage is exactly the "
"same regarding '+moreinfo' vs '+ moreinfo'."
msgstr ""
"Se kommandot B<tags> för detaljerad användning. TODO: kontrollera att "
"användningen är exakt densamma för '+moreinfo' och '+ moreinfo'."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2929
msgid "B<claim> [I<bug>] [for] [I<claim>]"
msgstr "B<claim> [I<bug>] [for] [I<claim>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2931
msgid ""
"Record that you have claimed a I<bug> (e.g. for a bug squashing party).  "
"I<claim> should be a unique token allowing the bugs you have claimed to be "
"identified; an e-mail address is often used."
msgstr ""
"Registrera att du har tagit ansvar för en I<bug> (till exempel inför en Bug "
"Squashing Party). I<claim> ska vara en unik identifierare som gör det "
"möjligt att identifiera felrapporterna du har tagit ansvar för; ofta används"
" en e-postadress."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2935 ../scripts/bts.pl:2963
msgid ""
"If no I<claim> is specified, the environment variable B<DEBEMAIL> or "
"B<EMAIL> (checked in that order) is used."
msgstr ""
"Om ingen I<claim> anges används miljövariabeln B<DEBEMAIL> eller B<EMAIL> "
"(kontrolleras i den ordningen)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2938
msgid ""
"See L<https://lists.debian.org/msgid-"
"search/20050908170731.GA20584@cyan.localnet>."
msgstr ""
"Se L<https://lists.debian.org/msgid-"
"search/20050908170731.GA20584@cyan.localnet>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2959
msgid "B<unclaim> [I<bug>] [B<for>] [I<claim>]"
msgstr "B<unclaim> [I<bug>] [B<for>] [I<claim>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2961
msgid "Remove the record that you have claimed a bug."
msgstr "Ta bort posten om att du har tagit ansvar för en felrapport."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2985
msgid "B<severity> [I<bug>] I<severity>"
msgstr "B<severity> [I<bug>] I<severity>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:2987
msgid ""
"Change the I<severity> of a I<bug>. Available severities are: B<wishlist>, "
"B<minor>, B<normal>, B<important>, B<serious>, B<grave>, B<critical>. The "
"severity may be abbreviated to any unique substring."
msgstr ""
"Ändra I<severity> för en I<bug>. Tillgängliga allvarlighetsgrader är: "
"B<wishlist>, B<minor>, B<normal>, B<important>, B<serious>, B<grave>, "
"B<critical>. Allvarlighetsgraden kan förkortas till en godtycklig unik "
"delsträng."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3007
msgid "B<forwarded> [I<bug>] I<address>"
msgstr "B<forwarded> [I<bug>] I<address>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3009
msgid ""
"Mark the I<bug> as forwarded to the given I<address> (usually an email "
"address or a URL for an upstream bug tracker)."
msgstr ""
"Markera I<bug> som vidarebefordrad till den angivna I<address> (vanligen en "
"e-postadress eller URL till en uppströmsfelspårare)."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3029
msgid "B<notforwarded> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<notforwarded> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3031
msgid "Mark a I<bug> as not forwarded."
msgstr "Markera en I<bug> som ej vidarebefordrad."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3041
msgid "B<package> [I<package> ...]"
msgstr "B<package> [I<package> ...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3043
msgid ""
"The following commands will only apply to bugs against the listed "
"I<package>s; this acts as a safety mechanism for the BTS.  If no packages "
"are listed, this check is turned off again."
msgstr ""
"Följande kommandon gäller endast felrapporter om de angivna I<package>; "
"detta fungerar som en säkerhetsmekanism för BTS. Om inga paket anges stängs "
"kontrollen av igen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3057
msgid "B<limit> [I<key>[B<:>I<value>]] ..."
msgstr "B<limit> [I<key>[B<:>I<value>]] ..."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3059
msgid ""
"The following commands will only apply to bugs which meet the specified "
"criterion; this acts as a safety mechanism for the BTS.  If no I<value>s are"
" listed, the limits for that I<key> are turned off again.  If no I<key>s are"
" specified, all limits are reset."
msgstr ""
"Följande kommandon gäller endast felrapporter som uppfyller det angivna "
"kriteriet; detta fungerar som en säkerhetsmekanism för BTS. Om inga "
"I<value>-värden anges inaktiveras begränsningarna för den I<key> igen. Om "
"inga I<key> anges återställs alla begränsningar."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3070
msgid "B<date>"
msgstr "B<date>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3072
msgid "Date the bug was submitted."
msgstr "Datum då felrapporten skickades in."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3074
msgid "B<subject>"
msgstr "B<subject>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3076
msgid "Subject of the bug."
msgstr "Felrapportens ämne."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3078
msgid "B<msgid>"
msgstr "B<msgid>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3080
msgid "Message-id of the initial bug report."
msgstr "Meddelande-id för den ursprungliga felrapporten."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3092
msgid "Tags applied to the bug."
msgstr "Taggar som har tillämpats på felrapporten."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3104
msgid "Bugs affecting this package."
msgstr "Felrapporter som påverkar detta paket."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3114
msgid ""
"For example, to limit the set of bugs affected by the subsequent control "
"commands to those submitted by jrandomdeveloper@example.com and tagged "
"B<wontfix>, one would use"
msgstr ""
"För att till exempel begränsa uppsättningen felrapporter som påverkas av "
"följande kontrollkommandon till dem som skickats av "
"jrandomdeveloper@example.com och taggats B<wontfix> används"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3118
msgid "bts limit submitter:jrandomdeveloper@example.com tag:wontfix"
msgstr "bts limit submitter:jrandomdeveloper@example.com tag:wontfix"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3123
msgid "bts limit package:foo severity:wishlist severity:minor"
msgstr "bts limit package:foo severity:wishlist severity:minor"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3125
msgid ""
"only applies the subsequent control commands to bugs of package foo with "
"either B<wishlist> or B<minor> severity."
msgstr ""
"tillämpar endast följande kontrollkommandon på felrapporter för paketet foo "
"med antingen allvarlighetsgraden B<wishlist> eller B<minor>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3200
msgid "B<owner> [I<bug>] I<owner-email>"
msgstr "B<owner> [I<bug>] I<owner-email>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3202
msgid ""
"Change the \"owner\" address of a I<bug>, with B<!> meaning \"use the "
"address on the current email as the new owner address\"."
msgstr ""
"Ändra \"owner\"-adressen för en I<bug>; B<!> betyder \"använd adressen i det"
" aktuella e-postmeddelandet som den nya owner-adressen\"."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3205
msgid "The owner of a bug accepts responsibility for dealing with it."
msgstr "Ägaren av en felrapport tar ansvar för att hantera den."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3217
msgid "B<noowner> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<noowner> [I<bug>]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3219
msgid "B<disown> [I<bug>]"
msgstr "B<disown> [I<bug>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3221
msgid "Mark a bug as having no \"owner\"."
msgstr "Markera en felrapport som utan \"owner\"."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3233
msgid "B<subscribe> [I<bug>] [B<email>] [I<email>]"
msgstr "B<subscribe> [I<bug>] [B<email>] [I<email>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3235
msgid "Subscribe the given I<email> address to the specified I<bug> reports."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till den angivna I<email>-adressen som prenumerant på de angivna "
"I<bug>-rapporterna."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3237
msgid ""
"If no email address is specified, the environment variable B<DEBEMAIL> or "
"B<EMAIL> (in that order) is used.  If those are not set, or B<!> is given as"
" email address, your mail system will determine the address used."
msgstr ""
"Om ingen e-postadress anges används miljövariabeln B<DEBEMAIL> eller "
"B<EMAIL> (i den ordningen). Om de inte är satta, eller om B<!> anges som "
"e-postadress, avgör ditt e-postsystem vilken adress som används."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3241
msgid ""
"After executing this command, you will be sent a subscription confirmation "
"to which you have to reply.  When subscribed to a bug report, you receive "
"all relevant emails and notifications."
msgstr ""
"Efter att kommandot har körts får du en prenumerationsbekräftelse som du "
"måste svara på. När du prenumererar på en felrapport får du alla relevanta "
"e-postmeddelanden och aviseringar."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3245
msgid "Use the B<unsubscribe> command to undo the subscription."
msgstr "Använd kommandot B<unsubscribe> för att avbryta prenumerationen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3258
msgid "B<unsubscribe> [I<bug> ...] [B<email>] [I<email>]"
msgstr "B<unsubscribe> [I<bug> ...] [B<email>] [I<email>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3260
msgid "Unsubscribe the given email address from the specified I<bug> reports."
msgstr ""
"Avsluta den angivna e-postadressens prenumeration på de angivna "
"I<bug>-rapporterna."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3262
msgid ""
"As with subscribe above, if no email address is specified, the environment "
"variables B<DEBEMAIL> or B<EMAIL> (in that order) is used.  If those are not"
" set, or B<!> is given as email address, your mail system will determine the"
" address used."
msgstr ""
"Precis som för subscribe ovan används miljövariabeln B<DEBEMAIL> eller "
"B<EMAIL> (i den ordningen) om ingen e-postadress anges. Om de inte är satta,"
" eller om B<!> anges som e-postadress, avgör ditt e-postsystem vilken adress"
" som används."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3267
msgid ""
"You will receive an unsubscription confirmation to which you need to reply "
"for the unsubscription to be effectiv."
msgstr ""
"Du får en bekräftelse på avregistreringen som du måste svara på för att "
"avregistreringen ska träda i kraft."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3270
msgid ""
"Currently there is no self-service mechanism to list all your subscriptions "
"or to unsubscribe from all bugs. Contact the Debian Listmaster Team "
"<https://wiki.debian.org/Teams/ListMaster> who are responsible for the bug "
"subscription infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Det finns för närvarande ingen självbetjäningsfunktion för att lista alla "
"prenumerationer eller avsluta prenumerationen på alla felrapporter. Kontakta"
" Debian Listmaster Team <https://wiki.debian.org/Teams/ListMaster>, som "
"ansvarar för infrastrukturen för felrapportprenumerationer."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3287
msgid "B<spamreport> [I<bug>] ..."
msgstr "B<spamreport> [I<bug>] ..."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3289
msgid "B<reportspam> [I<bug>] ..."
msgstr "B<reportspam> [I<bug>] ..."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3291
msgid ""
"Record that I<bug> constains SPAM messages. A Debian contributor will review"
" the bug log and remove the offending message(s)."
msgstr ""
"Registrera att I<bug> innehåller skräppostmeddelanden. En Debian-"
"bidragsgivare granskar felrapportsloggen och tar bort de berörda "
"meddelandena."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3325
msgid ""
"B<cache> [I<options>] [I<maint_email> | I<pkg> | B<src:>I<pkg> | "
"B<from:>I<submitter>]"
msgstr ""
"B<cache> [I<options>] [I<maint_email> | I<pkg> | B<src:>I<pkg> | "
"B<from:>I<submitter>]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3327
msgid ""
"B<cache> [I<options>] [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | "
"B<RC>]"
msgstr ""
"B<cache> [I<options>] [B<release-critical> | B<release-critical/>... | "
"B<RC>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3329
msgid ""
"Generate or update a cache of bug reports for the given email address or "
"package. By default it downloads all bugs belonging to the email address in "
"the B<DEBEMAIL> environment variable (or the B<EMAIL> environment variable "
"if B<DEBEMAIL> is unset). This command may be repeated to cache bugs "
"belonging to several people or packages. If multiple packages or addresses "
"are supplied, bugs belonging to any of the arguments will be cached; those "
"belonging to more than one of the arguments will only be downloaded once. "
"The cached bugs are stored in F<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/bts/> or, if "
"B<XDG_CACHE_HOME> is not set, in F<~/.cache/devscripts/bts/>."
msgstr ""
"Skapa eller uppdatera en cache med felrapporter för den angivna "
"e-postadressen eller paketet. Som standard hämtas alla felrapporter som hör "
"till e-postadressen i miljövariabeln B<DEBEMAIL> (eller miljövariabeln "
"B<EMAIL> om B<DEBEMAIL> inte är satt). Kommandot kan upprepas för att "
"cachelagra felrapporter för flera personer eller paket. Om flera paket eller"
" adresser anges cachelagras felrapporter som hör till något av argumenten; "
"de som hör till fler än ett argument hämtas endast en gång. De cachade "
"felrapporterna lagras i F<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/bts/> eller, om "
"B<XDG_CACHE_HOME> inte är satt, i F<~/.cache/devscripts/bts/>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3340
msgid "You can use the cached bugs with the B<-o> switch. For example:"
msgstr "Du kan använda cachade felrapporter med flaggan B<-o>. Till exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3342
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  bts -o bugs\n"
"  bts -o show 12345\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  bts -o bugs\n"
"  bts -o show 12345\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3345
msgid ""
"Also, B<bts> will update the files in it in a piecemeal fashion as it "
"downloads information from the BTS using the B<show> command. You might thus"
" set up the cache, and update the whole thing once a week, while letting the"
" automatic cache updates update the bugs you frequently refer to during the "
"week."
msgstr ""
"B<bts> uppdaterar även cachefilerna stegvis när information hämtas från BTS "
"med kommandot B<show>. Du kan alltså skapa cachen, uppdatera allt en gång i "
"veckan och samtidigt låta de automatiska cacheuppdateringarna uppdatera "
"felrapporter som du ofta hänvisar till under veckan."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3351
msgid ""
"Some options affect the behaviour of the B<cache> command.  The first is the"
" setting of B<--cache-mode>, which controls how much B<bts> downloads of the"
" referenced links from the bug page, including boring bits such as the "
"acknowledgement emails, emails to the control bot, and the mbox version of "
"the bug report.  It can take three values: B<min> (the minimum), B<mbox> "
"(download the minimum plus the mbox version of the bug report) or B<full> "
"(the whole works).  The second is B<--force-refresh> or B<-f>, which forces "
"the download, even if the cached bug report is up-to-date.  The B<--include-"
"resolved> option indicates whether bug reports marked as resolved should be "
"downloaded during caching."
msgstr ""
"Vissa alternativ påverkar beteendet för kommandot B<cache>. Det första är "
"inställningen B<--cache-mode>, som styr hur mycket B<bts> hämtar av de "
"länkade resurserna från felrapportsidan, inklusive mindre intressanta delar "
"som bekräftelsemeddelanden, e-post till kontrollboten och MBOX-versionen av "
"felrapporten. Den kan ha tre värden: B<min> (minsta mängden), B<mbox> "
"(minsta mängden plus MBOX-versionen av felrapporten) eller B<full> (allt). "
"Det andra är B<--force-refresh> eller B<-f>, som tvingar hämtning även när "
"den cachelagrade felrapporten är aktuell. Alternativet B<--include-resolved>"
" anger om felrapporter som är markerade som lösta ska hämtas vid "
"cachelagring."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3362
msgid ""
"Each of these is configurable from the configuration file, as described "
"below.  They may also be specified after the B<cache> command as well as at "
"the start of the command-line."
msgstr ""
"Var och en av dessa kan konfigureras i konfigurationsfilen enligt "
"beskrivningen nedan.  De kan också anges efter kommandot B<cache> eller i "
"början av kommandoraden."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3366
msgid ""
"Finally, B<-q> or B<--quiet> will suppress messages about caches being up-"
"to-date, and giving the option twice will suppress all cache messages "
"(except for error messages)."
msgstr ""
"Slutligen undertrycker B<-q> eller B<--quiet> meddelanden om att cachen är "
"aktuell, och om alternativet anges två gånger undertrycks alla "
"cachemeddelanden utom felmeddelanden."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3370
msgid ""
"Beware of caching RC, though: it will take a LONG time! (With 1000+ RC bugs "
"and a delay of 5 seconds between bugs, you're looking at a minimum of 1.5 "
"hours, and probably significantly more than that.)"
msgstr ""
"Var försiktig med att cachelagra RC: det tar MYCKET lång tid! (Med över 1 "
"000 RC-felrapporter och en fördröjning på fem sekunder mellan felrapporterna"
" tar det minst 1,5 timmar, och troligen betydligt längre.)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3505
msgid "B<cleancache> I<package> | B<src:>I<package> | I<maintainer>"
msgstr "B<cleancache> I<package> | B<src:>I<package> | I<maintainer>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3507
msgid ""
"B<cleancache from:>I<submitter> | B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> | "
"I<number> | B<ALL>"
msgstr ""
"B<cleancache from:>I<submitter> | B<tag:>I<tag> | B<usertag:>I<tag> | "
"I<number> | B<ALL>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3509
msgid ""
"Clean the cache for the specified I<package>, I<maintainer>, etc., as "
"described above for the B<bugs> command, or clean the entire cache if B<ALL>"
" is specified. This is useful if you are going to have permanent network "
"access or if the database has become corrupted for some reason.  Note that "
"for safety, this command does not default to the value of B<DEBEMAIL> or "
"B<EMAIL>."
msgstr ""
"Rensa cachen för angivet I<package>, I<maintainer> och så vidare, enligt "
"beskrivningen ovan för kommandot B<bugs>, eller rensa hela cachen om B<ALL> "
"anges. Detta är användbart om du har permanent nätverksåtkomst eller om "
"databasen av någon anledning har skadats. Observera att kommandot av "
"säkerhetsskäl inte som standard använder värdet B<DEBEMAIL> eller B<EMAIL>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3557
msgid "B<listcachedbugs> [I<number>]"
msgstr "B<listcachedbugs> [I<number>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3559
msgid ""
"List cached bug ids (intended to support bash completion). The optional "
"number argument restricts the list to those bug ids that start with that "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Lista cachelagrade felrapports-id:n (avsedd för stöd till bash-"
"komplettering). Det valfria talargumentet begränsar listan till felrapports-"
"id:n som börjar med talet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3591
msgid "B<version>"
msgstr "B<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3593
msgid "Display version and copyright information."
msgstr "Visa versions- och upphovsrättsinformation."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3608
msgid "B<help>"
msgstr "B<help>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:3610
msgid ""
"Display a short summary of commands, suspiciously similar to parts of this "
"man page."
msgstr ""
"Visa en kort kommandosammanfattning som misstänkt liknar delar av denna "
"manualsida."

#. type: SH
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5599 ../scripts/debuild.1:88 ../scripts/diff2patches.1:40
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES"
msgstr "MILJÖVARIABLER"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5603
msgid "B<DEBEMAIL>"
msgstr "B<DEBEMAIL>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5605
msgid ""
"If this is set, the From: line in the email will be set to use this email "
"address instead of your normal email address (as would be determined by "
"B<mail>)."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt använder From:-raden i e-postmeddelandet denna e-postadress i"
" stället för din vanliga e-postadress (såsom B<mail> skulle fastställa)."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5609
msgid "B<DEBFULLNAME>"
msgstr "B<DEBFULLNAME>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5611
msgid ""
"If B<DEBEMAIL> is set, B<DEBFULLNAME> is examined to determine the full name"
" to use; if this is not set, B<bts> attempts to determine a name from your "
"F<passwd> entry."
msgstr ""
"Om B<DEBEMAIL> är satt granskas B<DEBFULLNAME> för att fastställa vilket "
"fullständigt namn som ska användas. Om den inte är satt försöker B<bts> "
"fastställa ett namn utifrån din F<passwd>-post."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5615
msgid "B<BROWSER>"
msgstr "B<BROWSER>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5617
msgid ""
"If set, it specifies the browser to use for the B<show> and B<bugs> options."
" See L<sensible-brower(1)>."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt anger den webbläsaren som ska användas för alternativen "
"B<show> och B<bugs>. Se L<sensible-brower(1)>."

#. type: SH
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5622 ../scripts/debc.1:102 ../scripts/debchange.1:409
#: ../scripts/debcheckout.pl:180 ../scripts/debclean.1:93
#: ../scripts/debcommit.pl:108 ../scripts/debdiff.1:199 ../scripts/debi.1:108
#: ../scripts/debrelease.1:105 ../scripts/debrsign.1:57
#: ../scripts/debsign.1:105 ../scripts/debuild.1:327 ../scripts/dget.pl:701
#: ../scripts/dpkg-depcheck.1:102 ../scripts/dscverify.1:43
#: ../scripts/grep-excuses.1:46 ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:150
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:98 ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:106
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:42 ../scripts/rmadison.pl:673
#: ../scripts/uupdate.1:107 ../scripts/who-uploads.1:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "CONFIGURATION VARIABLES"
msgstr "KONFIGURATIONSVARIABLER"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5624
msgid ""
"The two configuration files F</etc/devscripts.conf> and F<~/.devscripts> are"
" sourced by a shell in that order to set configuration variables.  Command-"
"line options can be used to override configuration file settings.  "
"Environment variable settings are ignored for this purpose.  The currently "
"recognised variables are:"
msgstr ""
"De två konfigurationsfilerna F</etc/devscripts.conf> och F<~/.devscripts> "
"läses in av ett skal i den ordningen för att ange konfigurationsvariabler. "
"Kommandoradsalternativ kan användas för att åsidosätta inställningar i "
"konfigurationsfilen. Miljövariabelinställningar ignoreras för detta ändamål."
" De variabler som för närvarande känns igen är:"

#. type: =for
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5630
msgid "comment TODO: Replace \"Same as ...\" with more explicit \"Overridden by ...\""
msgstr ""
"comment TODO: Replace \"Same as ...\" with more explicit \"Overridden by "
"...\""

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5634
msgid "B<BTS_OFFLINE>"
msgstr "B<BTS_OFFLINE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5636
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<yes>, then it is the same as the B<--offline> command "
"line parameter being used.  Only has an effect on the B<show> and B<bugs> "
"commands.  The default is B<no>.  See the description of the B<show> command"
" above for more information."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> motsvarar det att kommandoradsparametern "
"B<--offline> används.  Har endast effekt på kommandona B<show> och B<bugs>."
"  Standard är B<no>.  Se beskrivningen av kommandot B<show> ovan för mer "
"information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5641
msgid "B<BTS_CACHE>"
msgstr "B<BTS_CACHE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5643
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<no>, then it is the same as the B<--no-cache> command "
"line parameter being used.  Only has an effect on the B<show> and B<bug> "
"commands.  The default is B<yes>.  Again, see the B<show> command above for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<no> motsvarar det att kommandoradsparametern B<--no-"
"cache> används. Har endast effekt på kommandona B<show> och B<bug>. Standard"
" är B<yes>. Se återigen kommandot B<show> ovan för mer information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5648
msgid "B<BTS_CACHE_MODE=>{B<min>,B<mbox>,B<full>}"
msgstr "B<BTS_CACHE_MODE=>{B<min>,B<mbox>,B<full>}"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5650
msgid ""
"How much of the BTS should we mirror when we are asked to cache something? "
"Just the minimum, or also the mbox or the whole thing? The default is "
"B<min>, and it has the same meaning as the B<--cache-mode> command-line "
"parameter.  Only has an effect on the cache.  See the B<cache> command for "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"Hur mycket av BTS ska speglas när något ska cachelagras? Bara minsta "
"mängden, även mbox eller allt? Standard är B<min>, med samma betydelse som "
"kommandoradsparametern B<--cache-mode>.  Har endast effekt på cachen.  Se "
"kommandot B<cache> för mer information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5656
msgid "B<BTS_FORCE_REFRESH>"
msgstr "B<BTS_FORCE_REFRESH>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5658
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<yes>, then it is the same as the B<--force-refresh> "
"command-line parameter being used.  Only has an effect on the B<cache> "
"command.  The default is B<no>.  See the B<cache> command for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> motsvarar det att kommandoradsparametern "
"B<--force-refresh> används.  Har endast effekt på kommandot B<cache>.  "
"Standard är B<no>.  Se kommandot B<cache> för mer information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5663
msgid "B<BTS_WORKFLOW>={B<mail>,B<web>}"
msgstr "B<BTS_WORKFLOW>={B<mail>,B<web>}"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5665
msgid ""
"Set the default I<Workflow Mode>. Overridden by \"Workflow Mode Options\" "
"B<--mail> and B<--web>, see B<OPTIONS>. See also \"Workflows\" in "
"B<DESCRIPTION>."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in standardläget I<arbetsflödesläge>. Åsidosätts av B<--mail> och "
"B<--web> under \"Alternativ för arbetsflödesläge\", se B<OPTIONS>. Se även "
"\"Arbetsflöden\" i B<DESCRIPTION>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5669
msgid "When set to B<mail> unlocks implicit enablement of B<--mutt>."
msgstr "När den är satt till B<mail> aktiveras B<--mutt> implicit."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5671
msgid "B<BTS_MAIL_READER>"
msgstr "B<BTS_MAIL_READER>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5673
msgid ""
"Interactive command-line mail client (MUA) to use for reading mailbox files "
"when using the mail workflow (B<--mail>, B<BTS_WORKFLOW=mail>)."
msgstr ""
"Interaktiv e-postklient för kommandoraden (MUA) som används för att läsa "
"brevlådefiler vid e-postarbetsflödet (B<--mail>, B<BTS_WORKFLOW=mail>)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5676
msgid ""
"Default depends on mailreaders available on the system. The following are "
"tried in order (first match wins):"
msgstr ""
"Standardvärdet beror på vilka e-postläsare som är tillgängliga i systemet. "
"Följande prövas i ordning (första träffen används):"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5681
msgid ""
"* A (supported) MUA B<bts> is running inside of as determined by examining "
"$_, the 'underscore' environment variable)."
msgstr ""
"* En MUA som stöds, som B<bts> körs inuti, enligt undersökning av $_, "
"miljövariabeln 'underscore'."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5684
msgid "* 'B<mutt -f %s>' -- if mutt is installed,"
msgstr "* 'B<mutt -f %s>' -- om mutt är installerat,"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5686
msgid "* 'B<neomutt -f %s>' -- if neomutt is installed,"
msgstr "* 'B<neomutt -f %s>' -- om neomutt är installerat,"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5688
msgid "* 'B<aerc -I mbox:%s>' -- if B<bts> is invoked from inside B<aerc>,"
msgstr "* 'B<aerc -I mbox:%s>' -- om B<bts> anropas inifrån B<aerc>,"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5690
msgid "* 'B<aerc mbox:%s>' -- if aerc is installed otherwise."
msgstr "* 'B<aerc mbox:%s>' -- annars om aerc är installerat."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5694
msgid "Can be overridden by B<--mailreader> command-line option."
msgstr "Kan åsidosättas med kommandoradsalternativet B<--mailreader>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5696
msgid "The 'B<%s>' is replaced by the path to an MBOX file."
msgstr "'B<%s>' ersätts med sökvägen till en MBOX-fil."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5698
msgid "B<BTS_MUTT_COMMAND>"
msgstr "B<BTS_MUTT_COMMAND>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5700
msgid ""
"Interactive command-line mail client (MUA) to use for interactively "
"composing and sending mails when B<--mutt> is active or implied."
msgstr ""
"Interaktiv e-postklient för kommandoraden (MUA) som används för att skriva "
"och skicka e-post interaktivt när B<--mutt> är aktiv eller implicit "
"aktiverad."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5703
msgid ""
"Default depends on mail clients available on the system. The following are "
"tried in order:"
msgstr ""
"Standardvärdet beror på vilka e-postklienter som är tillgängliga i systemet."
" Följande prövas i ordning:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5708
msgid ""
"* A supported MUA B<bts> is running inside of as determined by examining $_,"
" the 'underscore' environment variable)."
msgstr ""
"* En MUA som stöds, som B<bts> körs inuti, enligt undersökning av $_, "
"miljövariabeln 'underscore'."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5711
msgid "* 'B<mutt -H %s>' -- if mutt is installed,"
msgstr "* 'B<mutt -H %s>' -- om mutt är installerat,"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5713
msgid "* 'B<neomutt -H %s>' -- if neomutt is installed,"
msgstr "* 'B<neomutt -H %s>' -- om neomutt är installerat,"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5717
msgid ""
"The 'B<%s>' is replaced by the path to a raw draft email message file "
"including headers."
msgstr ""
"'B<%s>' ersätts med sökvägen till en rå utkastfil för ett e-postmeddelande, "
"inklusive brevhuvuden."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5720 ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:160 ../scripts/nmudiff.1:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<BTS_SENDMAIL_COMMAND>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SENDMAIL_COMMAND>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5722
msgid ""
"If this is set, specifies a B<sendmail> command to use instead of "
"F</usr/sbin/sendmail>.  Same as the B<--sendmail> command-line option."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt anger den ett B<sendmail>-kommando som ska användas i stället"
" för F</usr/sbin/sendmail>. Motsvarar kommandoradsalternativet "
"B<--sendmail>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5725
msgid "B<BTS_ONLY_NEW>"
msgstr "B<BTS_ONLY_NEW>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5727
msgid ""
"Download only new bugs when caching. Do not check for updates in bugs we "
"already have.  The default is B<no>.  Same as the B<--only-new> command-line"
" option."
msgstr ""
"Hämta endast nya felrapporter vid cachelagring. Kontrollera inte "
"uppdateringar för felrapporter som redan finns. Standard är B<no>. Motsvarar"
" kommandoradsalternativet B<--only-new>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5731
msgid "B<BTS_SMTP_HOST>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SMTP_HOST>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5733
msgid ""
"If this is set, specifies an SMTP host to use for sending mail rather than "
"using the B<sendmail> command.  Same as the B<--smtp-host> command-line "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt anger den en SMTP-värd som ska användas för att skicka e-post"
" i stället för kommandot B<sendmail>. Motsvarar kommandoradsalternativet "
"B<--smtp-host>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5737
msgid ""
"Note that this option takes priority over B<BTS_SENDMAIL_COMMAND> if both "
"are set, unless the B<--sendmail> option is used."
msgstr ""
"Observera att alternativet har företräde framför B<BTS_SENDMAIL_COMMAND> om "
"båda är satta, såvida inte B<--sendmail> används."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5740
msgid "B<BTS_SMTP_REPORTBUG>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SMTP_REPORTBUG>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5742
msgid ""
"If set to B<yes> use Debian's open submission reportbug.debian.org SMTP "
"server to send bug reports and change requests. No account registration or "
"authentication is needed but submissions are rate-limited to a couple per "
"hour."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> används Debians öppna SMTP-server "
"reportbug.debian.org för att skicka felrapporter och ändringsbegäranden. "
"Ingen kontoregistrering eller autentisering krävs, men insändningar "
"begränsas till ett par per timme."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5747
msgid ""
"If set to B<yes> it is equivalent to setting both "
"B<BTS_SMTP_HOST>=reportbug.debian.org:587 and B<BTS_INTERACTIVE>=yes."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> motsvarar den både "
"B<BTS_SMTP_HOST>=reportbug.debian.org:587 och B<BTS_INTERACTIVE>=yes."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5750
msgid "B<BTS_SMTP_AUTH_USERNAME>, B<BTS_SMTP_AUTH_PASSWORD>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SMTP_AUTH_USERNAME>, B<BTS_SMTP_AUTH_PASSWORD>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5752
msgid ""
"If these options are set, then it is the same as the B<--smtp-username> and "
"B<--smtp-password> options being used."
msgstr ""
"Om variablerna är satta motsvarar det att B<--smtp-username> och B<--smtp-"
"password> används."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5755
msgid "B<BTS_SMTP_HELO>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SMTP_HELO>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5757
msgid "Same as the B<--smtp-helo> command-line option."
msgstr "Motsvarar kommandoradsalternativet B<--smtp-helo>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5759
msgid "B<BTS_INCLUDE_RESOLVED>"
msgstr "B<BTS_INCLUDE_RESOLVED>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5761
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<no>, then it is the same as the B<--no-include-resolved>"
" command-line parameter being used.  Only has an effect on the B<cache> "
"command.  The default is B<yes>.  See the B<cache> command for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<no> motsvarar det att kommandoradsparametern B<--no-"
"include-resolved> används.  Har endast effekt på kommandot B<cache>.  "
"Standard är B<yes>.  Se kommandot B<cache> för mer information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5766
msgid "B<BTS_SUPPRESS_ACKS>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SUPPRESS_ACKS>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5768
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<yes>, then it is the same as the B<--no-ack> command "
"line parameter being used.  The default is B<no>."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> motsvarar det att kommandoradsparametern B<--no-"
"ack> används. Standard är B<no>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5771
msgid "B<BTS_INTERACTIVE>"
msgstr "B<BTS_INTERACTIVE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5773
msgid ""
"If this is set to B<yes> or B<force>, then it is the same as the "
"B<--interactive> or B<--force-interactive> command-line parameter being "
"used.  The default is B<no>."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt till B<yes> eller B<force> motsvarar det att "
"kommandoradsparametern B<--interactive> eller B<--force-interactive> "
"används.  Standard är B<no>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5777
msgid "B<BTS_DEFAULT_CC>"
msgstr "B<BTS_DEFAULT_CC>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5779
msgid ""
"Specify a list of e-mail addresses to which a carbon copy of the generated "
"e-mail to the control bot should automatically be sent."
msgstr ""
"Ange en lista med e-postadresser som automatiskt ska få en kopia av det "
"genererade e-postmeddelandet till kontrollboten."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5782
msgid "B<BTS_SERVER>"
msgstr "B<BTS_SERVER>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5784
msgid ""
"Specify the name of a debbugs server which should be used instead of "
"https://bugs.debian.org."
msgstr ""
"Ange namnet på en debbugs-server som ska användas i stället för "
"https://bugs.debian.org."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5791
msgid ""
"Please see L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/server-control> for more details on"
" how to control the BTS using emails and L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/> for"
" more information about the BTS."
msgstr ""
"Se L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/server-control> för mer information om hur "
"du styr BTS med hjälp av e-post och L<https://www.debian.org/Bugs/> för mer "
"information om BTS."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5795
msgid "querybts(1), reportbug(1), pts-subscribe(1), devscripts.conf(5)"
msgstr "querybts(1), reportbug(1), pts-subscribe(1), devscripts.conf(5)"

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5797 ../scripts/chdist.pl:145 ../scripts/debsnap.1:146
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:589 ../scripts/tagpending.pl:425
#, no-wrap
msgid "COPYRIGHT"
msgstr "UPPHOVSRÄTT"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5799
msgid ""
"This program is Copyright (C) 2001-2003 by Joey Hess <joeyh@debian.org>.  "
"Many modifications have been made, Copyright (C) 2002-2005 Julian Gilbey "
"<jdg@debian.org> and Copyright (C) 2007 Josh Triplett "
"<josh@freedesktop.org>."
msgstr ""
"Upphovsrätten till detta program innehas av Joey Hess (C) 2001-2003 "
"<joeyh@debian.org>. Många ändringar har gjorts; upphovsrätten till dem "
"innehas av Julian Gilbey (C) 2002-2005 <jdg@debian.org> och Josh Triplett "
"(C) 2007 <josh@freedesktop.org>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/bts.pl:5804 ../scripts/chdist.pl:150 ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:593
msgid ""
"It is licensed under the terms of the GPL, either version 2 of the License, "
"or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr ""
"Det är licensierat enligt GPL, antingen version 2 av licensen eller, efter "
