"rcs_5.7-23.dsc                  100%  490     0.5KB/s   00:00\n"
"rcs_5.7-23.diff.gz              100%   12KB  11.7KB/s   00:00\n"
"rcs_5.7-23_amd64.deb            100%  363KB 362.7KB/s   00:00\n"
"rcs_5.7-23_amd64.changes        100% 1095     1.1KB/s   00:00\n"
"$\n"

#. type: Plain text
