#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIST-UNRELEASED"
msgstr "LIST-UNRELEASED"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:4
msgid "list-unreleased - display UNRELEASED packages"
msgstr "list-unreleased - visa UNRELEASED-paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:6
msgid "B<list-unreleased> [I<arg> ...] [I<path> ...]"
msgstr "B<list-unreleased> [I<arg> ...] [I<path> ...]"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:9
msgid ""
"Searches for packages whose changelogs indicate there are pending changes "
"(UNRELEASED) and either lists them or displays the relevant changelog entry."
msgstr ""
"Söker efter paket vars ändringsloggar indikerar att det finns väntande "
"ändringar (UNRELEASED) och listar dem eller visar relevant ändringsloggpost."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:12
msgid ""
"By default it searches for packages under the current directory. If a path "
"is specified it will look for packages under that directory instead."
msgstr ""
"Som standard söker programmet efter paket under den aktuella katalogen. Om "
"en sökväg anges söks i stället efter paket under den katalogen."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-c>"
msgstr "B<-c>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:16
msgid "Display pending changes."
msgstr "Visa väntande ändringar."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-R>"
msgstr "B<-R>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:19
msgid "Don't recurse into subdirectories looking for packages."
msgstr "Sök inte i underkataloger efter paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/list-unreleased.1:23
msgid ""
"B<list-unreleased> was written by Frans Pop E<lt>elendil@planet.nlE<gt>.  "
"This manual page was written by Joey Hess E<lt>joeyh@debian.orgE<gt>."
msgstr ""
"B<list-unreleased> skrevs av Frans Pop E<lt>elendil@planet.nlE<gt>. "
"Manualsidan skrevs av Joey Hess E<lt>joeyh@debian.orgE<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:3
msgid "ltnu - lists packages of a maintainer ordered by last upload"
msgstr ""
"ltnu – listar en underhållares paket sorterade efter senaste uppladdning"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:7
msgid "B<env> DEBEMAIL=I<maintainer> B<ltnu> [-m]"
msgstr "B<env> DEBEMAIL=I<maintainer> B<ltnu> [-m]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:9
msgid "B<ltnu> [-m] I<maintainer>"
msgstr "B<ltnu> [-m] I<maintainer>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:11
msgid "B<ltnu> --help"
msgstr "B<ltnu> --help"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:15
msgid ""
"B<ltnu> (Long Time No Upload) queries the public mirror of the Ultimate "
"Debian Database (udd-mirror.debian.net) for all uploads of packages by the "
"given uploader or maintainer and displays them ordered by the last upload of"
" that package to Debian Unstable, oldest uploads first."
msgstr ""
"B<ltnu> (Long Time No Upload) söker i den offentliga spegeln av Ultimate "
"Debian Database (udd-mirror.debian.net) efter alla uppladdningar av paket "
"från angiven uppladdare eller underhållare. Resultatet sorteras efter "
"paketets senaste uppladdning till Debian Unstable, med de äldsta "
"uppladdningarna först."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:21
msgid ""
"Its primary purpose is to check which of your own or your team's packages "
"haven't been uploaded for a long time and likely need a packaging revamp. "
"It's less suitable for MIA team purposes as it doesn't make a difference "
"with regards to who actually uploaded a package."
msgstr ""
"Huvudsyftet är att kontrollera vilka av dina egna eller teamets paket som "
"inte har laddats upp på länge och sannolikt behöver en paketeringsöversyn. "
"Verktyget lämpar sig sämre för MIA-teamet eftersom det inte skiljer på vem "
"som faktiskt laddade upp ett paket."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:31
msgid "-m"
msgstr "-m"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:33
msgid "Only search in the Maintainer field and ignore the Uploaders field."
msgstr "Sök endast i fältet Maintainer och ignorera fältet Uploaders."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:37
msgid "PARAMETERS"
msgstr "PARAMETRAR"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:39
msgid ""
"The maintainer/uploader to query can be given either by setting C<$DEBEMAIL>"
" as environment variable or as single commandline parameter."
msgstr ""
"Underhållaren eller uppladdaren som ska frågas efter kan anges genom att "
"sätta C<$DEBEMAIL> som miljövariabel eller som en enda "
"kommandoradsparameter."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:42
msgid ""
"If a commandline parameter does not contain an C<@>, C<@debian.org> is "
"appended, e.g. C<ltnu abe> queries for C<abe@debian.org>."
msgstr ""
"Om en kommandoradsparameter saknar C<@> läggs C<@debian.org> till; C<ltnu "
"abe> frågar till exempel efter C<abe@debian.org>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:45
msgid ""
"Exceptions are some shortcuts for common, long e-mail addresses. So far "
"implemented shortcuts:"
msgstr ""
"Det finns undantag i form av genvägar för vanliga, långa e-postadresser. "
"Följande genvägar är hittills implementerade:"

