#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "MANPAGE-ALERT"
msgstr "MANPAGE-ALERT"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:4
msgid "manpage-alert - check for binaries without corresponding manpages"
msgstr "manpage-alert – kontrollera binärfiler utan motsvarande manualsidor"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:6
msgid "B<manpage-alert> [I<options>] [I<paths>]"
msgstr "B<manpage-alert> [I<options>] [I<paths>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:9
msgid ""
"B<manpage-alert> searches the given list of paths for binaries without "
"corresponding manpages."
msgstr ""
"B<manpage-alert> söker igenom angivna sökvägar efter binärfiler utan "
"motsvarande manualsidor."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:12
msgid ""
"If no I<paths> are specified on the command line, the path list I</bin /sbin"
" /usr/bin /usr/sbin /usr/games> will be assumed."
msgstr ""
"Om inga I<paths> anges på kommandoraden används sökvägslistan I</bin /sbin "
"/usr/bin /usr/sbin /usr/games>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-h>,B<--help>"
msgstr "B<-h>, B<--help>"

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-V>,B<--version>"
msgstr "B<-V>, B<--version>"

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-f>,B<--file>"
msgstr "B<-f>, B<--file>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:22
msgid "Show filenames of missing manpages without any leading text."
msgstr "Visa filnamn på saknade man-sidor utan någon inledande text."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-p>,B<--package>"
msgstr "B<-p>, B<--package>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:25
msgid "Show filenames of missing manpages with their package name."
msgstr "Visa filnamn på saknade man-sidor med deras paketnamn."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-n>,B<--no-stat>"
msgstr "B<-n>, B<--no-stat>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:28
msgid "Do not show statistics at the end."
msgstr "Visa inte statistik i slutet."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:33
msgid ""
"B<manpage-alert> was written by Branden Robinson and modified by Julian "
"Gilbey E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt> and Adam D. Barratt E<lt>debian-bts@adam-"
"barratt.org.ukE<gt> (who also wrote this manpage) for the devscripts "
"package."
msgstr ""
"B<manpage-alert> skrevs av Branden Robinson och ändrades av Julian Gilbey "
"E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt> och Adam D. Barratt E<lt>debian-bts@adam-"
"barratt.org.ukE<gt>, som också skrev denna manualsida, för paketet "
"devscripts."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/manpage-alert.1:35
msgid ""
"This manpage and the associated program are licensed under the terms of the "
"GPL, version 2 or later."
msgstr ""
"Denna manualsida och tillhörande program licensieras enligt GPL, version 2 "
"eller senare."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:23
msgid "mass-bug - mass-file a bug report against a list of packages"
msgstr "mass-bug – massanmäl en felrapport mot en paketlista"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:27
msgid ""
"B<mass-bug> [I<options>] B<--subject=\">I<bug subject>B<\"> I<template "
"package-list>"
msgstr ""
"B<mass-bug> [I<options>] B<--subject=\">I<bug subject>B<\"> I<template "
"package-list>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:31
msgid ""
"mass-bug assists in filing a mass bug report in the Debian BTS on a set of "
"packages. For each package in the package-list file (which should list one "
"package per line together with an optional version number separated from the"
" package name by an underscore), it fills out the template, adds BTS pseudo-"
"headers, and either displays or sends the bug report."
msgstr ""
"mass-bug hjälper till att skapa massfelrapporter i Debian BTS för en "
"uppsättning paket. För varje paket i paketlistfilen, som ska innehålla ett "
"paket per rad samt ett valfritt versionsnummer avskilt från paketnamnet med "
"ett understreck, fylls mallen i, BTS-pseudohuvuden läggs till och "
"felrapporten visas eller skickas."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:37
msgid ""
"Warning: Some care has been taken to avoid unpleasant and common mistakes, "
"but this is still a power tool that can generate massive amounts of bug "
"report mails. Use it with care, and read the documentation in the "
"Developer's Reference about mass filing of bug reports first."
msgstr ""
"Varning: Åtgärder har vidtagits för att undvika vanliga och otrevliga "
"misstag, men detta är fortfarande ett kraftfullt verktyg som kan skapa "
"mycket stora mängder felrapporter via e-post. Använd det varsamt och läs "
"först Developer’s Reference om massanmälan av felrapporter."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:42
msgid "TEMPLATE"
msgstr "MALL"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:44
msgid ""
"The template file is the body of the message that will be sent for each bug "
"report, excluding the BTS pseudo-headers. In the template, #PACKAGE# is "
"replaced with the name of the package. If a version was specified for the "
"package, #VERSION# will be replaced by that version."
msgstr ""
"Mallfilen är meddelandetexten som skickas för varje felrapport, utom BTS-"
"pseudohuvudena. I mallen ersätts #PACKAGE# med paketnamnet. Om en version "
"har angetts för paketet ersätts #VERSION# med den versionen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:49
msgid ""
"The components of the version number may be specified using #EPOCH#, "
"#UPSTREAM_VERSION# and #REVISION#. #EPOCH# includes the trailing colon and "
"#REVISION# the leading dash so that #EPOCH#UPSTREAM_VERSION##REVISION# is "
"always the same as #VERSION#."
msgstr ""
"Delarna av versionsnumret kan anges med #EPOCH#, #UPSTREAM_VERSION# och "
"#REVISION#. #EPOCH# innehåller det efterföljande kolonet och #REVISION# det "
"inledande bindestrecket, så att #EPOCH#UPSTREAM_VERSION##REVISION# alltid är"
" samma som #VERSION#."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:54
msgid ""
"If B<--include> has been passed, #INCLUDE# is replaced by the contents of "
"the named file. This contents is also subject to text wrapping as described "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Om B<--include> har angetts ersätts #INCLUDE# med innehållet i den namngivna"
" filen. Innehållet radbryts också enligt beskrivningen nedan."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:58
msgid ""
"Note that text in the template will be automatically word-wrapped to 70 "
"columns, up to the start of a signature (indicated by S<'-- '> at the start "
"of a line on its own). This is another reason to avoid including BTS pseudo-"
"headers in your template."
msgstr ""
"Observera att texten i mallen automatiskt radbryts till 70 kolumner fram "
"till början av en signatur, markerad med S<'-- '> i början av en egen rad. "
"Det är ytterligare ett skäl att inte ta med BTS-pseudohuvuden i mallen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:65
msgid ""
"B<mass-bug> examines the B<devscripts> configuration files as described "
"below.  Command line options override the configuration file settings, "
"though."
msgstr ""
"B<mass-bug> läser konfigurationsfilerna för B<devscripts> enligt "
"beskrivningen nedan. Kommandoradsalternativ åsidosätter dock inställningarna"
" i konfigurationsfilerna."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:71
msgid ""
"B<--severity=>(B<wishlist>|B<minor>|B<normal>|B<important>|B<serious>|B<grave>|B<critical>)"
msgstr ""
"B<--severity=>(B<wishlist>|B<minor>|B<normal>|B<important>|B<serious>|B<grave>|B<critical>)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:73
msgid ""
"Specify the severity with which bugs should be filed. Default is B<normal>."
msgstr ""
"Ange den allvarlighetsgrad som felrapporter ska få. Standardvärdet är "
"B<normal>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:76
msgid "B<--display>"
msgstr "B<--display>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:78
msgid ""
"Fill out the templates for each package and display them all for "
"verification. This is the default behavior."
msgstr ""
"Fyll i mallarna för varje paket och visa alla för granskning. Detta är "
"standardbeteendet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:81
msgid "B<--send>"
msgstr "B<--send>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:83
msgid "Actually send the bug reports."
msgstr "Skicka felrapporterna."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:85
msgid "B<--subject=\">I<bug subject>B<\">"
msgstr "B<--subject=\">I<bug subject>B<\">"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:87
msgid ""
"Specify the subject of the bug report. The subject will be automatically "
"prefixed with the name of the package that the bug is filed against."
msgstr ""
"Ange ämnet för felrapporten. Ämnet föregås automatiskt av namnet på paketet "
"som felrapporten gäller."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:90
msgid "B<--tags>"
msgstr "B<--tags>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:92
msgid "Set the BTS pseudo-header for tags."
msgstr "Ange BTS-pseudohuvudet för taggar."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:94 ../scripts/salsa.pl:650
msgid "B<--user>"
msgstr "B<--user>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:96
msgid "Set the BTS pseudo-header for a usertags' user."
msgstr "Ange BTS-pseudohuvudet för användaren för användartaggar."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:98
msgid "B<--usertags>"
msgstr "B<--usertags>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:100
msgid "Set the BTS pseudo-header for usertags."
msgstr "Ange BTS-pseudohuvudet för användartaggar."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:102
msgid "B<--control=>I<COMMAND>"
msgstr "B<--control=>I<COMMAND>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:104
msgid ""
"Add a BTS control command. This option may be repeated to add multiple "
"control commands. For example, if you are mass-bug-filing \"please stop "
"depending on this deprecated package\", and bug 123456 represents removal of"
" the deprecated package, you could use:"
msgstr ""
"Lägg till ett BTS-kontrollkommando. Alternativet kan upprepas för att lägga "
"till flera kontrollkommandon. Om du till exempel massanmäler ”please stop "
"depending on this deprecated package” och fel 123456 avser borttagning av "
"det föråldrade paketet kan du använda:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    mass-bug --control='block 123456 by -1' ...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"    mass-bug --control='block 123456 by -1' ...\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:111
msgid "B<--source>"
msgstr "B<--source>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:113
msgid ""
"Specify that package names refer to source packages rather than binary "
"packages."
msgstr "Ange att paketnamn avser källpaket snarare än binära paket."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:118
msgid ""
"Specify the B<sendmail> command.  The command will be split on white space "
"and will not be passed to a shell.  Default is F</usr/sbin/sendmail>."
msgstr ""
"Ange kommandot B<sendmail>. Kommandot delas vid blanksteg och skickas inte "
"till ett skal. Standardvärdet är F</usr/sbin/sendmail>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:121
msgid "B<--no-wrap>"
msgstr "B<--no-wrap>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:123
msgid "Do not wrap the template to lines of 70 characters."
msgstr "Radbryt inte mallen till rader med 70 tecken."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:130
msgid "B<--include=FILENAME>"
msgstr "B<--include=FILENAME>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:132
msgid ""
"Include the contents of B<FILENAME> in the template, replacing the #INCLUDE#"
" placeholder. A %s in B<FILENAME> gets replaced by the current package name."
msgstr ""
"Ta med innehållet i B<FILENAME> i mallen och ersätt platshållaren #INCLUDE#."
" Ett %s i B<FILENAME> ersätts med det aktuella paketnamnet."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:147
msgid ""
"B<DEBEMAIL> and B<EMAIL> can be set in the environment to control the email "
"address that the bugs are sent from."
msgstr ""
"B<DEBEMAIL> och B<EMAIL> kan sättas i miljön för att styra från vilken "
"e-postadress felrapporterna skickas."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:162
msgid ""
"If this is set, specifies a B<sendmail> command to use instead of "
"F</usr/sbin/sendmail>.  Same as the B<--sendmail> command line option."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt anger den ett B<sendmail>-kommando som används i stället för "
"F</usr/sbin/sendmail>. Samma som kommandoradsalternativet B<--sendmail>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mass-bug.pl:591
msgid "This program is Copyright (C) 2006 by Joey Hess <joeyh@debian.org>."
msgstr ""
"Detta program är upphovsrättsskyddat (C) 2006 av Joey Hess "
"<joeyh@debian.org>."

#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "MERGECHANGES"
msgstr "MERGECHANGES"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:4
msgid "mergechanges - merge multiple changes files"
msgstr "mergechanges – slå samman flera changes-filer"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:6
msgid ""
"B<mergechanges> [B<-d>] [B<-f>] [B<-S>] [B<-i>] I<file1 file2> [I<file>...]"
msgstr ""
"B<mergechanges> [B<-d>] [B<-f>] [B<-S>] [B<-i>] I<file1 file2> [I<file>...]"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:13
msgid ""
"B<mergechanges> merges two or more I<.changes> files, merging the "
"Architecture, Description and Files (and Checksums-*, if present)  fields of"
" the two.  There are checks made to ensure that the changes files are from "
"the same source package and version and use the same changes file Format.  "
"The first changes file is used as the basis and the information from the "
"later ones is merged into it."
msgstr ""
"B<mergechanges> sammanfogar två eller fler I<.changes>-filer och slår samman"
" deras fält Architecture, Description och Files, samt Checksums-* om de "
"finns. Kontroller görs för att säkerställa att changes-filerna har samma "
"källpaket, version och format. Den första filen används som grund och "
"informationen från senare filer läggs till i den."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:18
msgid ""
"The output is normally written to I<stdout>.  If the B<-f> option is given, "
"the output is written to I<package>_I<version>_multi.changes instead, in the"
" same directory as the first changes file listed."
msgstr ""
"Utdata skrivs normalt till I<stdout>. Om B<-f> anges skrivs den i stället "
"till I<package>_I<version>_multi.changes i samma katalog som den första "
"changes-filen i listan."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:21
msgid ""
"If the B<-d> option is given and the output is generated successfully, the "
"input files will be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet B<-d> anges och utdata genereras utan problem kommer "
"ingångsfilerna att raderas."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:25
msgid ""
"If the B<-i> or B<--indep> option is given, source packages and "
"architecture-independent (Architecture: all) packages are included in the "
"output, but architecture-dependent packages are not."
msgstr ""
"Om B<-i> eller B<--indep> anges tas källpaket och arkitekturoberoende paket "
"(Architecture: all) med i utdata, men inte arkitekturberoende paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:28
msgid ""
"If the B<-S> or B<--source> option is given, only source packages are "
"included in the output."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet B<-S> eller B<--source> anges, inkluderas endast källpaket i"
" utdata."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/mergechanges.1:33
msgid ""
"Gergely Nagy E<lt>algernon@debian.orgE<gt>, modifications by Julian Gilbey "
"E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt>, Mark Hymers E<lt>mhy@debian.orgE<gt>, Adam D. "
"Barratt E<lt>adam@adam-barratt.org.ukE<gt>, and Simon McVittie "
"E<lt>smcv@debian.orgE<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Gergely Nagy E<lt>algernon@debian.orgE<gt>, modifieringar av Julian Gilbey "
"E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt>, Mark Hymers E<lt>mhy@debian.orgE<gt>, Adam D. "
"Barratt E<lt>adam@adam-barratt.org.ukE<gt> och Simon McVittie "
"E<lt>smcv@debian.orgE<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:26
msgid ""
"mk-build-deps - build a package satisfying a package's build-dependencies"
msgstr "mk-build-deps – bygg ett paket som uppfyller ett pakets byggberoenden"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:30
msgid "B<mk-build-deps> B<--help>|B<--version>"
msgstr "B<mk-build-deps> B<--help>|B<--version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:32
msgid "B<mk-build-deps> [I<options>] I<control file> | I<package name> ..."
msgstr "B<mk-build-deps> [I<options>] I<control file> | I<package name> ..."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:36
msgid ""
"Given a I<package name> and/or I<control file>, B<mk-build-deps> will use "
"B<equivs> to generate a binary package which may be installed to satisfy all"
" the build dependencies of the given package."
msgstr ""
"Med ett I<package name> och/eller en I<control file> använder B<mk-build-"
"deps> B<equivs> för att skapa ett binärpaket som kan installeras för att "
"uppfylla alla byggberoenden för det angivna paketet."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:40
msgid ""
"If B<--build-dep> and/or B<--build-indep> are given, then the resulting "
"binary package(s) will depend solely on the Build-Depends/Build-Depends-"
"Indep dependencies, respectively."
msgstr ""
"Om B<--build-dep> och/eller B<--build-indep> anges beror de resulterande "
"binärpaketen enbart på Build-Depends- respektive Build-Depends-Indep-"
"beroenden."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:48
msgid "B<-i>, B<--install>"
msgstr "B<-i>, B<--install>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:50
msgid "Install the generated packages and its build-dependencies."
msgstr "Installera de skapade paketen och deras byggberoenden."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:52
msgid "B<-t>, B<--tool>"
msgstr "B<-t>, B<--tool>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:54
msgid ""
"When installing the generated package use the specified tool.  (default: "
"B<apt-get -o Debug::pkgProblemResolver=yes --no-install-recommends>)"
msgstr ""
"Använd det angivna verktyget när du installerar det genererade paketet. "
"(standard: B<apt-get -o Debug::pkgProblemResolver=yes --no-install-"
"recommends>)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:57
msgid "B<-r>, B<--remove>"
msgstr "B<-r>, B<--remove>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:59
msgid ""
"Remove the package file after installing it. Ignored if used without the "
"B<--install> switch."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort paketfilen efter installationen. Ignoreras om B<--install> inte "
"används."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:62
msgid "B<-a> I<foo>, B<--arch> I<foo>"
msgstr "B<-a> I<foo>, B<--arch> I<foo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:64
msgid ""
"Set the architecture of the produced binary package to I<foo>. If this "
"option is not given, fall back to the value given by B<--host-arch>. If "
"neither this option nor B<--host-arch> are given but the Build-Depends "
"contain architecture restrictions, use the value printed by `dpkg-"
"architecture -qDEB_HOST_ARCH`.  Otherwise, use I<all>."
msgstr ""
"Ange arkitekturen för det skapade binärpaketet som I<foo>. Om alternativet "
"inte anges används värdet från B<--host-arch>. Om varken detta eller "
"B<--host-arch> anges, men Build-Depends innehåller arkitekturbegränsningar, "
"används värdet från `dpkg-architecture -qDEB_HOST_ARCH`. Annars används "
"I<all>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:70
msgid ""
"The package architecture must be equal to the host architecture except if "
"the package architecture is I<all>."
msgstr ""
"Paketarkitekturen måste vara identisk med värdarkitekturen, förutom om "
"paketarkitekturen är I<all>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:73
msgid ""
"The package architecture cannot be I<all> if the build and host architecture"
" differ."
msgstr ""
"Paketarkitekturen kan inte vara I<all> om bygg- och värdarkitekturen skiljer"
" sig åt."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:76
msgid "B<--host-arch> I<foo>"
msgstr "B<--host-arch> I<foo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:78
msgid ""
"Set the host architecture the binary package is built for. This defaults to "
"the value printed by `dpkg-architecture -qDEB_HOST_ARCH`. Use this option to"
" create a binary package that is able to satisfy crossbuild dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Ange värdarkitekturen som binärpaketet byggs för. Standardvärdet är utdata "
"från `dpkg-architecture -qDEB_HOST_ARCH`. Använd alternativet för att skapa "
"ett binärpaket som kan uppfylla beroenden vid korsbygge."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:82
msgid ""
"If this option is used together with B<--arch>, then they must be equal "
"except if the value of B<--arch> is I<all>."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet används tillsammans med B<--arch> måste värdena vara lika, "
"utom när B<--arch> har värdet I<all>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:85
msgid ""
"If B<--arch> is not given, then this option also sets the package "
"architecture."
msgstr ""
"Om B<--arch> inte anges ställer detta alternativ också in paketarkitekturen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:87
msgid "B<--build-arch> I<foo>"
msgstr "B<--build-arch> I<foo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:89
msgid ""
"Set the build architecture the binary package is built for. This defaults to"
" the value printed by `dpkg-architecture -qDEB_BUILD_ARCH`. Use this option "
"to create a binary package that is able to satisfy crossbuild dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Ange byggarkitekturen som binärpaketet byggs för. Standardvärdet är utdata "
"från `dpkg-architecture -qDEB_BUILD_ARCH`. Använd alternativet för att skapa"
" ett binärpaket som kan uppfylla beroenden vid korsbygge."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:93
msgid "B<-B>, B<--build-dep>"
msgstr "B<-B>, B<--build-dep>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:95
msgid ""
"Generate a package which only depends on the source package's Build-Depends "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett paket som endast beror på källpaketets Build-Depends-beroenden."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:98
msgid "B<-A>, B<--build-indep>"
msgstr "B<-A>, B<--build-indep>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:100
msgid ""
"Generate a package which only depends on the source package's Build-Depends-"
"Indep dependencies."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett paket som endast beror på källpaketets Build-Depends-Indep-"
"beroenden."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:103
msgid "B<-P>, B<--build-profiles> I<profile[,...]>"
msgstr "B<-P>, B<--build-profiles> I<profile[,...]>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:105
msgid ""
"Generate a package which only depends on build dependencies with the build "
"profile(s), given as a comma-separated list.  The default behavior is to use"
" no specific profile.  Setting this option will override the "
"B<DEB_BUILD_PROFILES> environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett paket som endast beror på byggberoenden med byggprofilerna i den "
"kommaseparerade listan. Standard är att inte använda någon särskild profil. "
"Alternativet åsidosätter miljövariabeln B<DEB_BUILD_PROFILES>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:119
msgid "B<-s>, B<--root-cmd>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--root-cmd>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:121
msgid ""
"Use the specified tool to gain root privileges before installing.  Ignored "
"if used without the B<--install> switch."
msgstr ""
"Använd angivet verktyg för att få rootbehörighet före installationen. "
"Ignoreras om B<--install> inte används."

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:128
msgid "External environment"
msgstr "Extern miljö"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:132
msgid "B<DEB_BUILD_PROFILES>"
msgstr "B<DEB_BUILD_PROFILES>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:134
msgid ""
"If set, it will be used as the active build profile(s) for the build "
"dependencies to be installed.  It is a space separated list of profile "
"names.  Overridden by the B<-P> option."
msgstr ""
"Om den är satt används den som aktiva byggprofiler för byggberoendena som "
"ska installeras. Den är en mellanslagsseparerad lista med profilnamn. "
"Åsidosätts av B<-P>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:143
msgid ""
"B<mk-build-deps> is copyright by Vincent Fourmond and was modified for the "
"devscripts package by Adam D. Barratt <adam@adam-barratt.org.uk>."
msgstr ""
"B<mk-build-deps> har upphovsrätt av Vincent Fourmond och ändrades för "
"paketet devscripts av Adam D. Barratt <adam@adam-barratt.org.uk>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-build-deps.pl:146 ../scripts/transition-check.pl:77
msgid ""
"This program comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY.  You are free to "
"redistribute this code under the terms of the GNU General Public License, "
"version 2 or later."
msgstr ""
"Programmet levereras UTAN NÅGON SOM HELST GARANTI. Du får fritt distribuera "
"koden enligt GNU General Public License, version 2 eller senare."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:27
msgid ""
"mk-origtargz - rename upstream tarball, optionally changing the compression "
"and removing unwanted files"
msgstr ""
"mk-origtargz – byt namn på uppströms tararkiv, ändra vid behov "
"komprimeringen och ta bort oönskade filer"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:33
msgid "B<mk-origtargz> [I<options>] F<foo-1.0.tar.gz>"
msgstr "B<mk-origtargz> [I<options>] F<foo-1.0.tar.gz>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:35
msgid "B<mk-origtargz> B<--help>"
msgstr "B<mk-origtargz> B<--help>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:41
msgid ""
"B<mk-origtargz> renames the given file to match what is expected by B<dpkg-"
"buildpackage>, based on the source package name and version in "
"F<debian/changelog>. It can convert B<zip> to B<tar>, optionally change the "
"compression scheme and remove files according to B<Files-Excluded> and "
"B<Files-Excluded->I<component> in F<debian/copyright>. The resulting file is"
" placed in F<debian/../..>. (In F<debian/copyright>, the B<Files-Excluded> "
"and B<Files-Excluded->I<component> stanzas are a part of the first paragraph"
" and there is a blank line before the following paragraphs which contain "
"B<Files> and other stanzas. The B<Files-Included> stanza may be used to "
"ignore parts of subdirectories specified by the B<Files-Excluded> stanza. "
"See B<uscan>(1) \"COPYRIGHT FILE EXAMPLE\".)"
msgstr ""
"B<mk-origtargz> byter namn på den angivna filen så att den motsvarar vad "
"B<dpkg-buildpackage> förväntar sig, utifrån källpaketets namn och version i "
"F<debian/changelog>. Verktyget kan konvertera B<zip> till B<tar>, ändra "
"komprimeringsmetod vid behov och ta bort filer enligt styckena B<Files-"
"Excluded> och B<Files-Excluded->I<component> i F<debian/copyright>. Den "
"resulterande filen placeras i F<debian/../..>. (I F<debian/copyright> ingår "
"styckena B<Files-Excluded> och B<Files-Excluded->I<component> i första "
"stycket. En tom rad följer före styckena med B<Files> och andra fält. "
"Stycket B<Files-Included> kan användas för att ignorera delar av "
"underkataloger som anges av B<Files-Excluded>. Se ”COPYRIGHT FILE EXAMPLE” i"
" B<uscan>(1).)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:53
msgid ""
"The archive type for B<zip> is detected by \"B<file --dereference --brief "
"--mime-type>\" command.  So any B<zip> type archives such as B<jar> and "
"B<xpi> are treated in the same way."
msgstr ""
"Arkivtypen B<zip> identifieras med kommandot ”B<file --dereference --brief "
"--mime-type>”. Därför behandlas alla arkiv av B<zip>-typ, som B<jar> och "
"B<xpi>, på samma sätt."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:57
msgid ""
"If the package name is given via the B<--package> option, no information is "
"read from F<debian/>, and the result file is placed in the current "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Om paketnamnet anges med B<--package> läses ingen information från "
"F<debian/>, och resultatfilen placeras i den aktuella katalogen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:60
msgid ""
"B<mk-origtargz> is commonly called via B<uscan>, which first obtains the "
"upstream tarball."
msgstr ""
"B<mk-origtargz> anropas vanligen via B<uscan>, som först hämtar "
"uppströmskällarkivet."

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:65
msgid "Metadata options"
msgstr "Metadataalternativ"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:67
msgid ""
"The following options extend or replace information taken from F<debian/>."
msgstr ""
"Följande alternativ utökar eller ersätter information hämtad från "
"F<debian/>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:73
msgid ""
"Use I<package> as the name of the Debian source package, and do not require "
"or use a F<debian/> directory. This option can only be used together with "
"B<--version>."
msgstr ""
"Använd I<paket> som namn på Debian-källpaketet och varken kräv eller använd "
"en F<debian/>-katalog. Det här alternativet kan bara användas tillsammans "
"med B<--version>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:77
msgid ""
"The default is to use the package name of the first entry in "
"F<debian/changelog>."
msgstr ""
"Standardinställningen är att använda paketnamnet för den första posten i "
"F<debian/changelog>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:79
msgid "B<-v>, B<--version> I<version>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--version> I<version>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:81
msgid ""
"Use I<version> as the version of the package. This needs to be the upstream "
"version portion of a full Debian version, i.e. no Debian revision, no epoch."
msgstr ""
"Använd I<version> som paketets version. Det ska vara uppströmsversionsdelen "
"av en fullständig Debian-version, alltså utan Debian-revision och utan epok."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:84
msgid ""
"The default is to use the upstream portion of the version of the first entry"
" in F<debian/changelog>."
msgstr ""
"Standardinställningen är att använda uppströmsdelen av versionen av den "
"första posten i F<debian/changelog>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:87
msgid "B<--exclude-file> I<glob>"
msgstr "B<--exclude-file> I<glob>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:89
msgid ""
"Remove files matching the given I<glob> from the tarball, as if it was "
"listed in B<Files-Excluded>."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort filer som matchar angivet I<glob> från källarkivet, som om de angavs"
" i B<Files-Excluded>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:92
msgid "B<--include-file> I<glob>"
msgstr "B<--include-file> I<glob>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:94
msgid ""
"Include previously excluded files matching the given I<glob> in the tarball,"
" as if it was listed in B<Files-Included>."
msgstr ""
"Inkludera tidigare uteslutna filer som matchar angivet I<glob> i "
"källarkivet, som om de angavs i B<Files-Included>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:97
msgid "B<--copyright-file> I<filename>"
msgstr "B<--copyright-file> I<filename>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:99
msgid ""
"Remove files matching the patterns found in I<filename>, which should have "
"the format of a Debian F<copyright> file (B<Format: "
"https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/> to be "
"precise). Errors parsing that file are silently ignored, exactly as is the "
"case with F<debian/copyright>."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort filer som matchar mönstren i I<filename>, som ska ha formatet för en"
" Debian F<copyright>-fil (närmare bestämt B<Format: "
"https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/>). Fel "
"när den filen tolkas ignoreras utan varning, precis som för "
"F<debian/copyright>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:105
msgid ""
"Unmatched patterns will emit a warning so the user can verify whether it is "
"correct.  If there are multiple patterns which match a file, only the last "
"one will count as being matched."
msgstr ""
"Mönster som inte matchar ger en varning så att användaren kan kontrollera "
"att det är rätt. Om flera mönster matchar en fil räknas bara det sista som "
"matchat."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:109
msgid ""
"The B<--exclude-file>, B<--include-file> and B<--copyright-file> options "
"amend the list of patterns found in F<debian/copyright>. If you do not want "
"to read that file, you will have to use B<--package>."
msgstr ""
"Alternativen B<--exclude-file>, B<--include-file> och B<--copyright-file> "
"ändrar listan över mönster som finns i F<debian/copyright>. Om du inte vill "
"läsa den filen måste du använda B<--package>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:113
msgid "B<--signature> I<signature-mode>"
msgstr "B<--signature> I<signature-mode>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:115
msgid "Set I<signature-mode>:"
msgstr "Ange I<signature-mode>:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:119
msgid "0 for no signature"
msgstr "0 för ingen signatur"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:121
msgid "1 for normal detached signature"
msgstr "1 för normal fristående signatur"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:123
msgid "2 for signature on decompressed"
msgstr "2 för signatur för dekomprimerad fil"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:125
msgid "3 for self signature"
msgstr "3 för egen signatur"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:129
msgid "B<--signature-file> I<signature-file>"
msgstr "B<--signature-file> I<signature-file>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:131
msgid ""
"Use I<signature-file> as the signature file corresponding to the Debian "
"source package to create a B<dpkg-source> (post-stretch) compatible "
"signature file.  (optional)"
msgstr ""
"Använd I<signature-file> som signaturfilen för Debian-källpaketet för att "
"skapa en B<dpkg-source>-kompatibel signaturfil för post-stretch. (valfritt)"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:137
msgid "Action options"
msgstr "Åtgärdsalternativ"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:139
msgid ""
"These options specify what exactly B<mk-origtargz> should do. The options "
"B<--copy>, B<--rename> and B<--symlink> are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"Dessa alternativ anger exakt vad B<mk-origtargz> ska göra. Alternativen "
"B<--copy>, B<--rename> och B<--symlink> utesluter varandra."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:144 ../scripts/uscan.pl:520
msgid "B<--symlink>"
msgstr "B<--symlink>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:146
msgid ""
"Make the resulting file a symlink to the given original file. (This is the "
"default behaviour.)"
msgstr ""
"Gör den resulterande filen till en symbolisk länk till den angivna "
"originalfilen. (Detta är standardbeteendet.)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:149
msgid ""
"If the file has to be modified (because it is a B<zip>, B<xpi> or B<zst> "
"file, because of B<--repack> or B<Files-Excluded>), this option behaves like"
" B<--copy>."
msgstr ""
"Om filen måste ändras (eftersom den är en B<zip>-, B<xpi>- eller B<zst>-fil,"
" eller på grund av B<--repack> eller B<Files-Excluded>) fungerar det här "
"alternativet som B<--copy>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:153 ../scripts/uscan.pl:525
msgid "B<--copy>"
msgstr "B<--copy>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:155
msgid ""
"Make the resulting file a copy of the original file (unless it has to be "
"modified, of course)."
msgstr ""
"Gör den resulterande filen till en kopia av originalfilen (om den inte måste"
" modifieras, förstås)."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:158 ../scripts/uscan.pl:529
msgid "B<--rename>"
msgstr "B<--rename>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:160
msgid "Rename the original file."
msgstr "Byt namn på originalfilen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:162
msgid ""
"If the file has to be modified (because it is a B<zip>, B<xpi>, B<zst> file,"
" because of B<--repack> or B<Files-Excluded>), this implies that the "
"original file is deleted afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Om filen måste ändras (eftersom den är en B<zip>-, B<xpi>- eller B<zst>-fil,"
" eller på grund av B<--repack> eller B<Files-Excluded>) innebär detta att "
"originalfilen därefter tas bort."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:166 ../scripts/uscan.pl:533
msgid "B<--repack>"
msgstr "B<--repack>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:168
msgid ""
"If the given file is not compressed using the desired format (see "
"B<--compression>), recompress it."
msgstr ""
"Om filen inte är komprimerad i önskat format (se B<--compression>), "
"komprimera den på nytt."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:171
msgid "B<-S>, B<--repack-suffix> I<suffix>"
msgstr "B<-S>, B<--repack-suffix> I<suffix>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:173
msgid ""
"If the file has to be modified, because of B<Files-Excluded>, append "
"I<suffix> to the upstream version."
msgstr ""
"Om filen måste modifieras på grund av B<Files-Excluded>, lägg till I<suffix>"
" till uppströmsversionen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:176
msgid "B<--force-repack>"
msgstr "B<--force-repack>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:178
msgid ""
"Recompress even if file is compressed using the desired format and no files "
"were deleted."
msgstr ""
"Komprimera om även om filen är komprimerad i önskat format och inga filer "
"har raderats."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:181
msgid "B<-c>, B<--component> I<componentname>"
msgstr "B<-c>, B<--component> I<componentname>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:183
msgid ""
"Use <componentname> as the component name for the secondary upstream "
"tarball.  Set I<componentname> as the component name.  This is used only for"
" the secondary upstream tarball of the Debian source package.  Then "
"I<packagename_version.orig-componentname.tar.gz> is created."
msgstr ""
"Använd <componentname> som komponentnamn för det sekundära "
"uppströmskällarkivet. Ange I<componentname> som komponentnamn. Detta används"
" bara för Debian-källpaketets sekundära uppströmskällarkiv. Därefter skapas "
"I<packagename_version.orig-componentname.tar.gz>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:188
msgid "B<--compression> [ B<gzip> | B<bzip2> | B<lzma> | B<xz> | B<default> ]"
msgstr ""
"B<--compression> [ B<gzip> | B<bzip2> | B<lzma> | B<xz> | B<default> ]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:190
msgid ""
"The default method is B<xz>. When mk-origtargz is launched in a debian "
"source repository which format is \"1.0\" or undefined, the method switches "
"to B<gzip>."
msgstr ""
"Standardmetoden är B<xz>. När mk-origtargz startas i ett Debian-"
"källkodsarkiv med formatet \"1.0\" eller odefinierat, växlar metoden till "
"B<gzip>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:193
msgid "B<-C>, B<--directory> I<directory>"
msgstr "B<-C>, B<--directory> I<directory>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:195
msgid "Put the resulting file in the given directory."
msgstr "Placera den resulterande filen i den angivna katalogen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:197
msgid "B<--unzipopt> I<options>"
msgstr "B<--unzipopt> I<options>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:199
msgid ""
"Add the extra options to use with the B<unzip> command such as B<-a>, "
"B<-aa>, and B<-b>."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till extra alternativ som kan användas med kommandot B<unzip>, till "
"exempel B<-a>, B<-aa> och B<-b>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:216
msgid "B<uscan>(1), B<uupdate>(1)"
msgstr "B<uscan>(1), B<uupdate>(1)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/mk-origtargz.pl:220
msgid ""
"B<mk-origtargz> and this manpage have been written by Joachim Breitner "
"<I<nomeata@debian.org>>."
msgstr ""
"B<mk-origtargz> och den här manualsidan har skrivits av Joachim Breitner "
"<I<nomeata@debian.org>>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:5
msgid "namecheck - Check project names are not already taken."
msgstr "namecheck - Kontrollera att projektnamnen inte redan är upptagna."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:7
msgid "ABOUT"
msgstr "OM"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:9
msgid ""
"This is a simple tool to automate the testing of project names at the most "
"common Open Source / Free Software hosting environments."
msgstr ""
"Detta är ett enkelt verktyg för att automatisera testningen av projektnamn i"
" de vanligaste miljöerna för öppen källkod/fri programvara."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:12
msgid ""
"Each new project requires a name, and those names are ideally unique.  To "
"come up with names is hard, and testing to ensure they're not already in use"
" is time-consuming - unless you have a tool such as this one."
msgstr ""
"Varje nytt projekt behöver ett namn, och helst ska namnen vara unika. Det är"
" svårt att komma på namn, och det är tidskrävande att kontrollera att de "
"inte redan används – om man inte har ett verktyg som detta."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:16
msgid "CUSTOMIZATION"
msgstr "ANPASSNING"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:18
msgid ""
"The script, as is, contains a list of sites, and patterns, to test against."
msgstr ""
"Skriptet innehåller en lista över webbplatser och mönster som ska testas."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:20
msgid ""
"If those patterns aren't sufficient then you may create your own additions "
"and add them to the script.  If you wish to have your own version of the "
"patterns you may save them into the file ~/.namecheckrc"
msgstr ""
"Om dessa mönster inte är tillräckliga kan du skapa egna tillägg och lägga "
"till dem i skriptet. Om du vill ha din egen version av mönstren kan du spara"
" dem i filen ~/.namecheckrc"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:26
msgid "Steve -- http://www.steve.org.uk/"
msgstr "Steve -- http://www.steve.org.uk/"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:32
msgid "Copyright (c) 2008 by Steve Kemp.  All rights reserved."
msgstr "Copyright (c) 2008 av Steve Kemp. Alla rättigheter förbehållna."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/namecheck.pl:34
msgid ""
"This module is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under"
" the same terms as Perl itself."
msgstr ""
"Denna modul är fri programvara; du kan distribuera och/eller modifiera den "
"under samma villkor som Perl själv."

#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "NMUDIFF"
msgstr "NMUDIFF"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:4
msgid "nmudiff - email an NMU diff to the Debian BTS"
msgstr "nmudiff - skicka en NMU-diff till Debian BTS via e-post"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:6
msgid "B<nmudiff> [I<options>]"
msgstr "B<nmudiff> [I<options>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:9
msgid ""
"B<nmudiff> is the tool to be used while preparing a Non-Maintainer Upload "
"(NMU) to notify the maintainer about the work being done."
msgstr ""
"B<nmudiff> är det verktyg som ska användas vid förberedelse av en Non-"
"Maintainer Upload (NMU) för att meddela underhållaren om det arbete som "
"utförs."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:19
msgid ""
"B<nmudiff> should be run in the source tree of the package being NMUed, "
"after the NMU is built. It assumes that the source packages (specifically, "
"the I<.dsc> and any corresponding I<tar> and I<diff> files) for both the "
"previous version of the package and the newly built NMU version are in the "
"parent directory. It then uses B<debdiff> to generate a diff between the "
"previous version and the current NMU, and either runs mutt or an editor "
"(using B<sensible-editor>) so that the mail message (including the diff) can"
" be examined and modified; once you exit the editor the diff will be mailed "
"to the Debian BTS."
msgstr ""
"B<nmudiff> bör köras i källkodsträdet för paketet som NMU-överförs, efter "
"att NMU:n har byggts. Det förutsätter att källkodspaketen (särskilt I<.dsc> "
"och motsvarande I<tar>- och I<diff>-filer) för både paketets tidigare "
"version och den nybyggda NMU-versionen finns i den överordnade katalogen. "
"Därefter använder det B<debdiff> för att skapa en diff mellan den tidigare "
"versionen och den aktuella NMU:n, och startar antingen mutt eller en "
"textredigerare (med B<sensible-editor>) så att e-postmeddelandet, inklusive "
"diffen, kan granskas och ändras. När du avslutar textredigeraren skickas "
"diffen till Debian BTS."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:24
msgid ""
"The default behaviour is that if exactly one bug is closed by this NMU, then"
" that bug will be mailed, otherwise a new bug will be submitted.  This "
"behaviour may be changed by command line options and configuration file "
"options."
msgstr ""
"Som standard skickas ett e-postmeddelande till felrapporten om exakt en "
"felrapport stängs genom denna NMU; annars skickas en ny felrapport in. Detta"
" beteende kan ändras med kommandoradsalternativ och alternativ i "
"konfigurationsfilen."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--new>"
msgstr "B<--new>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:29
msgid ""
"Instead of mailing the bug reports which are to be closed by this NMU, a new"
" bug report is submitted directly to the BTS."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att skicka buggrapporterna som ska stängas av denna NMU, "
"skickas en ny buggrapport direkt till BTS."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:34
msgid ""
"Send the bug report to all of the bugs which are being closed by this NMU, "
"rather than opening a new bug report.  This option has no effect if no bugs "
"are being closed by this NMU."
msgstr ""
"Skicka felrapporten till alla felrapporter som stängs genom denna NMU, i "
"stället för att öppna en ny felrapport. Det här alternativet har ingen "
"effekt om denna NMU inte stänger några felrapporter."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:39
msgid ""
"Use B<mutt>(1) (or B<neomutt>(1)) for editing and sending the message to the"
" BTS (default behaviour).  This can be controlled using a configuration file"
" option (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Använd B<mutt>(1) (eller B<neomutt>(1)) för att redigera och skicka "
"meddelandet till BTS (standardbeteendet). Detta kan styras med ett "
"alternativ i konfigurationsfilen (se nedan)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:44
msgid ""
"Use B<sensible-editor>(1) to edit the message and then mail it directly "
"using I</usr/bin/sendmail>.  This can be controlled using a configuration "
"file option (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Använd B<sensible-editor>(1) för att redigera meddelandet och skicka det "
"sedan direkt med I</usr/bin/sendmail>. Detta kan styras med ett alternativ i"
" konfigurationsfilen (se nedan)."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--mua> I<MUACMD>"
msgstr "B<--mua> I<MUACMD>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:50
msgid ""
"Use the given command as a mail user agent (MUA). The command will be split "
"on white space and will be interpreted by the shell. The command will be "
"given a I<mailto:> URL as first argument. The B<thunderbird> is a known "
"example of a program that is compatible with this option."
msgstr ""
"Använd det angivna kommandot som e-postklient (MUA). Kommandot delas vid "
"blanksteg och tolkas av skalet. Kommandot får en I<mailto:>-URL som första "
"argument. B<thunderbird> är ett känt exempel på ett program som är "
"kompatibelt med det här alternativet."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--sendmail> I<SENDMAILCMD>"
msgstr "B<--sendmail> I<SENDMAILCMD>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:60
msgid ""
"Specify the B<sendmail> command.  The command will be split on white space "
"and will be interpreted by the shell.  Default is I</usr/sbin/sendmail>.  "
"The B<-t> option will be automatically added if the command is "
"I</usr/sbin/sendmail> or I</usr/sbin/exim*>.  For other mailers, if they "
"require a B<-t> option, this must be included in the I<SENDMAILCMD>, for "
"example: B<--sendmail=\"/usr/sbin/mymailer -t\">.  This can also be set "
"using the devscripts configuration files; see below."
msgstr ""
"Ange B<sendmail>-kommandot. Kommandot delas vid blanksteg och tolkas av "
"skalet. Standard är I</usr/sbin/sendmail>. Alternativet B<-t> läggs "
"automatiskt till om kommandot är I</usr/sbin/sendmail> eller "
"I</usr/sbin/exim*>. För andra e-postprogram måste B<-t>, om det krävs, ingå "
"i I<SENDMAILCMD>, till exempel B<--sendmail=\"/usr/sbin/mymailer -t\">. "
"Detta kan också anges i devscripts-konfigurationsfilerna; se nedan."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--from> I<EMAIL>"
msgstr "B<--from> I<EMAIL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:68
msgid ""
"If using the B<sendmail> (B<--no-mutt>) option, then the email to the BTS "
"will be sent using the name and address in the environment variables "
"B<DEBEMAIL> and B<DEBFULLNAME>.  If these are not set, then the variables "
"B<EMAIL> and B<NAME> will be used instead.  These can be overridden using "
"the B<--from> option.  The program will not work in this case if an email "
"address cannot be determined."
msgstr ""
"Om alternativet B<sendmail> (B<--no-mutt>) används, skickas "
"e-postmeddelandet till BTS med namnet och adressen i miljövariablerna "
"B<DEBEMAIL> och B<DEBFULLNAME>.  Om dessa inte är inställda används istället"
" variablerna B<EMAIL> och B<NAME>.  Dessa kan åsidosättas med alternativet "
"B<--from>.  Programmet fungerar inte i detta fall om en e-postadress inte "
"kan fastställas."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--delay> I<DELAY>"
msgstr "B<--delay> I<DELAY>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:75
msgid ""
"Indicate in the generated mail that the NMU has been uploaded to the DELAYED"
" queue, with a delay of I<DELAY> days.  The default value is I<XX> which "
"adds a placeholder to the e-mail.  A value of B<0> indicates that the upload"
" has not been sent to a delayed queue.  This can also be set using the "
"devscripts configuration files; see below."
msgstr ""
"Ange i det skapade e-postmeddelandet att NMU:n har laddats upp till DELAYED-"
"kön, med en fördröjning på I<DELAY> dagar. Standardvärdet I<XX> lägger till "
"en platshållare i e-postmeddelandet. Värdet B<0> anger att uppladdningen "
"inte har skickats till en fördröjd kö. Detta kan också anges i devscripts-"
"konfigurationsfilerna; se nedan."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--no-delay>, B<--nodelay>"
msgstr "B<--no-delay>, B<--nodelay>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:78
msgid "Equivalent to B<--delay 0>."
msgstr "Motsvarar B<--delay 0>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:82
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--no-pending>, B<--nopending>"
msgstr "B<--no-pending>, B<--nopending>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:85
msgid "Do not add the I<pending> tag."
msgstr "Lägg inte till taggen I<pending>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--non-dd>, B<--nondd>"
msgstr "B<--non-dd>, B<--nondd>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:88
msgid "Mention in the email that you require sponsorship."
msgstr "Ange i e-postmeddelandet att du behöver sponsring."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--template> I<TEMPLATEFILE>"
msgstr "B<--template> I<TEMPLATEFILE>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:92
msgid ""
"Use content of TEMPLATEFILE for message body instead of default template.  "
"If TEMPLATEFILE does not exist, default template is applied."
msgstr ""
"Använd innehållet i TEMPLATEFILE för meddelandetexten istället för "
"standardmallen. Om TEMPLATEFILE inte finns används standardmallen."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<NMUDIFF_DELAY>"
msgstr "B<NMUDIFF_DELAY>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:110
msgid ""
"If this is set to a number, e-mails generated by B<nmudiff> will by default "
"mention an upload to the DELAYED queue, delayed for the specified number of "
"days.  The value B<0> indicates that the DELAYED queue has not been used."
msgstr ""
"Om detta anges som ett tal nämner e-postmeddelanden från B<nmudiff> som "
"standard en uppladdning till DELAYED-kön, fördröjd med det angivna antalet "
"dagar. Värdet B<0> anger att DELAYED-kön inte har använts."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<NMUDIFF_MUTT>"
msgstr "B<NMUDIFF_MUTT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:115
msgid ""
"Can be I<yes> (default) or I<no>, and specifies whether to use B<mutt> (or "
"B<neomutt>) to compose and send the message or not, as described above."
msgstr ""
"Kan vara I<yes> (standard) eller I<no>, och anger om B<mutt> (eller "
"B<neomutt>) ska användas för att skriva och skicka meddelandet eller inte, "
"enligt beskrivningen ovan."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<NMUDIFF_NEWREPORT>"
msgstr "B<NMUDIFF_NEWREPORT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:123
msgid ""
"This option controls whether a new bug report is made, or whether the diff "
"is sent to the bugs closed by this NMU.  Can be I<maybe> (default), which "
"sends to the existing bug reports if exactly one bug is being closed; "
"I<yes>, which always creates a new report, or I<no>, which always sends to "
"the reports of the bugs being closed (unless no bugs are being closed, in "
"which case a new report is always made)."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet styr om en ny felrapport skapas eller om diffen skickas"
" till de felrapporter som stängs genom denna NMU. Det kan vara I<maybe> "
"(standard), som skickar till den befintliga felrapporten om exakt en "
"felrapport stängs, I<yes>, som alltid skapar en ny rapport, eller I<no>, som"
" alltid skickar till rapporterna för felrapporterna som stängs (om inga "
"felrapporter stängs skapas alltid en ny rapport)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:127
msgid ""
"If this is set, specifies a B<sendmail> command to use instead of "
"I</usr/sbin/sendmail>.  Same as the B<--sendmail> command line option."
msgstr ""
"Om detta anges specificeras ett B<sendmail>-kommando som ska användas i "
"stället för I</usr/sbin/sendmail>. Samma som kommandoradsalternativet "
"B<--sendmail>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:131
msgid "B<debdiff>(1), B<sensible-editor>(1), B<devscripts.conf>(5)"
msgstr "B<debdiff>(1), B<sensible-editor>(1), B<devscripts.conf>(5)"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/nmudiff.1:135
msgid ""
"B<nmudiff> was written and is copyright 2006 by Steinar H. Gunderson and "
"modified by Julian Gilbey E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt>.  The software may be "
"freely redistributed under the terms and conditions of the GNU General "
"Public License, version 2."
msgstr ""
"B<nmudiff> skrevs och har upphovsrätt © 2006 Steinar H. Gunderson, och "
"ändrades av Julian Gilbey E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt>. Programvaran får fritt "
"distribueras enligt villkoren i GNU General Public License, version 2."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:22
msgid ""
"origtargz - fetch the orig tarball of a Debian package from various sources,"
" and unpack it"
msgstr ""
"origtargz - hämta ett Debian-pakets ursprungliga källarkiv från olika källor"
" och packa upp det"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:28
msgid "B<origtargz> [I<OPTIONS>] [B<--unpack>[=B<no>|B<once>|B<yes>]]"
msgstr "B<origtargz> [I<OPTIONS>] [B<--unpack>[=B<no>|B<once>|B<yes>]]"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:30
msgid "B<origtargz> B<--help>"
msgstr "B<origtargz> B<--help>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:36
msgid ""
"B<origtargz> downloads the orig tarball of a Debian package, and also "
"unpacks it into the current directory, if it just contains a F<debian> "
"directory. The main use for B<origtargz> is with debian-dir-only repository "
"checkouts, but it is useful as a general tarball download wrapper. The "
"version number for the tarball to be downloaded is determined from "
"F<debian/changelog>. It should be invoked from the top level directory of an"
" unpacked Debian source package."
msgstr ""
"B<origtargz> hämtar ett Debian-pakets ursprungliga källarkiv och packar "
"också upp det i den aktuella katalogen, om den bara innehåller en "
"F<debian>-katalog. B<origtargz> används främst med utcheckningar av arkiv "
"som bara innehåller debian-katalogen, men är även användbart som ett allmänt"
" omslag för hämtning av källarkiv. Versionsnumret för källarkivet som ska "
"hämtas bestäms från F<debian/changelog>. Det bör anropas från "
"toppnivåkatalogen i ett uppackat Debian-källkodspaket."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:43
msgid "Various download locations are tried:"
msgstr "Olika nedladdningsplatser provas:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:47 ../scripts/origtargz.pl:51
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:55 ../scripts/origtargz.pl:59
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:63 ../scripts/origtargz.pl:67
msgid "*"
msgstr "*"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:49
msgid "First, an existing file is looked for."
msgstr "Först söks efter en befintlig fil."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:53
msgid "Directories given with B<--path> are searched."
msgstr "Kataloger som anges med B<--path> söks igenom."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:57
msgid "B<pristine-tar> is tried."
msgstr "B<pristine-tar> prövas."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:61
msgid "B<pristine-lfs> is tried."
msgstr "B<pristine-lfs> prövas."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:65
msgid ""
"B<apt-get source> is tried when B<apt-cache showsrc> reports a matching "
"version."
msgstr ""
"B<apt-get source> prövas när B<apt-cache showsrc> rapporterar en matchande "
"version."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:69
msgid "Finally, B<uscan --download --download-current-version> is tried."
msgstr "Slutligen prövas B<uscan --download --download-current-version>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:73
msgid ""
"When asked to unpack the orig tarball, B<origtargz> will remove all files "
"and directories from the current directory, except the debian directory, and"
" the VCS repository directories. I<Note that this will drop all non-"
"committed changes> for the patch system in use (e.g. source format \"3.0 "
"(quilt)\"), and will even remove all patches from the package when no patch "
"system is in use (the original \"1.0\" source format). Some VCS control "
"files outside F<debian/> preserved (F<.bzr-builddeb>, F<.bzr-ignore>, "
"F<.gitignore>, F<.hgignore>), if stored in VCS."
msgstr ""
"När det ombeds att packa upp det ursprungliga källarkivet tar B<origtargz> "
"bort alla filer och kataloger från den aktuella katalogen, utom debian-"
"katalogen och VCS-arkivkatalogerna. I<Observera att detta tar bort alla "
"obekräftade ändringar> för patchsystemet som används (till exempel "
"källformatet ”3.0 (quilt)”), och tar till och med bort alla patchar från "
"paketet när inget patchsystem används (det ursprungliga källformatet ”1.0”)."
" Vissa VCS-kontrollfiler utanför F<debian/> bevaras om de lagras i VCS: "
"F<.bzr-builddeb>, F<.bzr-ignore>, F<.gitignore> och F<.hgignore>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:82
msgid ""
"The default behavior is to unpack the orig tarball if the current directory "
"is empty except for a F<debian> directory and the VCS files mentioned above."
msgstr ""
"Standardbeteendet är att packa upp det ursprungliga källarkivet om den "
"aktuella katalogen är tom utom en F<debian>-katalog och VCS-filerna som "
"nämns ovan."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:87
msgid ""
"Despite B<origtargz> being called \"targz\", it will work with any "
"compression scheme used for the tarball."
msgstr ""
"Trots att B<origtargz> kallas ”targz” fungerar det med alla "
"komprimeringsmetoder som används för källarkivet."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:90
msgid ""
"A similar tool to unpack orig tarballs is B<uupdate>(1). B<uupdate> creates "
"a new working directory, unpacks the tarball, and applies the Debian "
"F<.diff.gz> changes. In contrast, B<origtargz> uses the current directory, "
"keeping VCS metadata."
msgstr ""
"Ett liknande verktyg för att packa upp ursprungliga källarkiv är "
"B<uupdate>(1). B<uupdate> skapar en ny arbetskatalog, packar upp källarkivet"
" och tillämpar Debians F<.diff.gz>-ändringar. B<origtargz> använder däremot "
"den aktuella katalogen och behåller VCS-metadata."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:95
msgid ""
"For Debian package repositories that keep the full upstream source, other "
"tools should be used to upgrade the repository from the new tarball. See "
"B<gbp-import-orig>(1) and B<svn-upgrade>(1) for examples. B<origtargz> is "
"still useful for downloading the current tarball."
msgstr ""
"För Debian-paketarkiv som behåller hela uppströmskällkoden bör andra verktyg"
" användas för att uppgradera arkivet från det nya källarkivet. Se B<gbp-"
"import-orig>(1) och B<svn-upgrade>(1) för exempel. B<origtargz> är "
"fortfarande användbart för att hämta det aktuella källarkivet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:104
msgid "B<-p>, B<--path> I<directory>"
msgstr "B<-p>, B<--path> I<directory>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:106
msgid ""
"Add I<directory> to the list of locations to search for an existing tarball."
"  When found, a hardlink is created if possible, otherwise a symlink."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till I<directory> i listan över platser där ett befintligt källarkiv "
"söks. När ett hittas skapas en hård länk om möjligt, annars en symbolisk "
"länk."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:109
msgid "B<-u>, B<--unpack>[=B<no>|B<once>|B<yes>]"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--unpack>[=B<no>|B<once>|B<yes>]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:111
msgid ""
"Unpack the downloaded orig tarball to the current directory, replacing "
"everything except the debian directory. Existing files are removed, except "
"for F<debian/> and VCS files. Preserved are: F<.bzr>, F<.bzrignore>, F<.bzr-"
"builddeb>, F<.git>, F<.gitignore>, F<.hg>, F<.hgignore>, F<_darcs> and "
"F<.svn>."
msgstr ""
"Packa upp det hämtade ursprungliga källarkivet i den aktuella katalogen och "
"ersätt allt utom debian-katalogen. Befintliga filer tas bort, utom "
"F<debian/> och VCS-filer. Följande bevaras: F<.bzr>, F<.bzrignore>, F<.bzr-"
"builddeb>, F<.git>, F<.gitignore>, F<.hg>, F<.hgignore>, F<_darcs> och "
"F<.svn>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:119
msgid "B<no>"
msgstr "B<no>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:121
msgid "Do not unpack the orig tarball."
msgstr "Packa inte upp den ursprungliga tarbollen."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:123
msgid "B<once> (default when B<--unpack> is not used)"
msgstr "B<once> (standard när B<--unpack> inte används)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:125
msgid ""
"If the current directory contains only a F<debian> directory (and possibly "
"some dotfiles), unpack the orig tarball. This is the default behavior."
msgstr ""
"Om den aktuella katalogen bara innehåller en F<debian>-katalog (och möjligen"
" några punktfiler) packas det ursprungliga källarkivet upp. Detta är "
"standardbeteendet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:128
msgid "B<yes> (default for B<--unpack> without argument)"
msgstr "B<yes> (standard för B<--unpack> utan argument)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:130
msgid "Always unpack the orig tarball."
msgstr "Packa alltid upp den ursprungliga tarbollen."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:136
msgid "Alias for B<--unpack=no>."
msgstr "Alias för B<--unpack=no>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:138
msgid "B<-t>, B<--tar-only>"
msgstr "B<-t>, B<--tar-only>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:140
msgid ""
"When using B<apt-get source>, pass B<--tar-only> to it. The default is to "
"download the full source package including F<.dsc> and F<.diff.gz> or "
"F<.debian.tar.gz> components so B<debdiff> can be used to diff the last "
"upload to the next one. With B<--tar-only>, only download the F<.orig.tar.*>"
" file."
msgstr ""
"När B<apt-get source> används ska B<--tar-only> skickas till kommandot. "
"Standard är att hämta hela källkodspaketet, inklusive komponenterna F<.dsc> "
"och F<.diff.gz> eller F<.debian.tar.gz>, så att B<debdiff> kan användas för "
"att jämföra den senaste uppladdningen med nästa. Med B<--tar-only> hämtas "
"bara filen F<.orig.tar.*>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:145
msgid "B<--clean>"
msgstr "B<--clean>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:147
msgid ""
"Remove existing files as with B<--unpack>. Note that like B<--unpack>, this "
"will remove upstream files even if they are stored in VCS."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort befintliga filer som med B<--unpack>. Observera att precis som "
"B<--unpack> kommer detta att ta bort uppströmsfiler även om de är lagrade i "
"VCS."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:164
msgid ""
"B<debcheckout>(1), B<gbp-import-orig>(1), B<pristine-tar>(1), B<svn-"
"upgrade>(1), B<uupdate>(1)"
msgstr ""
"B<debcheckout>(1), B<gbp-import-orig>(1), B<pristine-tar>(1), B<svn-"
"upgrade>(1), B<uupdate>(1)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/origtargz.pl:168
msgid ""
"B<origtargz> and this manpage have been written by Christoph Berg "
"<I<myon@debian.org>>."
msgstr ""
"B<origtargz> och den här manualsidan har skrivits av Christoph Berg "
"<I<myon@debian.org>>."

#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "PLOTCHANGELOG"
msgstr "PLOTCHANGELOG"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:4
msgid "plotchangelog - graph Debian changelogs"
msgstr "plotchangelog - graf över Debians ändringsloggar"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:7
msgid "B<plotchangelog> [I<options>]I< changelog >..."
msgstr "B<plotchangelog> [I<options>]I< changelog >..."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:17
msgid ""
"B<plotchangelog> is a tool to aid in visualizing a Debian I<changelog>. The "
"changelogs are graphed with B<gnuplot>(1)  , with the X axis of the graph "
"denoting time of release and the Y axis denoting the Debian version number "
"of the package. Each individual release of the package is represented by a "
"point, and the points are color coded to indicate who released that version "
"of the package. The upstream version number of the package can also be "
"labeled on the graph."
msgstr ""
"B<plotchangelog> är ett verktyg som hjälper till att visualisera en "
"Debian-I<changelog>. Ändringsloggarna ritas med B<gnuplot>(1), där grafens "
"X-axel anger tidpunkten för utgåvan och Y-axeln paketets Debian-"
"versionsnummer. Varje enskild paketutgåva representeras av en punkt, och "
"punkterna är färgkodade för att ange vem som gav ut den paketversionen. "
"Paketets uppströmsversionsnummer kan också märkas ut i grafen."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:21
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the Y axis can be configured to display the size of the "
"changelog entry for each new version. Or it can be configured to display "
"approximately how many bugs were fixed for each new version."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan Y-axeln konfigureras så att den visar storleken på "
"ändringsloggen för varje ny version. Eller så kan den konfigureras så att "
"den visar ungefär hur många buggar som har åtgärdats för varje ny version."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:24
msgid ""
"Note that if the package is a Debian-specific package, the entire package "
"version will be used for the Y axis. This does not always work perfectly."
msgstr ""
"Observera att om paketet är ett Debian-specifikt paket kommer hela "
"paketversionen att användas för Y-axeln. Detta fungerar inte alltid perfekt."

#. type: SH
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "READING THE GRAPH"
msgstr "LÄSA DIAGRAMMET"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:33
msgid ""
"The general outline of a package's graph is typically a series of peaks, "
"starting at 1, going up to n, and then returning abruptly to 1. The higher "
"the peaks, the more releases the maintainer made between new upstream "
"versions of the package. If a package is Debian-only, it's graph will just "
"grow upwards without ever falling (although a bug in this program may cause "
"it to fall sometimes, if the version number goes from say, 0.9 to say, 0.10 "
"- this is interpreted wrong...)"
msgstr ""
"Ett pakets graf har vanligtvis en serie toppar: den börjar på 1, stiger till"
" n och återgår sedan plötsligt till 1. Ju högre topparna är, desto fler "
"utgåvor har underhållaren gjort mellan paketets nya uppströmsversioner. Om "
"ett paket bara finns i Debian växer grafen uppåt utan att någonsin falla "
"(även om ett fel i programmet ibland kan få den att falla, om versionsnumret"
" exempelvis går från 0.9 till 0.10 – detta tolkas fel)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:40
msgid ""
"If the graph dips below 1, someone made a NMU of the package and upgraded it"
" to a new upstream version, thus setting the Debian version to 0. NMU's in "
"general appear as fractional points like 1.1, 2.1, etc. A NMU can also be "
"easily detected by looking at the points that represent which maintainer "
"uploaded the package -- a solitary point of a different type than the points"
" before and after it is typically a NMU."
msgstr ""
"Om grafen sjunker under 1 har någon gjort en NMU av paketet och uppgraderat "
"det till en ny uppströmsversion, vilket innebär att Debian-versionen har "
"satts till 0. NMU:er visas i allmänhet som bråkdelar, till exempel 1.1, 2.1 "
"osv. En NMU kan också lätt upptäckas genom att titta på de punkter som "
"representerar vilken underhållare som laddat upp paketet – en ensam punkt av"
" en annan typ än punkterna före och efter är vanligtvis en NMU."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:43
msgid ""
"It's also easy to tell by looking at the points when a package changes "
"maintainers."
msgstr ""
"Det är också lätt att se på punkterna när ett paket byter underhållare."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-l>, B<--linecount>"
msgstr "B<-l>, B<--linecount>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:50
msgid ""
"Instead of using the Debian version number as the Y axis, use the number of "
"lines in the changelog entry for each version.  Cannot be used together with"
" B<--bugcount>."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att använda Debian-versionsnumret som Y-axel, använd antalet "
"rader i ändringsloggen för varje version.  Kan inte användas tillsammans med"
" B<--bugcount>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-b>, B<--bugcount>"
msgstr "B<-b>, B<--bugcount>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:57
msgid ""
"Instead of using the Debian version number as the Y axis, use the number of "
"bugs that were closed by each changelog entry. Note that this number is "
"obtained by searching for \"#dddd\" in the changelog, and so it may be "
"inaccurate.  Cannot be used together with B<--linecount>."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att använda Debians versionsnummer som Y-axel, använd antalet "
"buggar som stängts av varje ändringsloggpost. Observera att detta antal "
"erhålls genom att söka efter \"#dddd\" i ändringsloggen, och därför kan det "
"vara felaktigt.  Kan inte användas tillsammans med B<--linecount>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-c>, B<--cumulative>"
msgstr "B<-c>, B<--cumulative>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:65
msgid ""
"When used together with either B<--bugcount> or B<--linecount>, graphs the "
"cumulative count rather than the count in each individual changelog entry."
msgstr ""
"När den används tillsammans med antingen B<--bugcount> eller B<--linecount>,"
" visar den det kumulativa antalet istället för antalet i varje enskild "
"ändringsloggpost."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-v>, B<--no-version>"
msgstr "B<-v>, B<--no-version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:68
msgid ""
"Do not show upstream version labels. Useful if the graph gets too crowded."
msgstr ""
"Visa inte etiketter för uppströmsversioner. Användbart om grafen blir för "
"trång."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-m, --no-maint>"
msgstr "B<-m, --no-maint>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:71
msgid "Do not differentiate between different maintainers of the package."
msgstr "Gör ingen skillnad mellan olika underhållare av paketet."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s file>, B<--save=>I<file>"
msgstr "B<-s file>, B<--save=>I<file>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:75
msgid ""
"Save the graph to I<file> in PostScript format instead of immediately "
"displaying it."
msgstr ""
"Spara grafen i PostScript-format i I<file> i stället för att visa den "
"direkt."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-u>, B<--urgency>"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--urgency>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:78
msgid "Use larger points when displaying higher-urgency package uploads."
msgstr ""
"Använd större punkter när du visar paketuppladdningar med högre prioritet."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:81
msgid ""
"Output the gnuplot script that is fed into gnuplot (for debugging purposes)."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut gnuplot-skriptet som matas in i gnuplot (för felsökningsändamål)."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-g>I<commands>, B<--gnuplot=>I<commands>"
msgstr "B<-g>I<commands>, B<--gnuplot=>I<commands>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:92
msgid ""
"This allows you to insert B<gnuplot>(1)  commands into the gnuplot script "
"that is used to generate the graph. The commands are placed after all "
"initialization but before the final B<plot> command. This can be used to "
"override the default look provided by this program in arbitrary ways. You "
"can also use things like \"set terminal png color\" to change the output "
"file type, which is useful in conjunction with the -s option."
msgstr ""
"Detta gör att du kan infoga B<gnuplot>(1)-kommandon i gnuplot-skriptet som "
"används för att skapa grafen. Kommandona placeras efter all initiering men "
"före det sista B<plot>-kommandot. Det kan användas för att åsidosätta "
"programmets standardutseende på valfritt sätt. Du kan också använda "
"exempelvis ”set terminal png color” för att ändra utdatafiltypen, vilket är "
"användbart tillsammans med alternativet B<-s>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:95
msgid "Show a usage summary."
msgstr "Visa en sammanfattning av användningen."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:98
msgid "Display version, author and copyright information."
msgstr "Visa version, författare och upphovsrättsinformation."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--noconf>, B<--no-conf>"
msgstr "B<--noconf>, B<--no-conf>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:101
msgid "Do not read any configuration files (see below)."
msgstr "Läs inte några konfigurationsfiler (se nedan)."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<changelog >..."
msgstr "I<changelog >..."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:106
msgid ""
"The I<changelog> files to graph. If multiple files are specified they will "
"all be displayed on the same graph. The files may be compressed with gzip. "
"Any text in them that is not in Debian changelog format will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"I<changelog>-filerna som ska visas i diagrammet. Om flera filer anges visas "
"de alla i samma diagram. Filerna kan vara komprimerade med gzip. All text i "
"dem som inte har Debians ändringsloggsformat ignoreras."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:113
msgid ""
"The two configuration files I</etc/devscripts.conf> and I<~/.devscripts> are"
" sourced by a shell in that order to set configuration variables.  The "
"B<--no-conf> option can be used to prevent reading these files.  Environment"
" variable settings are ignored when these configuration files are read.  The"
" currently recognised variables are:"
msgstr ""
"De två konfigurationsfilerna I</etc/devscripts.conf> och I<~/.devscripts> "
"läses in av ett skal i den ordningen för att ange konfigurationsvariabler. "
"Alternativet B<--no-conf> kan användas för att förhindra läsning av dessa "
"filer. Miljövariabelinställningar ignoreras när dessa konfigurationsfiler "
"läses. Variablerna som känns igen för närvarande är:"

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<PLOTCHANGELOG_OPTIONS>"
msgstr "B<PLOTCHANGELOG_OPTIONS>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:118
msgid ""
"This is a space-separated list of options to always use, for example B<-l "
"-b>.  Do not include B<-g> or B<--gnuplot> among this list as it may be "
"ignored; see the next variable instead."
msgstr ""
"Detta är en lista med alternativ separerade med mellanslag som alltid ska "
"användas, till exempel B<-l -b>.  Inkludera inte B<-g> eller B<--gnuplot> i "
"denna lista, eftersom de kan ignoreras. Se istället nästa variabel."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<PLOTCHANGELOG_GNUPLOT>"
msgstr "B<PLOTCHANGELOG_GNUPLOT>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:124
msgid ""
"These are B<gnuplot> commands which will be prepended to any such commands "
"given on the command line."
msgstr ""
"Detta är B<gnuplot>-kommandon som läggs före alla sådana kommandon som anges"
" på kommandoraden."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/plotchangelog.1:127
msgid "Joey Hess E<lt>joey@kitenet.netE<gt>"
msgstr "Joey Hess E<lt>joey@kitenet.netE<gt>"

#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "PTS-SUBSCRIBE"
msgstr "PTS-PRENUMERERA"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:4
msgid "pts-subscribe - time-limited subscription to the PTS"
msgstr "pts-subscribe – tidsbegränsad prenumeration på PTS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:6
msgid "B<pts-subscribe> [I<options>] I<package>"
msgstr "B<pts-subscribe> [I<options>] I<package>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:8
msgid "B<pts-unsubscribe> [I<options>] I<package>"
msgstr "B<pts-unsubscribe> [I<options>] I<package>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:12
msgid ""
"B<pts-subscribe> sends a subscription request for I<package> to the Package "
"Tracking System at pts@qa.debian.org, and cancels the subscription 30 days "
"later."
msgstr ""
"B<pts-subscribe> skickar en prenumerationsförfrågan för I<paket> till "
"paketspårningssystemet på pts@qa.debian.org och säger upp prenumerationen 30"
" dagar senare."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:15
msgid ""
"If called as B<pts-unsubscribe>, send an unsubscription request for "
"I<package> to the Package Tracking System."
msgstr ""
"Om programmet anropas som B<pts-unsubscribe> skickar det en begäran om att "
"avsluta prenumerationen på I<package> till Package Tracking System."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:18
msgid ""
"This utility is useful if a developer has made an NMU and wants to track the"
" package for a limited period of time."
msgstr ""
"Det här verktyget är användbart om en utvecklare har skapat en NMU och vill "
"spåra paketet under en begränsad tid."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--until >I<time>, B<-u> I<time>"
msgstr "B<--until >I<time>, B<-u> I<time>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:24
msgid ""
"When B<at>(1) should cancel the subscription.  I<time> must be specified "
"using B<at>'s syntax.  Default is 'now + 30 days'.  This option will "
"probably require quoting!"
msgstr ""
"När B<at>(1) ska avsluta prenumerationen. I<time> måste anges med B<at>:s "
"syntax. Standard är 'now + 30 days'. Det här alternativet kräver förmodligen"
" citering."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--forever>"
msgstr "B<--forever>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:28
msgid ""
"Don't cancel the subscription automatically.  This can also be specified as "
"B<--until forever>."
msgstr ""
"Avbryt inte prenumerationen automatiskt.  Detta kan också anges som "
"B<--until forever>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<DEBEMAIL>, B<EMAIL>"
msgstr "B<DEBEMAIL>, B<EMAIL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:42
msgid ""
"If one of these is set (with preference give to B<DEBEMAIL>), then this will"
" be used for the subscription address.  If neither is set, then the email "
"will be sent without a specified subscription address, and the email's From:"
" line will be used to determine the sender's address.  This will be "
"determined by B<mail>(1)."
msgstr ""
"Om en av dessa är angiven (med företräde för B<DEBEMAIL>) används den som "
"prenumerationsadress. Om ingen av dem är angiven skickas e-postmeddelandet "
"utan någon angiven prenumerationsadress, och raden From: i e-postmeddelandet"
" används för att fastställa avsändarens adress. Detta avgörs av B<mail>(1)."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<PTS_UNTIL>"
msgstr "B<PTS_UNTIL>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:51
msgid "Setting this is equivalent to giving a B<--until> option."
msgstr "Att ställa in detta motsvarar att ange alternativet B<--until>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:56
msgid ""
"B<at>(1), information about the Package Tracking System in the Developer's "
"Reference at https://www.debian.org/doc/developers-"
"reference/resources.html#pkg-tracking-system"
msgstr ""
"B<at>(1), information om paketspårningssystemet i utvecklarreferensen på "
"https://www.debian.org/doc/developers-reference/resources.html#pkg-tracking-"
"system"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/pts-subscribe.1:59
msgid ""
"This program was written by Julian Gilbey E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt> based on "
"a public domain prototype by Raphael Hertzog E<lt>hertzog@debian.orgE<gt> "
"and is copyright under the GPL, version 2 or later."
msgstr ""
"Detta program skrevs av Julian Gilbey E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt>, baserat på "
"en prototyp i public domain av Raphael Hertzog E<lt>hertzog@debian.orgE<gt>,"
" och omfattas av GPL, version 2 eller senare."

#. type: TH
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "RC-ALERT"
msgstr "RC-ALERT"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:4
msgid "rc-alert - check for installed packages with release-critical bugs"
msgstr "rc-alert - kontrollera installerade paket med utgåvekritiska fel"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:6
msgid ""
"B<rc-alert> [I<inclusion options>] [B<--debtags> [I<tag>[B<,>I<tag> ...]]] "
"[B<--popcon>] [I<package> ...]"
msgstr ""
"B<rc-alert> [I<inclusion options>] [B<--debtags> [I<tag>[B<,>I<tag> ...]]] "
"[B<--popcon>] [I<package> ...]"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:8
msgid "B<rc-alert --help>|B<--version>"
msgstr "B<rc-alert --help>|B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:12
msgid ""
"B<rc-alert> downloads the list of release-critical bugs from the Debian BTS "
"webpages, and then outputs a list of packages installed on the system, or "
"given on the command-line, which are in that list."
msgstr ""
"B<rc-alert> hämtar listan över kritiska buggar från Debians BTS-webbsidor "
"och visar sedan en lista över paket som är installerade på systemet, eller "
"som anges på kommandoraden, och som finns med på listan."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:17
msgid ""
"If the directory I<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/rc-alert> exists or the "
"B<--cache> option is given, then the (sizable) downloaded list will be "
"cached, and will only be downloaded again on a second invocation if it has "
"changed."
msgstr ""
"Om katalogen I<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/rc-alert> finns eller alternativet"
" B<--cache> anges, kommer den (stora) nedladdade listan att cachelagras och "
"endast laddas ned igen vid ett andra anrop om den har ändrats."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--cache>"
msgstr "B<--cache>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:21
msgid ""
"Force the creation of the I<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/rc-alert> cache "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"Tvinga skapandet av cache-katalogen I<$XDG_CACHE_HOME/devscripts/rc-alert>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:31
msgid ""
"It is also possible to filter the list of bugs reported based on the tags "
"and distributions associated with the package. The filtering options are:"
msgstr ""
"Det går också att filtrera listan över rapporterade fel utifrån taggarna och"
" distributionerna som hör till paketet. Filtreringsalternativen är:"

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-tags>, B<-f>"
msgstr "B<--include-tags>, B<-f>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:35
msgid ""
"A list of tags which the bug must have, in the format used for output.  For "
"example, to include bugs tagged security or help wanted, use \"SH\"."
msgstr ""
"En lista över taggar som felrapporten måste ha, i formatet som används för "
"utdata. Använd till exempel ”SH” för att inkludera felrapporter med taggen "
"security eller help wanted."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-tag-op>, B<-t>"
msgstr "B<--include-tag-op>, B<-t>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:39
msgid ""
"If set to I<and>, a bug must have all of the tags specified by B<--include-"
"tags>."
msgstr ""
"Om inställningen är I<and> måste en bugg ha alla taggar som anges av "
"B<--include-tags>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--exclude-tags>"
msgstr "B<--exclude-tags>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:43
msgid ""
"A list of tags which the bug must not have, in the same format as "
"B<--include-tags>."
msgstr ""
"En lista över taggar som felrapporten inte får ha, i samma format som "
"B<--include-tags>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--exclude-tag-op>"
msgstr "B<--exclude-tag-op>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:48
msgid ""
"If set to I<and>, a bug must have none of the tags specified by B<--exclude-"
"tags>.  By default, the bug will be excluded if any tag matches."
msgstr ""
"Om värdet är I<and> får felrapporten inte ha någon av taggarna som anges med"
" B<--exclude-tags>. Som standard utesluts felrapporten om någon tagg "
"matchar."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-dists>, B<-d>"
msgstr "B<--include-dists>, B<-d>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:52
msgid ""
"A list of distributions which the bug must apply to, in the format used for "
"output.  For example, to include bugs affecting testing or unstable, use "
"\"TU\"."
msgstr ""
"En lista över distributioner som felrapporten måste gälla, i formatet som "
"används för utdata. Använd till exempel ”TU” för att inkludera felrapporter "
"som påverkar testing eller unstable."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-dist-op>, B<-o>"
msgstr "B<--include-dist-op>, B<-o>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:56
msgid ""
"If set to I<and>, a bug must apply to all of the specified distributions in "
"order to be included."
msgstr ""
"Om värdet är I<and> måste felrapporten gälla alla angivna distributioner för"
" att tas med."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--exclude-dists>"
msgstr "B<--exclude-dists>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:60
msgid ""
"A list of distributions to which the bug must not apply, in the same format "
"as B<--include-dists>."
msgstr ""
"En lista över distributioner som felrapporten inte får gälla, i samma format"
" som B<--include-dists>."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--exclude-dist-op>"
msgstr "B<--exclude-dist-op>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:65
msgid ""
"If set to I<and>, a bug must apply to all of the specified distributions in "
"order to be excluded.  By default the bug will be excluded if it applies to "
"any of the listed distributions."
msgstr ""
"Om värdet är I<and> måste felrapporten gälla alla angivna distributioner för"
" att uteslutas. Som standard utesluts felrapporten om den gäller någon av "
"distributionerna i listan."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:70
msgid ""
"It is also possible to only list bugs which have specific debtags set. Note "
"that you need to have debtags installed and also that it's not mandatory for"
" maintainers to set proper debtags. The produced list will thus probably be "
"incomplete."
msgstr ""
"Det går också att endast lista felrapporter med särskilda debtags. Observera"
" att debtags måste vara installerat och att underhållare inte måste ange "
"korrekta debtags. Den skapade listan är därför sannolikt ofullständig."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--debtags>"
msgstr "B<--debtags>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:75
msgid ""
"Match packages based on the listed tags. Each package is matched only if it "
"has all the listed tags; in the case of multiple tags within the same facet,"
" a package is matched if it has any of the listed tags within the facet."
msgstr ""
"Matcha paket baserat på listade taggar. Varje paket matchas endast om det "
"har alla listade taggar. Om det finns flera taggar inom samma aspekt matchas"
" ett paket om det har någon av de listade taggarna inom aspekten."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--debtags-database>"
msgstr "B<--debtags-database>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:79
msgid ""
"Use a non-standard debtags database.  The default is "
"I</var/lib/debtags/packages-tags>."
msgstr ""
"Använd en icke-standardiserad debtags-databas. Standardinställningen är "
"I</var/lib/debtags/packages-tags>."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:83
msgid ""
"Popularity-contest collects data about installation and usage of Debian "
"packages. You can additionally sort the bugs by the popcon rank of the "
"related packages."
msgstr ""
"Popularity-contest samlar in data om installation och användning av Debian-"
"paket. Du kan dessutom sortera felrapporterna efter popcon-rangordningen för"
" de berörda paketen."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--popcon>"
msgstr "B<--popcon>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:86
msgid "Sort bugs by the popcon rank of the package the bug belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Sortera felrapporter efter popcon-rangordningen för paketet som felrapporten"
" hör till."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--pc-vote>"
msgstr "B<--pc-vote>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:92
msgid ""
"By default, packages are sorted according to the number of people who have "
"the package installed. This option enables sorting by the number of people "
"regularly using the package instead. This option has no effect in "
"combination with --pc-local."
msgstr ""
"Som standard sorteras paket efter antalet personer som har paketet "
"installerat. Den här flaggan gör det möjligt att istället sortera efter "
"antalet personer som regelbundet använder paketet. Den här flaggan har ingen"
" effekt i kombination med --pc-local."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--pc-local>"
msgstr "B<--pc-local>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:96
msgid ""
"Instead of requesting remote data the information from the last popcon run "
"is used (I</var/log/popularity-contest>)."
msgstr ""
"Istället för att begära fjärrdata används informationen från den senaste "
"popcon-körningen (I</var/log/popularity-contest>)."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-dists> OS"
msgstr "B<--include-dists> OS"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:100
msgid "The bug must apply to at least one of oldstable or stable"
msgstr "Felrapporten måste gälla minst en av oldstable eller stable."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-dists> TUB< --include-dist-op> and"
msgstr "B<--include-dists> TUB< --include-dist-op> and"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:103
msgid "The bug must apply to both testing and unstable"
msgstr "Felrapporten måste gälla både testing och unstable."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--include-dists> OB< --include-tags> SB< --exclude-tags> +"
msgstr "B<--include-dists> OB< --include-tags> SB< --exclude-tags> +"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:106
msgid "The bug must apply to oldstable and be tagged security but not patch"
msgstr ""
"Felrapporten måste gälla oldstable och ha taggen security, men inte patch."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--exclude-dists> SOTB< --include-tags> R"
msgstr "B<--exclude-dists> SOTB< --include-tags> R"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:110
msgid ""
"The bug must apply to only unstable or experimental (or both) and be tagged "
"unreproducible"
msgstr ""
"Felrapporten får endast gälla unstable eller experimental (eller båda) och "
"måste ha taggen unreproducible."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--debtags> implemented-in::perl,role::plugin,implemented-in::python"
msgstr "B<--debtags> implemented-in::perl,role::plugin,implemented-in::python"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:115
msgid ""
"The bug must apply to packages matching the specified debtags, i.e. the "
"match will only include packages that have the 'role::plugin' tag and that "
"have either of the tags 'implemented-in::perl' or 'implemented-in::python'."
msgstr ""
"Felet måste gälla paket som matchar de angivna debtags, dvs. matchningen "
"kommer endast att omfatta paket som har taggen 'role::plugin' och som har "
"någon av taggarna 'implemented-in::perl' eller 'implemented-in::python'."

#. type: TP
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:115
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--popcon> B<--pc-local>"
msgstr "B<--popcon> B<--pc-local>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:119
msgid ""
"Read I</var/log/popularity-contest> and sort bugs by your personal popcon "
"ranking (which is basically the atime of your packages' binaries)."
msgstr ""
"Läs I</var/log/popularity-contest> och sortera felrapporter efter din "
"personliga popcon-rangordning (som i grunden är atime för binärfilerna i "
"dina paket)."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:121
msgid "It is not possible to say \"does not apply only to unstable\""
msgstr "Det går inte att säga ”gäller inte enbart unstable”."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:125
msgid "B<debtags(1)> B<popbugs(1)> B<popularity-contest(8)>"
msgstr "B<debtags(1)> B<popbugs(1)> B<popularity-contest(8)>"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../scripts/rc-alert.1:129
msgid ""
"B<rc-alert> was written by Anthony DeRobertis and modified by Julian Gilbey "
"E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt> and Adam D. Barratt E<lt>adam@adam-"
"barratt.org.ukE<gt> for the devscripts package. Debtags and popcon "
"functionality was added by Jan Hauke Rahm E<lt>info@jhr-online.deE<gt>."
msgstr ""
"B<rc-alert> skrevs av Anthony DeRobertis och modifierades av Julian Gilbey "
"E<lt>jdg@debian.orgE<gt> och Adam D. Barratt E<lt>adam@adam-"
"barratt.org.ukE<gt> för devscripts-paketet. Debtags- och popcon-"
"funktionalitet lades till av Jan Hauke Rahm E<lt>info@jhr-online.deE<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:574
msgid "rmadison -- Remotely query the Debian archive database about packages"
msgstr "rmadison -- Fråga Debian-arkivdatabasen om paket på distans"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:580
msgid "B<rmadison> [I<OPTIONS>] I<PACKAGE> ..."
msgstr "B<rmadison> [I<OPTIONS>] I<PACKAGE> ..."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:586
msgid ""
"B<dak ls> queries the Debian archive database (\"projectb\") and displays "
"which package version is registered per architecture/component/suite.  The "
"CGI at B<https://qa.debian.org/madison.php> provides that service without "
"requiring SSH access to ftp-master.debian.org or the mirror on mirror.ftp-"
"master.debian.org. This script, B<rmadison>, is a command line frontend to "
"this CGI."
msgstr ""
"B<dak ls> frågar Debians arkivdatabas (”projectb”) och visar vilken "
"paketversion som är registrerad per arkitektur/komponent/svit. CGI-skriptet "
"på B<https://qa.debian.org/madison.php> tillhandahåller tjänsten utan att "
"kräva SSH-åtkomst till ftp-master.debian.org eller spegeln på mirror.ftp-"
"master.debian.org. Detta skript, B<rmadison>, är ett kommandoradsgränssnitt "
"till detta CGI-skript."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:593
msgid ""
"Ubuntu has no such CGI. Queries against an B<https://api.launchpad.net/> "
"URL, such as the B<ubuntu> shorthand, are instead answered by asking the "
"Launchpad web service for the published sources and binaries and formatting "
"the reply like B<madison> would. See L</LAUNCHPAD ARCHIVES> below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu har ingen sådan CGI. Frågor mot en B<https://api.launchpad.net/>-URL,"
" till exempel förkortningen B<ubuntu>, besvaras i stället genom att fråga "
"Launchpads webbtjänst om publicerade källor och binärer och formatera svaret"
" som B<madison> skulle göra. Se L</LAUNCHPAD ARCHIVES> nedan."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:602
msgid "B<-a>, B<--architecture=>I<ARCH>"
msgstr "B<-a>, B<--architecture=>I<ARCH>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:604
msgid "only show info for ARCH(s)"
msgstr "visa endast information för ARCH"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:606
msgid "B<-b>, B<--binary-type=>I<TYPE>"
msgstr "B<-b>, B<--binary-type=>I<TYPE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:608
msgid "only show info for binary TYPE"
msgstr "visa endast information för binär TYPE"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:610
msgid "B<-c>, B<--component=>I<COMPONENT>"
msgstr "B<-c>, B<--component=>I<COMPONENT>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:612
msgid "only show info for COMPONENT(s)"
msgstr "visa endast information för COMPONENT"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:614
msgid "B<-g>, B<--greaterorequal>"
msgstr "B<-g>, B<--greaterorequal>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:616
msgid "show buildd 'dep-wait pkg >= {highest version}' info"
msgstr "visa buildd-informationen 'dep-wait pkg >= {highest version}'"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:618
msgid "B<-G>, B<--greaterthan>"
msgstr "B<-G>, B<--greaterthan>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:620
msgid "show buildd 'dep-wait pkg >> {highest version}' info"
msgstr "visa buildd-informationen 'dep-wait pkg >> {highest version}'"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:624
msgid "show this help and exit"
msgstr "visa denna hjälp och avsluta"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:626
msgid "B<-s>, B<--suite=>I<SUITE>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--suite=>I<SUITE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:628
msgid "only show info for this suite"
msgstr "visa endast information för denna svit"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:630
msgid "B<-r>, B<--regex>"
msgstr "B<-r>, B<--regex>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:632
msgid "treat PACKAGE as a regex"
msgstr "behandla PACKAGE som ett reguljärt uttryck"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:634
msgid ""
"B<Note:> Since B<-r> can easily DoS the database (\"-r .\"), this option is "
"not supported by the CGI on qa.debian.org and most other installations."
msgstr ""
"B<Obs:> Eftersom B<-r> lätt kan överbelasta databasen (”-r .”), stöds det "
"här alternativet inte av CGI-skriptet på qa.debian.org eller av de flesta "
"andra installationer."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:637
msgid "B<-S>, B<--source-and-binary>"
msgstr "B<-S>, B<--source-and-binary>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:639
msgid "show info for the binary children of source pkgs"
msgstr "visa information om binära underordnade paket till källpaket"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:641
msgid "B<-t>, B<--time>"
msgstr "B<-t>, B<--time>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:643
msgid "show projectb snapshot and reload time (not supported by all archives)"
msgstr ""
"visa projektets ögonblicksbild och omladdningstid (stöds inte av alla arkiv)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:645
msgid "B<-u>, B<--url=>I<URL>[B<,>I<URL> ...]"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--url=>I<URL>[B<,>I<URL> ...]"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:647
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use I<URL> for the query. Supported shorthands are\n"
" B<debian> https://api.ftp-master.debian.org/madison\n"
" B<new> https://api.ftp-master.debian.org/madison?s=new\n"
" B<qa> https://qa.debian.org/madison.php\n"
" B<ubuntu> https://api.launchpad.net/devel/ubuntu/+archive/primary\n"
" B<udd> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi\n"
" B<all> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=all\n"
" B<archive> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=archived\n"
" B<ports> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=ports\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"använd I<URL> för frågan. Följande kortnamn stöds:\n"
" B<debian> https://api.ftp-master.debian.org/madison\n"
" B<new> https://api.ftp-master.debian.org/madison?s=new\n"
" B<qa> https://qa.debian.org/madison.php\n"
" B<ubuntu> https://api.launchpad.net/devel/ubuntu/+archive/primary\n"
" B<udd> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi\n"
" B<all> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=all\n"
" B<archive> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=archived\n"
" B<ports> https://qa.debian.org/cgi-bin/madison.cgi?table=ports\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:657
msgid ""
"See the B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_> variable below for a method to add new "
"shorthands."
msgstr ""
"Se variabeln B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_> nedan för hur nya kortnamn läggs till."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:662
msgid "show version and exit"
msgstr "visa version och avsluta"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:666
msgid "don't read the devscripts configuration files"
msgstr "läs inte devscripts-konfigurationsfilerna"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:670
msgid ""
"ARCH, COMPONENT and SUITE can be comma (or space) separated lists, e.g.  "
"--architecture=amd64,i386"
msgstr ""
"ARCH, COMPONENT och SUITE kan vara kommaseparerade (eller "
"mellanslagsseparerade) listor, t.ex. --architecture=amd64,i386"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:683
msgid "B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_>I<SHORTHAND>=I<URL>"
msgstr "B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_>I<SHORTHAND>=I<URL>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:685
msgid ""
"Add an entry to the set of shorthand URLs listed above. I<SHORTHAND> should "
"be replaced with the shorthand form to be used to refer to I<URL>."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till en post till uppsättningen förkortade URL-adresser som anges ovan."
" I<SHORTHAND> ska ersättas med den förkortade formen som ska användas för "
"att hänvisa till I<URL>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:688
msgid ""
"Multiple shorthand entries may be specified by using multiple "
"B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_*> variables."
msgstr ""
"Flera kortformade poster kan anges genom att använda flera "
"B<RMADISON_URL_MAP_*>-variabler."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:691
msgid "B<RMADISON_DEFAULT_URL>=I<URL>"
msgstr "B<RMADISON_DEFAULT_URL>=I<URL>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:693
msgid ""
"Set the default URL to use unless overridden by a command line option.  For "
"Debian this defaults to debian. For Ubuntu this defaults to ubuntu."
msgstr ""
"Ange URL:en som ska användas som standard, om den inte åsidosätts av ett "
"kommandoradsalternativ. För Debian är standardvärdet debian. För Ubuntu är "
"standardvärdet ubuntu."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:696
msgid "B<RMADISON_ARCHITECTURE>=I<ARCH>"
msgstr "B<RMADISON_ARCHITECTURE>=I<ARCH>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:698
msgid ""
"Set the default architecture to use unless overridden by a command line "
"option.  To run an unrestricted query when B<RMADISON_ARCHITECTURE> is set, "
"use B<--architecture='*'>."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in standardarkitekturen som ska användas om den inte åsidosätts av ett"
" kommandoradsalternativ. För att köra en obegränsad fråga när "
"B<RMADISON_ARCHITECTURE> är inställt, använd B<--architecture='*'>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:702
msgid "B<RMADISON_SSL_CA_FILE>=I<FILE>"
msgstr "B<RMADISON_SSL_CA_FILE>=I<FILE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:704
msgid ""
"Use the specified CA file instead of the default CA bundle for curl/wget, "
"passed as --cacert to curl, and as --ca-certificate to wget."
msgstr ""
"Använd den angivna CA-filen i stället för standard-CA-samlingen för "
"curl/wget. Den skickas som --cacert till curl och som --ca-certificate till "
"wget."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:707
msgid "B<RMADISON_SSL_CA_PATH>=I<PATH>"
msgstr "B<RMADISON_SSL_CA_PATH>=I<PATH>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:709
msgid ""
"Use the specified CA directory instead of the default CA bundle for "
"curl/wget, passed as --capath to curl, and as --ca-directory to wget."
msgstr ""
"Använd den angivna CA-katalogen i stället för standard-CA-samlingen för "
"curl/wget. Den skickas som --capath till curl och som --ca-directory till "
"wget."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:714
msgid "LAUNCHPAD ARCHIVES"
msgstr "LAUNCHPAD-ARKIV"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:716
msgid ""
"Any I<URL> under B<https://api.launchpad.net/> is queried through the "
"Launchpad web service rather than through a B<madison> CGI. Besides the "
"B<ubuntu> shorthand this also works for any other archive Launchpad knows "
"about, for instance a PPA:"
msgstr ""
"Alla I<URL>:er under B<https://api.launchpad.net/> frågas via Launchpads "
"webbtjänst i stället för genom ett B<madison>-CGI-skript. Utöver kortnamnet "
"B<ubuntu> fungerar detta även för andra arkiv som Launchpad känner till, "
"till exempel en PPA:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:721
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  RMADISON_URL_MAP_MYPPA=https://api.launchpad.net/devel/~user/+archive/ubuntu/ppa\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  RMADISON_URL_MAP_MYPPA=https://api.launchpad.net/devel/~user/+archive/ubuntu/ppa\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:723
msgid ""
"Only B<-a>, B<-c>, B<-g>, B<-G>, B<-s> and B<-S> are supported for such a "
"query. B<-b>, B<-r> and B<-t> have no equivalent in the web service and are "
"ignored with a warning."
msgstr ""
"Endast B<-a>, B<-c>, B<-g>, B<-G>, B<-s> och B<-S> stöds för en sådan fråga."
" B<-b>, B<-r> och B<-t> saknar motsvarighet i webbtjänsten och ignoreras med"
" en varning."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:729
msgid "B<dak ls> was formerly called B<madison>."
msgstr "B<dak ls> hette tidigare B<madison>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:731
msgid ""
"The protocol used by rmadison is fairly simple, the CGI accepts query the "
"parameters a, b, c, g, G, r, s, S, t, and package. The parameter text is "
"passed to enable plain-text output."
msgstr ""
"Protokollet som rmadison använder är ganska enkelt. CGI-skriptet accepterar "
"frågeparametrarna a, b, c, g, G, r, s, S, t och package. Parametern text "
"skickas för att aktivera utdata i klartext."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:737
msgid "B<dak>(1), B<madison-lite>(1)"
msgstr "B<dak>(1), B<madison-lite>(1)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/rmadison.pl:741
msgid ""
"rmadison and https://qa.debian.org/madison.php were written by Christoph "
"Berg <myon@debian.org>. dak was written by James Troup <james@nocrew.org>, "
"Anthony Towns <ajt@debian.org>, and others."
msgstr ""
"rmadison och https://qa.debian.org/madison.php har skrivits av Christoph "
"Berg <myon@debian.org>. dak har skrivits av James Troup <james@nocrew.org>, "
"Anthony Towns <ajt@debian.org> och andra."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:19
msgid "sadt - simple DEP-8 test runner"
msgstr "sadt – enkel DEP-8-testkörare"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:23
msgid "B<sadt> [I<options>] [I<test-name>...]"
msgstr "B<sadt> [I<options>] [I<test-name>...]"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:27
msgid ""
"B<sadt> is a simple implementation of DEP-8 (“automatic as-installed package"
" testing”) test runner."
msgstr ""
"B<sadt> är en enkel implementering av en DEP-8-testkörare (”automatiserad "
"testning av installerade paket”)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:30
msgid ""
"It is your responsibility to satisfy tests' dependencies.  B<sadt> won't "
"attempt to install any missing packages.  If a test's dependencies cannot be"
" satisfied by packages that are currently installed, the test will be "
"skipped."
msgstr ""
"Du ansvarar för att uppfylla testernas beroenden. B<sadt> försöker inte "
"installera saknade paket. Om ett tests beroenden inte kan uppfyllas av "
"paketen som för närvarande är installerade hoppas testet över."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:34
msgid ""
"B<sadt> won't build the package even if a test declares the B<build-needed> "
"restriction.  Instead, such a test will be skipped.  However, you can build "
"the package manually, and then tell B<sadt> to assume that the package is "
"already built using the B<-b>/B<--built-source-tree>."
msgstr ""
"B<sadt> bygger inte paketet även om ett test anger begränsningen B<build-"
"needed>. Ett sådant test hoppas i stället över. Du kan dock bygga paketet "
"manuellt och sedan låta B<sadt> anta att paketet redan är byggt med "
"B<-b>/B<--built-source-tree>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:39
msgid ""
"B<sadt> doesn't implement any virtualisation arrangements, therefore it "
"skips tests that declare the B<breaks-testbed> restriction."
msgstr ""
"B<sadt> implementerar inga virtualiseringslösningar och hoppar därför över "
"tester som anger begränsningen B<breaks-testbed>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:48
msgid "Make the output more verbose."
msgstr "Gör utdata mer detaljerad."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:50
msgid "B<-b>, B<--built-source-tree>"
msgstr "B<-b>, B<--built-source-tree>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:52
msgid ""
"Assume that the source tree is already built.  This is equivalent to "
"B<--ignore-restriction=build-needed>."
msgstr ""
"Antag att källkoden redan är byggd. Detta motsvarar B<--ignore-"
"restriction=build-needed>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:55
msgid "B<--run-autodep8>, B<--no-run-autodep8>"
msgstr "B<--run-autodep8>, B<--no-run-autodep8>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:57
msgid ""
"Control whether to run autodep8(1) to determine the tests to run.  By "
"default, autodep8 will be run."
msgstr ""
"Styr om autodep8(1) körs för att avgöra vilka tester som ska köras. Som "
"standard körs autodep8."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:60
msgid "B<--ignore-restriction>=I<restriction>"
msgstr "B<--ignore-restriction>=I<restriction>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:62
msgid "Don't skip tests that declare the I<restriction>."
msgstr "Hoppa inte över tester som anger I<restriction>."

#. type: =head1
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:70
msgid "CONFORMING TO"
msgstr "I ENLIGHET MED"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:72
msgid "README.package-tests shipped by autopkgtest 2.7.2"
msgstr "README.package-tests levereras av autopkgtest 2.7.2"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/sadt.pod:76
msgid "B<autopkgtest>(1)"
msgstr "B<autopkgtest>(1)"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:5
msgid ""
"salsa - tool to manipulate salsa projects, repositories and group members"
msgstr ""
"salsa – verktyg för att hantera salsa-projekt, arkiv och gruppmedlemmar"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  # salsa <command> <parameters> <options>\n"
"  salsa add_user developer foobar --group-id 2665\n"
"  salsa delete_user foobar --group js-team\n"
"  salsa search_groups perl-team/modules\n"
"  salsa search_projects qa/qa\n"
"  salsa search_users yadd\n"
"  salsa update_user maintainer foobar --group js-team\n"
"  salsa whoami\n"
"  salsa checkout node-mongodb --group js-team\n"
"  salsa fork --group js-team user/node-foo\n"
"  salsa last_ci_status js-team/nodejs\n"
"  salsa pipelines js-team/nodejs\n"
"  salsa mr debian/foo debian/latest\n"
"  salsa push_repo . --group js-team --kgb --irc devscripts --tagpending\n"
"  salsa update_projects node-mongodb --group js-team --disable-kgb --desc \\\n"
"        --desc-pattern \"Package %p\"\n"
"  salsa update_safe --all --desc --desc-pattern \"Debian package %p\" \\\n"
"        --group js-team\n"
"  salsa update_watch5 debian/devscripts\n"
"  salsa update_watch5 --group js-team --all\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  # salsa <command> <parameters> <options>\n"
"  salsa add_user developer foobar --group-id 2665\n"
"  salsa delete_user foobar --group js-team\n"
"  salsa search_groups perl-team/modules\n"
"  salsa search_projects qa/qa\n"
"  salsa search_users yadd\n"
"  salsa update_user maintainer foobar --group js-team\n"
"  salsa whoami\n"
"  salsa checkout node-mongodb --group js-team\n"
"  salsa fork --group js-team user/node-foo\n"
"  salsa last_ci_status js-team/nodejs\n"
"  salsa pipelines js-team/nodejs\n"
"  salsa mr debian/foo debian/latest\n"
"  salsa push_repo . --group js-team --kgb --irc devscripts --tagpending\n"
"  salsa update_projects node-mongodb --group js-team --disable-kgb --desc \\\n"
"        --desc-pattern \"Package %p\"\n"
"  salsa update_safe --all --desc --desc-pattern \"Debian package %p\" \\\n"
"        --group js-team\n"
"  salsa update_watch5 debian/devscripts\n"
"  salsa update_watch5 --group js-team --all\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:33
msgid ""
"B<salsa> is designed to create and configure projects and repositories on "
"L<https://salsa.debian.org> as well as to manage group members."
msgstr ""
"B<salsa> är utformat för att skapa och konfigurera projekt och arkiv på "
"L<https://salsa.debian.org> samt för att hantera gruppmedlemmar."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:36
msgid ""
"A Salsa token is required, except for search* commands, and must be set in "
"command line I<(see below)>, or in your configuration file "
"I<(~/.devscripts)>:"
msgstr ""
"En Salsa-token krävs utom för search*-kommandon och måste anges på "
"kommandoraden I<(se nedan)> eller i konfigurationsfilen I<(~/.devscripts)>:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN=abcdefghi\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN=abcdefghi\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:41 ../scripts/salsa.pl:45 ../scripts/salsa.pl:590
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:619
msgid "or"
msgstr "eller"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN=`cat ~/.token`\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN=`cat ~/.token`\n"
"\n"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN_FILE=~/.dpt.conf\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  SALSA_TOKEN_FILE=~/.dpt.conf\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:49
msgid ""
"If you choose to link another file using SALSA_TOKEN_FILE, it must contain a"
" line with one of (no differences):"
msgstr ""
"Om du väljer att länka en annan fil med SALSA_TOKEN_FILE måste den innehålla"
" en rad med något av följande (inga skillnader):"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <anything>SALSA_PRIVATE_TOKEN=xxxx\n"
"  <anything>SALSA_TOKEN=xxxx\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  <anything>SALSA_PRIVATE_TOKEN=xxxx\n"
"  <anything>SALSA_TOKEN=xxxx\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:55
msgid ""
"This allows for example to use dpt(1) configuration file (~/.dpt.conf) which"
" contains:"
msgstr ""
"Detta gör det möjligt att till exempel använda dpt(1)-konfigurationsfilen "
"(~/.dpt.conf) som innehåller:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  DPT_SALSA_PRIVATE_TOKEN=abcdefghi\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  DPT_SALSA_PRIVATE_TOKEN=abcdefghi\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:62
msgid "Managing users and groups"
msgstr "Hantera användare och grupper"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:66
msgid "B<add_user>"
msgstr "B<add_user>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:68
msgid "Add a user to a group."
msgstr "Lägg till en användare till en grupp."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-group add_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 add_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 add_user maintainer 1245\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-group add_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 add_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 add_user maintainer 1245\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:74 ../scripts/salsa.pl:127
msgid ""
"First argument is the GitLab's access levels: guest, reporter, developer, "
"maintainer, owner."
msgstr ""
"Det första argumentet är en av GitLabs åtkomstnivåer: guest, reporter, "
"developer, maintainer eller owner."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:77
msgid "B<delete_user> or B<del_user>"
msgstr "B<delete_user> eller B<del_user>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:79
msgid "Remove a user from a group."
msgstr "Ta bort en användare från en grupp."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team delete_user foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id=1234 delete_user foouser\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team delete_user foouser\n"
"  salsa --group-id=1234 delete_user foouser\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:84
msgid "B<join>"
msgstr "B<join>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:86
msgid "Request access to a group."
msgstr "Begär åtkomst till en grupp."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa join js-team\n"
"  salsa join --group js-team\n"
"  salsa join --group-id 1234\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa join js-team\n"
"  salsa join --group js-team\n"
"  salsa join --group-id 1234\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:92
msgid "B<list_groups>"
msgstr "B<list_groups>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:94
msgid ""
"List the subgroups for current group if group is set, otherwise will do the "
"current user."
msgstr ""
"Lista undergrupperna för den aktuella gruppen om en grupp har angetts; "
"annars listas den aktuella användarens grupper."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:97
msgid "B<list_users> or B<group>"
msgstr "B<list_users> eller B<group>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:99
msgid ""
"List users in a subgroup.  Note, this does not include inherited or invited."
msgstr ""
"Lista användare i en undergrupp. Observera att detta inte inkluderar ärvda "
"eller inbjudna användare."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:102
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team list_users\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 list_users\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team list_users\n"
"  salsa --group-id 1234 list_users\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:105
msgid "B<search_groups>"
msgstr "B<search_groups>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:107
msgid ""
"Search for a group using given string. Shows group ID and other information."
msgstr ""
"Sök efter en grupp med hjälp av angiven sträng. Visar grupp-ID och annan "
"information."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:110
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa search_groups perl-team\n"
"  salsa search_groups perl-team/modules\n"
"  salsa search_groups 2666\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa search_groups perl-team\n"
"  salsa search_groups perl-team/modules\n"
"  salsa search_groups 2666\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:114
msgid "B<search_users>"
msgstr "B<search_users>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:116
msgid ""
"Search for a user using given string. Shows user ID and other information."
msgstr ""
"Sök efter en användare med hjälp av angiven sträng. Visar användar-ID och "
"annan information."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa search_users yadd\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa search_users yadd\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:120
msgid "B<update_user>"
msgstr "B<update_user>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:122
msgid "Update a user's role in a group."
msgstr "Uppdatera en användares roll i en grupp."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:124
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group-id 1234 update_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_user maintainer 1245\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group-id 1234 update_user guest foouser\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_user maintainer 1245\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:130
msgid "B<whoami>"
msgstr "B<whoami>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:132
msgid "Gives information on the token owner."
msgstr "Ger information om tokenägaren."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:134
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa whoami\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa whoami\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:138
msgid "Managing projects"
msgstr "Hantera projekt"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:140
msgid ""
"One of C<--group>, C<--group-id>, C<--user> or C<--user-id> is required to "
"manage projects. If both are set, salsa warns and only C<--user>/C<--user-"
"id> is used. If none is given, salsa uses current user ID I<(token owner)>."
msgstr ""
"En av C<--group>, C<--group-id>, C<--user> eller C<--user-id> krävs för att "
"hantera projekt. Om båda anges varnar salsa och använder endast "
"C<--user>/C<--user-id>. Om ingen anges använder salsa den aktuella "
"användarens ID I<(token owner)>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:147
msgid "B<check_projects> or B<check_repo>"
msgstr "B<check_projects> eller B<check_repo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:149
msgid ""
"Verify that projects are configured as expected. It works exactly like "
"B<update_projects> except that it does not modify anything but just lists "
"projects not well configured with found errors."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att projekten är konfigurerade som förväntat. Det fungerar "
"precis som B<update_projects>, men ändrar inget utan listar endast projekt "
"som inte är korrekt konfigurerade tillsammans med upptäckta fel."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:153
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts check_projects test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team check_projects --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head check_projects test1 test2 test3\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts check_projects test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team check_projects --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head check_projects test1 test2 test3\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:157
msgid "B<checkout> or B<co>"
msgstr "B<checkout> eller B<co>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:159
msgid ""
"Clone a project's repository in current directory. If the directory already "
"exists, update local repository."
msgstr ""
"Klona ett projekts arkiv i den aktuella katalogen. Om katalogen redan finns "
"uppdateras det lokala arkivet."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:162
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd checkout devscripts\n"
"  salsa --group js-team checkout node-mongodb\n"
"  salsa checkout js-team/node-mongodb\n"
"  salsa checkout https://salsa.debian.org/debian/devscripts.git\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd checkout devscripts\n"
"  salsa --group js-team checkout node-mongodb\n"
"  salsa checkout js-team/node-mongodb\n"
"  salsa checkout https://salsa.debian.org/debian/devscripts.git\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:167
msgid ""
"You can clone more than one repository or all repositories of a group or a "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan klona mer än ett arkiv eller alla arkiv i en grupp eller för en "
"användare:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:170
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd checkout devscripts autodep8\n"
"  salsa checkout yadd/devscripts js-team/npm\n"
"  salsa --group js-team checkout --all           # All js-team active repositories\n"
"  salsa checkout --all-archived                  # All your repositories, including archived\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd checkout devscripts autodep8\n"
"  salsa checkout yadd/devscripts js-team/npm\n"
"  salsa --group js-team checkout --all           # All js-team active repositories\n"
"  salsa checkout --all-archived                  # All your repositories, including archived\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:175
msgid "B<create_project> or B<create_repo>"
msgstr "B<create_project> eller B<create_repo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:177
msgid ""
"Create public empty project. If C<--group>/C<--group-id> is set, project is "
"created in group directory, else in user directory."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett offentligt tomt projekt. Om C<--group>/C<--group-id> är inställt "
"skapas projektet i gruppkatalogen, annars i användarkatalogen."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:180
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd create_project test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --kgb --irc-channel=devscripts create_project test\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd create_project test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --kgb --irc-channel=devscripts create_project test\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:183
msgid "B<delete_project> or B<del_repo>"
msgstr "B<delete_project> eller B<del_repo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:185
msgid "Delete a project."
msgstr "Ta bort ett projekt."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:187
msgid "B<fork>"
msgstr "B<fork>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:189
msgid ""
"Forks a project in group/user repository and set \"upstream\" to original "
"project. Example:"
msgstr ""
"Skapa en förgrening av ett projekt i gruppens eller användarens arkiv och "
"ange ”upstream” som det ursprungliga projektet. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:192
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  $ salsa fork js-team/node-mongodb --verbose\n"
"  ...\n"
"  salsa.pl info: node-mongodb ready in node-mongodb/\n"
"  $ cd node-mongodb\n"
"  $ git remote --verbose show\n"
"  origin          git@salsa.debian.org:me/node-mongodb (fetch)\n"
"  origin          git@salsa.debian.org:me/node-mongodb (push)\n"
"  upstream        git@salsa.debian.org:js-team/node-mongodb (fetch)\n"
"  upstream        git@salsa.debian.org:js-team/node-mongodb (push)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  $ salsa fork js-team/node-mongodb --verbose\n"
"  ...\n"
"  salsa.pl info: node-mongodb ready in node-mongodb/\n"
"  $ cd node-mongodb\n"
"  $ git remote --verbose show\n"
"  origin          git@salsa.debian.org:me/node-mongodb (fetch)\n"
"  origin          git@salsa.debian.org:me/node-mongodb (push)\n"
"  upstream        git@salsa.debian.org:js-team/node-mongodb (fetch)\n"
"  upstream        git@salsa.debian.org:js-team/node-mongodb (push)\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:202
msgid "For a group:"
msgstr "För en grupp:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:204
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa fork --group js-team user/node-foo\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa fork --group js-team user/node-foo\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:206
msgid "B<forks>"
msgstr "B<forks>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:208
msgid "List forks of project(s)."
msgstr "Lista projektets förgreningar."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:210
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa forks qa/qa debian/devscripts\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa forks qa/qa debian/devscripts\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:212 ../scripts/salsa.pl:323
msgid ""
"Project can be set using full path or using B<--group>/B<--group-id> or "
"B<--user>/B<--user-id>, else it is searched in current user namespace."
msgstr ""
"Projektet kan ställas in med hjälp av fullständig sökväg eller med hjälp av "
"B<--group>/B<--group-id> eller B<--user>/B<--user-id>, annars söks det i det"
" aktuella användarnamnsutrymmet."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:215
msgid "B<push>"
msgstr "B<push>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:217
msgid ""
"Push relevant packaging refs to origin Git remote. To be run from packaging "
"working directory."
msgstr ""
"Skicka relevanta paketeringsreferenser till Git-fjärranslutningen origin. "
"Körs från paketeringens arbetskatalog."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:220
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa push\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa push\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:222
msgid ""
"It pushes the following refs to the configured remote for the debian-branch "
"or, falling back, to the \"origin\" remote:"
msgstr ""
"Det skickar följande referenser till den konfigurerade fjärranslutningen för"
" debian-branch eller, om den saknas, till fjärranslutningen ”origin”:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:227
msgid "\"master\" branch (or whatever is set to debian-branch in gbp.conf)"
msgstr ""
"\"master\"-gren (eller vad som än är inställt på debian-branch i gbp.conf)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:229
msgid "\"upstream\" branch (or whatever is set to upstream-branch in gbp.conf)"
msgstr ""
"”upstream”-grenen (eller det som angetts för upstream-branch i gbp.conf)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:231
msgid "\"pristine-tar\" branch"
msgstr "”pristine-tar”-grenen"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:233
msgid "tags named \"debian/*\" (or whatever is set to debian-tag in gbp.conf)"
msgstr ""
"taggar med namnet \"debian/*\" (eller vad som än är inställt som debian-tag "
"i gbp.conf)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:235
msgid "tags named \"upstream/*\" (or whatever is set to upstream-tag in gbp.conf)"
msgstr ""
"taggar med namnet \"upstream/*\" (eller vad som än är inställt som upstream-"
"tag i gbp.conf)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:237
msgid "all tags, if the package's source format is \"3.0 (native)\""
msgstr "alla taggar, om paketets källformat är \"3.0 (native)\""

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:241
msgid "B<list_projects> or B<list_repos> or B<ls>"
msgstr "B<list_projects> eller B<list_repos> eller B<ls>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:243
msgid ""
"Shows projects owned by user or group. If second argument exists, search "
"only matching projects."
msgstr ""
"Visar projekt som ägs av användaren eller gruppen. Om ett andra argument "
"anges söks bara matchande projekt."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:246
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team list_projects\n"
"  salsa --user yadd list_projects foo*\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team list_projects\n"
"  salsa --user yadd list_projects foo*\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:249
msgid "B<last_ci_status>"
msgstr "B<last_ci_status>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:251
msgid ""
"Displays the last continuous integration result. Use B<--verbose> to see URL"
" of pipeline when result isn't B<success>. Unless B<--no-fail> is set, "
"B<salsa last_ci_status> will stop on first \"failed\" status."
msgstr ""
"Visar det senaste CI-resultatet. Använd B<--verbose> för att se pipeline-"
"URL:en när resultatet inte är B<success>. Om B<--no-fail> inte anges avbryts"
" B<salsa last_ci_status> vid den första statusen ”failed”."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:255
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team last_ci_status --all --no-fail\n"
"  salsa --user yadd last_ci_status foo\n"
"  salsa last_ci_status js-team/nodejs\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team last_ci_status --all --no-fail\n"
"  salsa --user yadd last_ci_status foo\n"
"  salsa last_ci_status js-team/nodejs\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:259
msgid ""
"This commands returns the number of \"failed\" status found. \"success\" "
"entries are displayed using STDOUT while other are displayed I<(with "
"details)> using STDERR. Then you can easily see only failures using:"
msgstr ""
"Det här kommandot returnerar antalet funna statusar ”failed”. Poster med "
"”success” visas på STDOUT medan övriga visas I<(med detaljer)> på STDERR. Du"
" kan sedan enkelt bara se fel med:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:263
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team last_ci_status --all --no-fail >/dev/null\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team last_ci_status --all --no-fail >/dev/null\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:265
msgid "B<pipeline_schedule> or B<schedule>"
msgstr "B<pipeline_schedule> eller B<schedule>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:267
msgid "Control pipeline schedule."
msgstr "Hantera körschemat för pipeline."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:269
msgid "B<pipeline_schedules> or B<schedules>"
msgstr "B<pipeline_schedules> eller B<schedules>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:271
msgid "Lists current pipeline schedule items."
msgstr "Visar aktuella poster i körschemat för pipeline."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:273
msgid "You can use B<--no-fail> and B<--all> options here."
msgstr "Här kan du använda flaggorna B<--no-fail> och B<--all>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:275
msgid "B<merge_request> or B<mr>"
msgstr "B<merge_request> eller B<mr>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:277
msgid "Creates a merge request."
msgstr "Skapar en sammanfogningsbegäran."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:279
msgid ""
"Suppose you created a fork using B<salsa fork>, modify some things in a new "
"branch using one commit and want to propose it to original project I<(branch"
" \"master\")>. You just have to launch this in source directory:"
msgstr ""
"Anta att du har skapat en förgrening med B<salsa fork>, ändrat något i en ny"
" gren med en incheckning och vill föreslå den för det ursprungliga projektet"
" I<(grenen ”master”)>. Du behöver bara köra detta i källkatalogen:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:283
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa merge_request\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa merge_request\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:285
msgid "Another example:"
msgstr "Ett annat exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:287
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa merge_request --mr-dst-project debian/foo --mr-dst-branch debian/latest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa merge_request --mr-dst-project debian/foo --mr-dst-branch debian/latest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:289
msgid "Or simply:"
msgstr "Eller helt enkelt:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:291
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa merge_request debian/foo debian/latest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa merge_request debian/foo debian/latest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:293
msgid ""
"Note that unless destination project has been set using command line, "
"B<salsa merge_request> will search it in the following order:"
msgstr ""
"Observera att om målprojektet inte har angetts på kommandoraden söker "
"B<salsa merge_request> efter det i följande ordning:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:298
msgid "using GitLab API: salsa will detect from where this project was forked"
msgstr "med GitLab API: salsa upptäcker varifrån projektet förgrenades"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:300
msgid "using \"upstream\" origin"
msgstr "använder ursprungsfjärranslutningen ”upstream”"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:302
msgid "else salsa will use source project as destination project"
msgstr "annars kommer salsa att använda källprojektet som målprojekt"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:306
msgid ""
"To force salsa to use source project as destination project, you can use "
"\"same\":"
msgstr ""
"För att tvinga salsa att använda källprojektet som målprojekt kan du använda"
" \"same\":"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:309
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa merge_request --mr-dst-project same\n"
"  # or\n"
"  salsa merge_request same\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa merge_request --mr-dst-project same\n"
"  # or\n"
"  salsa merge_request same\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:313
msgid ""
"New merge request will be created using last commit title and description."
msgstr ""
"En ny sammanfogningsbegäran skapas med den senaste incheckningens titel och "
"beskrivning."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:315
msgid "See B<--mr-*> options for more."
msgstr "Se B<--mr-*>-alternativen för mer information."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:317
msgid "B<merge_requests> or B<mrs>"
msgstr "B<merge_requests> eller B<mrs>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:319
msgid "List opened merge requests for project(s)."
msgstr "Lista öppna sammanfogningsbegäranden för projekt."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:321
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa merge_requests qa/qa debian/devscripts\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa merge_requests qa/qa debian/devscripts\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:326
msgid "B<protect_branch>"
msgstr "B<protect_branch>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:328
msgid "Protect/unprotect a branch."
msgstr "Skydda en gren eller ta bort dess skydd."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:332
msgid "Protect"
msgstr "Skydda"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:334
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  #                                    project      branch merge push\n"
"  salsa --group js-team protect_branch node-mongodb master m     d\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  #                                    project      branch merge push\n"
"  salsa --group js-team protect_branch node-mongodb master m     d\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:337
msgid "\"merge\" and \"push\" can be one of:"
msgstr "\"merge\" och \"push\" kan vara något av följande:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:341
msgid "B<o>, B<owner>: owner only"
msgstr "B<o>, B<owner>: endast ägare"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:343
msgid "B<m>, B<maintainer>: B<o> + maintainers allowed"
msgstr "B<m>, B<maintainer>: B<o> + maintainer tillåts"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:345
msgid "B<d>, B<developer>: B<m> + developers allowed"
msgstr "B<d>, B<developer>: B<m> + developer tillåts"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:347
msgid "B<r>, B<reporter>: B<d> + reporters allowed"
msgstr "B<r>, B<reporter>: B<d> + reporter tillåts"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:349
msgid "B<g>, B<guest>: B<r> + guest allowed"
msgstr "B<g>, B<guest>: B<r> + guest tillåts"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:353
msgid "Unprotect"
msgstr "Ta bort skyddet"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:355
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team protect_branch node-mongodb master no\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team protect_branch node-mongodb master no\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:359
msgid "B<protected_branches>"
msgstr "B<protected_branches>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:361
msgid "List protected branches:"
msgstr "Lista skyddade grenar:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:363
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group js-team protected_branches node-mongodb\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group js-team protected_branches node-mongodb\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:365
msgid "B<push_repo>"
msgstr "B<push_repo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:367
msgid ""
"Create a new project from a local Debian source directory configured with "
"git."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett nytt projekt från en lokal Debian-källkatalog konfigurerad med "
"git."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:370
msgid "B<push_repo> executes the following steps:"
msgstr "B<push_repo> utför följande steg:"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:374
msgid "gets project name using debian/changelog file;"
msgstr "hämtar projektnamnet från filen debian/changelog;"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:376
msgid "launches B<git remote add upstream ...>;"
msgstr "kör B<git remote add upstream ...>;"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:378
msgid "launches B<create_project>;"
msgstr "kör B<create_project>;"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:380
msgid "pushes local repository."
msgstr "skickar upp det lokala arkivet."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:386
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd push_repo ./test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --kgb --irc-channel=devscripts push_repo .\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd push_repo ./test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --kgb --irc-channel=devscripts push_repo .\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:389
msgid "B<rename_branch>"
msgstr "B<rename_branch>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:391
msgid ""
"Rename branch given in B<--source-branch> with name given in B<--dest-"
"branch>.  You can use B<--no-fail>, B<--all> and B<--all-archived> options "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Byt namn på grenen som anges i B<--source-branch> till namnet som anges i "
"B<--dest-branch>.  Här kan du använda alternativen B<--no-fail>, B<--all> "
"och B<--all-archived>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:394
msgid "B<rename_branches>"
msgstr "B<rename_branches>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:396
msgid ""
"Rename several branches at once in a given project.  The first argument is "
"the project name, followed by branch mappings.  The default branch is "
"detected automatically and updated if renamed."
msgstr ""
"Byt namn på flera grenar samtidigt i ett visst projekt. Det första "
"argumentet är projektnamnet, följt av grenmappningar. Standardgrenen "
"detekteras automatiskt och uppdateras om den byter namn."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:400
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa rename_branches my-project master:debian/latest debian/master:debian/unstable\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa rename_branches my-project master:debian/latest debian/master:debian/unstable\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:402
msgid ""
"You can use B<--no-wait> to avoid waiting for the changes to be reflected on"
" the server, and B<--no-fail> to continue even if a branch rename fails."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda B<--no-wait> för att slippa vänta på att ändringarna ska "
"återspeglas på servern, och B<--no-fail> för att fortsätta även om ett "
"namnbyte av en gren misslyckas."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:405
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa rename_branches --no-wait --no-fail my-project master:debian/latest\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa rename_branches --no-wait --no-fail my-project master:debian/latest\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:407
msgid "You can use B<--dep14> to use DEP-14 default branch mappings."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda B<--dep14> för att använda DEP-14-standardgrenmappningar."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:409
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa rename_branches --dep14 my-project\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa rename_branches --dep14 my-project\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:411
msgid "B<file>"
msgstr "B<file>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:413
msgid "Manipulate repository files on Salsa."
msgstr "Hantera arkivfiler på Salsa."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:415
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file <get|create|edit|delete|create_or_edit> <project_name> <file_path> [options]\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file <get|create|edit|delete|create_or_edit> <project_name> <file_path> [options]\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:419
msgid "B<get>"
msgstr "B<get>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:421
msgid "Retrieves the content of a file from a repository."
msgstr "Hämtar innehållet i en fil från ett arkiv."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:423
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file get my-project README.md --ref my-branch\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file get my-project README.md --ref my-branch\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:425
msgid "B<create>"
msgstr "B<create>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:427
msgid "Creates a new file in a repository."
msgstr "Skapar en ny fil i ett arkiv."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:429
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file create my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Add README\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file create my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Add README\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:431
msgid "B<edit>"
msgstr "B<edit>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:433
msgid "Edits an existing file in a repository."
msgstr "Redigerar en befintlig fil i ett arkiv."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:435
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file edit my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Update README\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file edit my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Update README\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:437
msgid "B<delete>"
msgstr "B<delete>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:439
msgid "Deletes a file from a repository."
msgstr "Tar bort en fil från ett arkiv."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:441
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file delete my-project README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Remove README\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file delete my-project README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Remove README\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:443
msgid "B<create_or_edit>"
msgstr "B<create_or_edit>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:445
msgid "Creates a new file or edits an existing file in a repository."
msgstr "Skapar en ny fil eller redigerar en befintlig fil i ett arkiv."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:447
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa file create_or_edit my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Update README\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa file create_or_edit my-project README.md --content-from-file path/to/README.md --branch my-branch --commit-message \"Update README\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:451
msgid "B<search_projects> or B<search_repo> or B<search>"
msgstr "B<search_projects> eller B<search_repo> eller B<search>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:453
msgid ""
"Search for a project using given string. Shows name, owner ID and other "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Sök efter ett projekt med hjälp av angiven sträng. Visar namn, ägar-ID och "
"annan information."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:456
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa search_projects devscripts\n"
"  salsa search_projects debian/devscripts\n"
"  salsa search_projects 18475\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa search_projects devscripts\n"
"  salsa search_projects debian/devscripts\n"
"  salsa search_projects 18475\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:460
msgid "B<update_projects> or B<update_repo>"
msgstr "B<update_projects> eller B<update_repo>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:462
msgid ""
"Configure projects using parameters given to command line.  A project name "
"has to be given unless B<--all> or B<--all-archived> is set. Prefer to use "
"B<update_safe>."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera projekt med parametrar som anges på kommandoraden. Ett "
"projektnamn måste anges om inte B<--all> eller B<--all-archived> används. "
"Använd helst B<update_safe>."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:466
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts update_projects test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_projects --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head update_projects test1 test2 test3\n"
"  salsa update_projects js-team/node-mongodb --kgb --irc debian-js\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts update_projects test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_projects --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head update_projects test1 test2 test3\n"
"  salsa update_projects js-team/node-mongodb --kgb --irc debian-js\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:471
msgid ""
"By default when using B<--all>, salsa will fail on first error. If you want "
"to continue, set B<--no-fail>. In this case, salsa will display a warning "
"for each project that has fail but continue with next project. Then to see "
"full errors, set B<--verbose>."
msgstr ""
"Som standard avbryts salsa vid det första felet när B<--all> används. Om du "
"vill fortsätta, ange B<--no-fail>. I så fall visar salsa en varning för "
"varje projekt med fel men fortsätter med nästa projekt. Ange sedan "
"B<--verbose> för att se fullständiga felmeddelanden."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:476
msgid "B<update_safe>"
msgstr "B<update_safe>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:478
msgid ""
"Launch B<check_projects> and ask before launching B<update_projects> (unless"
" B<--yes>)."
msgstr ""
"Starta B<check_projects> och fråga innan du startar B<update_projects> (om "
"inte B<--yes>)."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:480
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts update_safe test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_safe --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head update_safe test1 test2 test3\n"
"  salsa update_safe js-team/node-mongodb --kgb --irc debian-js\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --user yadd --tagpending --kgb --irc=devscripts update_safe test\n"
"  salsa --group js-team update_safe --all\n"
"  salsa --group js-team --rename-head update_safe test1 test2 test3\n"
"  salsa update_safe js-team/node-mongodb --kgb --irc debian-js\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:485
msgid "B<update_watch5>"
msgstr "B<update_watch5>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:487
msgid ""
"Update C<debian/watch> file for each given project to L<version 5|debian-"
"watch(5)>."
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera filen C<debian/watch> för varje givet projekt till L<version "
"5|debian-watch(5)>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:489
msgid "Options B<--all> and B<--debian-branch> are usable here."
msgstr "Alternativen B<--all> och B<--debian-branch> kan användas här."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:491
msgid "B<update_gbp_conf>"
msgstr "B<update_gbp_conf>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:493
msgid ""
"Update debian/gbp.conf with the branches discovered on the server.  The "
"first argument is the project name."
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera debian/gbp.conf med de grenar som upptäckts på servern. Det första"
" argumentet är projektnamnet."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:496
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa update_gbp_conf my-project\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa update_gbp_conf my-project\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:500
msgid "Little subcommand to get salsa path from a local git repo:"
msgstr ""
"Litet underkommando för att hämta Salsa-sökvägen från ett lokalt Git-arkiv:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:502
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa path\n"
"  salsa path ./directory\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa path\n"
"  salsa path ./directory\n"
"\n"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:507
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Annat"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:511
msgid "B<purge_cache>"
msgstr "B<purge_cache>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:513
msgid "Empty local cache."
msgstr "Töm den lokala cachen."

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:519
msgid "General options"
msgstr "Allmänna alternativ"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:523
msgid "B<--chdir> or B<-C>"
msgstr "B<--chdir> eller B<-C>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:525
msgid "Change directory before launching command:"
msgstr "Byt katalog innan du startar kommandot:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:527
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --chdir ~/debian checkout debian/libapache2-mod-fcgid\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --chdir ~/debian checkout debian/libapache2-mod-fcgid\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:529
msgid "B<--cache-file>"
msgstr "B<--cache-file>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:531
msgid ""
"File to store cached values. An empty value disables cache.  Default: "
"C<~/.cache/salsa.json>."
msgstr ""
"Fil för att lagra cachade värden. Ett tomt värde inaktiverar cachen. "
"Standard: C<~/.cache/salsa.json>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:534
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_CACHE_FILE>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_CACHE_FILE>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:538
msgid "Disable cache usage. Same as B<--cache-file ''>"
msgstr "Inaktivera cacheanvändning. Samma som B<--cache-file ''>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:540
msgid "B<--conf-file> or B<--conffile>"
msgstr "B<--conf-file> eller B<--conffile>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:542
msgid ""
"Add or replace default configuration files.  This can only be used as the "
"first option given on the command-line.  Default: C</etc/devscripts.conf> "
"and C<~/.devscripts>."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till eller ersätt standardkonfigurationsfiler. Detta kan endast "
"användas som det första alternativet som anges på kommandoraden. Standard: "
"C</etc/devscripts.conf> och C<~/.devscripts>."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:549 ../scripts/uscan.pl:282
msgid "replace:"
msgstr "ersätt:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:551
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --conf-file test.conf <command>...\n"
"  salsa --conf-file test.conf --conf-file test2.conf  <command>...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --conf-file test.conf <command>...\n"
"  salsa --conf-file test.conf --conf-file test2.conf  <command>...\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:554 ../scripts/uscan.pl:286
msgid "add:"
msgstr "lägg till:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:556
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --conf-file +test.conf <command>...\n"
"  salsa --conf-file +test.conf --conf-file +test2.conf  <command>...\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --conf-file +test.conf <command>...\n"
"  salsa --conf-file +test.conf --conf-file +test2.conf  <command>...\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:559 ../scripts/uscan.pl:290
msgid ""
"If one B<--conf-file> has no C<+>, default configuration files are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Om en B<--conf-file> inte har någon C<+>, ignoreras "
"standardkonfigurationsfilerna."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:563
msgid "B<--no-conf> or B<--noconf>"
msgstr "B<--no-conf> eller B<--noconf>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:565 ../scripts/uscan.pl:296
msgid ""
"Don't read any configuration files. This can only be used as the first "
"option given on the command-line."
msgstr ""
"Läs inga konfigurationsfiler. Detta kan endast användas som det första "
"alternativet som anges på kommandoraden."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:570
msgid "Enable debugging output."
msgstr "Aktivera felsökningsutdata."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:572
msgid "B<--group>"
msgstr "B<--group>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:574
msgid "Team to use. Use C<salsa search_groups name> to find it."
msgstr ""
"Teamet som ska användas. Använd C<salsa search_groups name> för att hitta "
"det."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:576
msgid "If you want to use a subgroup, you have to set its full path:"
msgstr ""
"Om du vill använda en undergrupp måste du ange dess fullständiga sökväg:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:578
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa --group perl-team/modules/packages check_projects lemonldap-ng\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa --group perl-team/modules/packages check_projects lemonldap-ng\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:580
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_GROUP>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_GROUP>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:582
msgid ""
"Be careful when you use B<SALSA_GROUP> in your C<.devscripts> file. Every "
"B<salsa> command will be executed in group space, for example if you want to"
" propose a little change in a project using B<salsa fork> + B<salsa "
"merge_request>, this \"fork\" will be done in group space unless you set a "
"B<--user>/B<--user-id>.  Prefer to use an alias in your C<.bashrc> file. "
"Example:"
msgstr ""
"Var försiktig när du använder B<SALSA_GROUP> i filen C<.devscripts>. Varje "
"B<salsa>-kommando körs i gruppnamnrymden. Om du till exempel vill föreslå en"
" liten ändring i ett projekt med B<salsa fork> + B<salsa merge_request>, "
"görs denna ”förgrening” i gruppnamnrymden om du inte anger "
"B<--user>/B<--user-id>. Använd helst ett alias i filen C<.bashrc>. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:588
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --group js-team\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --group js-team\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:592 ../scripts/salsa.pl:621
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --conf-file ~/.js.conf\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --conf-file ~/.js.conf\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:594
msgid "or to use both .devscripts and .js.conf:"
msgstr "eller att använda både .devscripts och .js.conf:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:596
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --conf-file +~/.js.conf\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --conf-file +~/.js.conf\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:598
msgid "then you can fix B<SALSA_GROUP> in C<~/.js.conf>"
msgstr "då kan du ange B<SALSA_GROUP> i C<~/.js.conf>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:600
msgid ""
"To enable bash completion for your alias, add this in your .bashrc file:"
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera bash-komplettering för ditt alias, lägg till detta i din "
".bashrc-fil:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:602
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  _completion_loader salsa\n"
"  complete -F _salsa_completion jsteam_admin\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  _completion_loader salsa\n"
"  complete -F _salsa_completion jsteam_admin\n"
"\n"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:605
msgid "B<--group-id>"
msgstr "B<--group-id>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:607
msgid "Group ID to use. Use C<salsa search_groups name> to find it."
msgstr ""
"Grupp-ID som ska användas. Använd C<salsa search_groups name> för att hitta "
"det."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:609
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_GROUP_ID>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_GROUP_ID>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:611
msgid ""
"Be careful when you use B<SALSA_GROUP_ID> in your C<.devscripts> file. Every"
" B<salsa> command will be executed in group space, for example if you want "
"to propose a little change in a project using B<salsa fork> + B<salsa "
"merge_request>, this \"fork\" will be done in group space unless you set a "
"B<--user>/B<--user-id>.  Prefer to use an alias in your C<.bashrc> file. "
"Example:"
msgstr ""
"Var försiktig när du använder B<SALSA_GROUP_ID> i filen C<.devscripts>. "
"Varje B<salsa>-kommando körs i gruppnamnrymden. Om du till exempel vill "
"föreslå en liten ändring i ett projekt med B<salsa fork> + B<salsa "
"merge_request>, görs denna ”förgrening” i gruppnamnrymden om du inte anger "
"B<--user>/B<--user-id>. Använd helst ett alias i filen C<.bashrc>. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:617
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --group-id 2666\"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  alias jsteam_admin=\"salsa --group-id 2666\"\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:623
msgid "then you can fix B<SALSA_GROUP_ID> in C<~/.js.conf>."
msgstr "då kan du ange B<SALSA_GROUP_ID> i C<~/.js.conf>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:627
msgid "Displays this manpage."
msgstr "Visar denna manual."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:629
msgid "B<--info> or B<-i>"
msgstr "B<--info> eller B<-i>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:631
msgid "Prompt before sensible changes."
msgstr "Fråga före betydelsefulla ändringar."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:633
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_INFO> (yes/no)"
msgstr "C<.devscripts>-värde: B<SALSA_INFO> (yes/no)"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:635
msgid "B<--path>"
msgstr "B<--path>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:637
msgid "Repository path.  Default to group or user path."
msgstr "Arkivsökväg. Standard är gruppens eller användarens sökväg."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:640
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_REPO_PATH>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_REPO_PATH>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:642
msgid "B<--token>"
msgstr "B<--token>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:644
msgid "Token value (see above)."
msgstr "Tokenvärde (se ovan)."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:646
msgid "B<--token-file>"
msgstr "B<--token-file>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:648
msgid "File to find token (see above)."
msgstr "Fil där token hittas (se ovan)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:652
msgid ""
"Username to use. If neither B<--group>, B<--group-id>, B<--user> or "
"B<--user-id> is set, salsa uses current user ID (corresponding to salsa "
"private token)."
msgstr ""
"Användarnamn som ska användas. Om varken B<--group>, B<--group-id>, "
"B<--user> eller B<--user-id> anges använder salsa den aktuella användarens "
"ID (som motsvarar den privata Salsa-token)."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:655
msgid "B<--user-id>"
msgstr "B<--user-id>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:657
msgid ""
"User ID to use. Use C<salsa search_users name> to find one. If neither "
"B<--group>, B<--group-id>, B<--user> or B<--user-id> is set, salsa uses "
"current user ID (corresponding to salsa private token)."
msgstr ""
"Användar-ID som ska användas. Använd C<salsa search_users name> för att "
"hitta ett. Om varken B<--group>, B<--group-id>, B<--user> eller B<--user-id>"
" anges använder salsa den aktuella användarens ID (som motsvarar den privata"
" Salsa-token)."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:661
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_USER_ID>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_USER_ID>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:665
msgid "Enable verbose output."
msgstr "Aktivera detaljerad utdata."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:667
msgid "B<--yes>"
msgstr "B<--yes>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:669
msgid "Never ask for consent."
msgstr "Fråga aldrig om bekräftelse."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:671
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_YES> (yes/no)"
msgstr "C<.devscripts>-värde: B<SALSA_YES> (yes/no)"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:675
msgid "List/search project options"
msgstr "Alternativ för att lista och söka projekt"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:679
msgid "B<--archived>, B<--no-archived>"
msgstr "B<--archived>, B<--no-archived>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:681
msgid ""
"Instead of looking to active projects, list or search in archived projects."
"  Note that you can't have both archived and unarchived projects in the same"
" request.  Default: no I<(ie --no-archived)>."
msgstr ""
"I stället för att söka bland aktiva projekt kan du lista eller söka bland "
"arkiverade projekt. Observera att du inte kan ha både arkiverade och "
"oarkiverade projekt i samma begäran. Standard: no I<(det vill säga --no-"
"archived)>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:686
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_ARCHIVED> (yes/no)"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_ARCHIVED> (ja/nej)"

#. type: =head2
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:690
msgid "Update/create project options"
msgstr "Alternativ för att uppdatera och skapa projekt"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:694
msgid "B<--all>, B<--all-archived>"
msgstr "B<--all>, B<--all-archived>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:696
msgid ""
"When set, all projects of group/user are affected by command.  B<--all> will"
" filter all active projects, whereas B<--all-archived> will include active "
"and archived projects."
msgstr ""
"När det anges påverkas gruppens eller användarens alla projekt av kommandot."
" B<--all> filtrerar fram alla aktiva projekt, medan B<--all-archived> "
"inkluderar aktiva och arkiverade projekt."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:702
msgid "B<--skip>, B<--no-skip>"
msgstr "B<--skip>, B<--no-skip>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:704
msgid "Ignore project with B<--all> or B<--all-achived>. Example:"
msgstr "Ignorera projekt med B<--all> eller B<--all-achived>. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:706
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa update_projects --tagpending --all --skip qa --skip devscripts\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa update_projects --tagpending --all --skip qa --skip devscripts\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:708
msgid "To set multiples values, use spaces. Example:"
msgstr "Använd mellanslag för att ange flera värden. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:710
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  SALSA_SKIP=qa devscripts\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  SALSA_SKIP=qa devscripts\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:712
msgid ""
"Using B<--no-skip> will ignore any projects to be skipped and include them."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder B<--no-skip> ignoreras alla projekt som ska hoppas över och "
"inkluderas istället."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:714
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_SKIP>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_SKIP>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:716
msgid "B<--skip-file>"
msgstr "B<--skip-file>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:718
msgid "Ignore projects in this file (1 project per line)."
msgstr "Ignorera projekt i den här filen (1 projekt per rad)."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:720
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa update_projects --tagpending --all --skip-file ~/.skip\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa update_projects --tagpending --all --skip-file ~/.skip\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:722
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_SKIP_FILE>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_SKIP_FILE>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:726
msgid "B<--build-timeout>"
msgstr "B<--build-timeout>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:728
msgid ""
"The maximum amount of time, in seconds, that a job can run.  Default: 3600 "
"(60 minutes)."
msgstr ""
"Den maximala tiden, i sekunder, som ett jobb kan köras. Standard: 3600 (60 "
"minuter)."

#. type: verbatim
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:731
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  salsa update_safe myrepo --build-timeout 3600\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"  salsa update_safe myrepo --build-timeout 3600\n"
"\n"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:733
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_BUILD_TIMEOUT>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_BUILD_TIMEOUT>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:735
msgid "B<--avatar-path>"
msgstr "B<--avatar-path>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:737
msgid ""
"Path to an image for the project's avatar.  If path value contains \"%p\", "
"it is replaced by project name."
msgstr ""
"Sökväg till en bild för projektets avatar. Om sökvägsvärdet innehåller "
"\"%p\" ersätts det med projektnamnet."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:740
msgid "C<.devscripts> value: B<SALSA_AVATAR_PATH>"
msgstr "C<.devscripts> värde: B<SALSA_AVATAR_PATH>"

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:742
msgid "B<--ci-config-path>"
msgstr "B<--ci-config-path>"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/salsa.pl:744
msgid ""
"Configure configuration file path of GitLab CI.  Default: empty.  Example:"
msgstr ""
"Ange sökvägen till GitLab CI-konfigurationsfilen. Standard: tom. Exempel:"

#. type: verbatim
